return ['domain'=>'page-builder-sandwich','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'so_SO','project-id-version'=>'page-builder-sandwich','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-10-02T01:26:25+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-10-02T01:26:25+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Page Builder Sandwich'=>'Page Builder Sandwich','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/page-builder-sandwich'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/page-builder-sandwich','The foundation release of the rebuilt Page Builder Sandwich: a settings and About screen, a footprint-free front-end output layer, and one sample content block.'=>'Siideyntii aasaaska ee dib-u-dhiska Page Builder Sandwich: shaashad habeysan iyo mid kusaabsan (About), lakabka soo-saarka hore oo aan lahayn raad-raac (footprint-free), iyo hal baloog oo tusaale ah oo nuxurka ah.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Zinn Digital® answered, but not with a connection this plugin understands. Nothing was saved.'=>'Zinn Digital® way ka jawaabtay, laakiin ma aha xiriir uu fur-galkani fahmayo. Waxba lama kaydin.','This site has forgotten its connection. Zinn Digital® could not be told just now, so support staff will see it as unused until it is removed on their side.'=>'Boggani wuxuu illoobay xiriirkiisii. Zinn Digital® hadda lama ogeysiin karin, sidaas darteed shaqaalaha taageeradu waxay u arki doonaan mid aan la isticmaalin ilaa laga saaro dhankooda.','The Zinn Digital® address this site is set to use is not a secure (https) address, so nothing was sent.'=>'Cinwaanka Zinn Digital® ee boggani u habaysan yahay inuu isticmaalo ma aha cinwaan ammaan ah (https), sidaas darteed waxba lama dirin.','Zinn Digital® could not be reached from this site. Check that the site can make outgoing connections, then try again.'=>'Lagama heli karin Zinn Digital® goobtan. Hubi in goobtu samayn karto xiriirro dibadda u baxaya, ka dibna mar kale isku day.','This site\'s connection to Zinn Digital® was revoked. Connect it again to continue.'=>'Xiriirkii goobtan ee Zinn Digital® waa la joojiyay. Mar kale ku xir si aad u sii wadato.','Zinn Digital® no longer recognises this site\'s connection. Connect it again to continue.'=>'Zinn Digital® mar dambe ma aqoonsana xiriirinta goobtan. Mar kale ku xir si aad u sii wadato.','Too many requests were sent from this site or address. Wait a little, then try again.'=>'Codsiyo aad u badan ayaa laga soo diray boggan ama cinwaankan. Sug wax yar, ka dibna mar kale isku day.','Zinn Digital® could not accept this request. Check the email address and the message, then try again.'=>'Zinn Digital® ma aqbali karin codsigan. Hubi cinwaanka iimaylka iyo farriinta, ka dibna mar kale isku day.','Zinn Digital® could not handle the request just now. Try again in a few minutes.'=>'Zinn Digital® ma awoodin inuu hadda maareeyo codsiga. Fadlan isku day mar kale dhowr daqiiqo ka dib.','This temporary support access has expired.'=>'Muddada gelitaanka taageerada ku meel gaarka ah way dhacday.','The licensing service is not available on this site.'=>'Adeegga shatiga lagama heli karo boggan.','The trial could not be started here. Continue on the trial page instead.'=>'Tijaabada halkan lagama bilaabi karin. Halkii taa, ka sii wad bogga tijaabada.','Pages saved as standard WordPress blocks'=>'Bogag loo keydiyay sidii baloogyada caadiga ah ee WordPress','Sandwich Studio: a full-screen visual editor'=>'Sandwich Studio: tifatire muuqaal ah oo shaashad buuxda ah','Works inside the normal block editor too'=>'Waxay sidoo kale ka dhex shaqeysaa tifaftiraha caadiga ah ee baloogga','Automatic upgrade of old Page Builder Sandwich pages'=>'Casriyeynta tooska ah ee boggagii hore ee Page Builder Sandwich','Import from Elementor, Divi, Beaver Builder and WPBakery'=>'Ka soo dhoofso Elementor, Divi, Beaver Builder iyo WPBakery','Latest WordPress and PHP, tested every release'=>'Noocyadii ugu dambeeyay ee WordPress iyo PHP, oo la tijaabiyay siideyn kasta','Security by design'=>'Amniga qaab-dhismeedka','Translated into 58 languages, right-to-left ready'=>'Waxa loo turjumay 58 luqadood, diyaar u ah midig-ilaa-bidix','Loads only what each page uses'=>'Waxay soo shubtaa kaliya waxa bog kasta isticmaalo','One small generated stylesheet per page'=>'Hal xaashi qaab-dhismeed oo yar oo la soo saaray bog kasta','No jQuery, modern lightweight scripts'=>'Ma jiro jQuery, qoraallo casri ah oo fudud','Layout-shift guard'=>'Ilaalada leexashada qaabeynta','Automatic main-image priority'=>'Mudnaanta tooska ah ee sawirka weyn','Google Fonts hosted on your own site'=>'Google Fonts oo lagu martigeliyay boggaaga gaarka ah','Performance score in the editor'=>'Dhibcaha waxqabadka ee tifaftiraha','Critical CSS for the top of the page'=>'CSS-ka muhiimka ah ee qaybta sare ee bogga','Clean, light HTML'=>'HTML nadiif ah, fudud','Works with Yoast, Rank Math, SEOPress and All in One SEO'=>'Waxay la shaqeysaa Yoast, Rank Math, SEOPress iyo All in One SEO','Schema markup blocks'=>'Baloogyada calaamadaynta Schema','Compatible with caching plugins'=>'La jaanqaadaya furayaasha kaydinta ku-meel-gaarka ah','Flexbox and CSS Grid containers'=>'Weelasha Flexbox iyo CSS Grid','Three built-in breakpoints'=>'Saddex dhibcood oo gudaha ku dhisan','Custom breakpoints'=>'Barta joogsiga gaarka ah','Global colours and fonts, shared with your theme'=>'Midabbada iyo farta guud, ee lala wadaago mawduucaaga','Global classes and CSS variables'=>'Fasallada guud iyo doorsoomayaasha CSS','Design tokens: spacing, radius and shadow scales'=>'Calaamadaha naqshadda: cabbirrada kala-fogaanshaha, qallooca iyo hadhka','Copy and paste styles between elements and sites'=>'Koobiye oo ku dheji qaababka inta u dhexeysa walxaha iyo boggaga','Custom CSS per element and per page'=>'CSS gaar ah waliba iyo bog kasta','Dark mode for your website'=>'Habka madow ee boggaaga internetka','Brand kit'=>'Xirmada astaanta','Essential