upport'=>'Shatiyeynta iyo taageerada','Hosting built for fast, multilingual WordPress'=>'Martigelinta loo dhisay WordPress dhakhso badan oo luuqado badan leh','Managed WordPress hosting from the team that makes this plugin, tuned for speed and for sites in many languages.'=>'Martigelinta WordPress ee la maareeyay oo ka timid kooxda samaysay balaaginkan, loo habeeyay xawaare iyo mareegaha luuqadaha badan leh.','See Zinn Digital® hosting'=>'Eeg martigelinta Zinn Digital®','Hire a WordPress expert on ZinnHub'=>'Kala kireyso khabiir WordPress barta ZinnHub','A freelance marketplace for WordPress design, development, translation and SEO work.'=>'Suuq madax-bannaan oo loogu talagalay naqshadaynta, horumarinta, tarjumaadda iyo shaqada SEO ee WordPress.','Visit ZinnHub'=>'Booqo ZinnHub','Bulk site and PBN hosting'=>'Martigelinta goobaha badan iyo PBN','PBN.ltd is our platform for hosting and managing many sites at once.'=>'PBN.ltd waa madalkeena martigelinta iyo maareynta bogag badan hal mar.','Visit PBN.ltd'=>'Booqo PBN.ltd','Get Page Builder Sandwich Pro and Tranzly Pro together'=>'Ku hel Page Builder Sandwich Pro iyo Tranzly Pro si wadajir ah','The bundle costs less than buying both plugins separately, on the same plans and site limits.'=>'Xidhmadu waxay ka qiimo jaban tahay iibsashada labada furin si gooni-gooni ah, iyadoo la adeegsanayo isla qorshooyinka iyo xaddidaadaha goobta.','See the bundle'=>'Eeg xidhmada','Get %s'=>'Hel %s','Integration active: %1$s and %2$s work together'=>'Isku-xirku wuu shaqaynayaa: %1$s iyo %2$s way wada shaqaynayaan','%s is active on this site, so both plugins share one set of AI provider keys and one settings screen for them.'=>'%s wuxuu ka shaqaynayaa boggan, markaa labada furinba (plugins) waxay wadaagayaan hal qayb oo ah furayaasha bixiyaha AI iyo hal shaashad habayneed oo loogu talagalay.','Translate this site with Tranzly'=>'Ku turjun goobtan Tranzly','Build pages visually with Page Builder Sandwich'=>'Ku dhis bogagga muuqaal ahaan Page Builder Sandwich','%s, from Zinn Digital®'=>'%s, ka socota Zinn Digital®','Publish every page in many languages, with translated addresses, SEO data and a language switcher. Works with the pages you build here.'=>'Ku daabac bog kasta luuqado badan, adigoo wata cinwaanno la turjumay, xogta SEO iyo badelaha luuqadda. Waxay la shaqeysaa boggaga aad halkan ku dhisto.','Design pages right in the editor with fast, footprint-free blocks. Everything you build translates with Tranzly.'=>'Ku naqshadee boggaga toos gudaha tafatiraha adigoo isticmaalaya baloocyo degdeg ah oo aan raad lahayn. Wax kasta oo aad dhisto waxaa lagu turjumayaa Tranzly.','%s is made by the same team and works alongside this plugin.'=>'%s waxaa sameeyay isla kooxdaas waxayna la shaqeysaa furahan.','Agree to connecting this site first.'=>'Marka hore ogolow ku xiridda boggan.','Enter a valid e-mail address.'=>'Geli cinwaan iimayl oo sax ah.','Agree to sending support information first.'=>'Marka hore ogolow dirista macluumaadka caawinta.','Write a subject and a message.'=>'Qor cinwaan iyo fariin.','Enter an e-mail address support can reply to.'=>'Geli cinwaanka iimaylka ee taageeradu kaga jawaabi karto.','AI providers'=>'Bixiyeyaasha AI','The makers of ChatGPT. A good all-rounder.'=>'Sameeyayaasha ChatGPT. Qalab dhinac kasta ku wanaagsan.','The makers of Claude. Strong at writing and careful reasoning.'=>'Sameeyayaasha Claude. Ku fiican wax qorista iyo sababeynta taxaddarka leh.','Google\'s Gemini models. Fast and inexpensive.'=>'Moodallada Gemini ee Google. Degdeg ah oo aan qaali ahayn.','A European AI company with fast, inexpensive models.'=>'Shirkad AI oo Yurub ah oo leh moodallo degdeg ah oo jaban.','Low-cost models that are good at writing and code.'=>'Moodello qiimahoodu jaban yahay oo ku fiican qoraalka iyo koodhka.','One key for models from many different providers.'=>'Hal fure oo loogu talagalay moodallada ka socda bixiyeyaal badan oo kala duwan.','Any service that works like OpenAI\'s API, including a model running on your own computer or server.'=>'Adeeg kasta oo u shaqeeya sida OpenAI API, oo ay ku jiraan nooc ka shaqaynaya kombiyuutarkaaga ama seerfarkaaga.','General (used when nothing more specific is set)'=>'Guud (waxaa la adeegsadaa marka aan wax ka sii gaar ah la dejin)','Writing and rewriting'=>'Qoridda iyo dib-u-qoridda','Translation'=>'Turjumaad','Code and CSS'=>'Koodhka iyo CSS','Sorry, you are not allowed to access this page.'=>'Waan ka xunnahay, laguu ma oggola inaad gasho boggan.','These settings are shared by every plugin that uses them: %s.'=>'Hagaajintan waxaa wadaaga fur-in kasta oo isticmaala: %s.','Your keys are encrypted in this site\'s database and are only ever sent to the provider you chose — never to us.'=>'Furayaashaada waxaa lagu xafiday xog-ururinta boggan waxaana loo diraa oo keliya bixiyaha aad dooratay — waligeed naloo ma soo diro.','Step 1 of 2: choose an AI provider'=>'Talaabada 1 ee 2: dooro bixiye AI','You bring your own key, so you pay the provider directly for what you use. Not sure? Any of these works well; you can add more later.'=>'Waxaad keenaysaa furahaaga gaarka ah, markaa waxaad bixiyaha si toos ah lacag ugu bixinaysaa waxa aad isticmaasho. Ma hubtid? Kuwan midkoodna si fiican ayuu u shaqeeyaa; waxaad ku dari kartaa kuwo kale hadhow.','Next'=>'Xiga','Step 2 of 2: connect %s'=>'Tallaabada 2 ee 2: ku xidh %s','Enter the address of your OpenAI-compatible service, ending in /v1. A key is only needed if the service asks for one.'=>'Geli cinwaanka adeeggaaga la jaanqaadi kara OpenAI, ee ku dhammaanaya /v1. Fure waxaa loo baahan yahay oo keliya haddii adeeggu uu mid codsado.','Open %s and sign in (or create a free account).'=>'Fur %s oo gal (ama sameyso akoon bilaash ah).','the %s API keys page'=>'bogga furayaasha API ee %s','Create a new key and copy it.'=>'Samee fure cusub oo koobiyeey.','Paste it below and press "Save and test". We send one tiny request to check it works.'=>'Hoos ku dheji oo taabo "Keydi oo tijaabi". Waxaan direynaa hal codsi oo yar si aan u hubinno inuu shaqeynayo.','Most providers need a little credit on the account before a key works: %s.'=>'Bixiyeyaasha badankoodu waxay u baahan yihiin xoogaa lacag ah oo ku jirta akoonka ka hor inta aanu furuhu shaqeynin: %s.','add credit'=>'Ku dar dhibco','← Choose a different provider'=>'← Dooro adeeg-bixiye kale','Address'=>'Cinwaanka','Saved key ends in …%s — paste a new one to replace it'=>'Furaha la keydiyay wuxuu ku dhamaanayaa …%s — ku dheji mid cusub si aad ugu beddesho','Key (optional)'=>'Fure (ikhtiyaari)','API key'=>'Furaha API','Save and test'=>'Kaydi oo tijaabi','Providers'=>'Bixiyeyaasha','Provider'=>'Bixiye','Status'=>'Xaaladda','Key'=>'Fure','Get a key'=>'Hel fure','Test'=>'Tijaabi','Remove'=>'Ka saar','Saved by a newer plugin version: update this plugin, or enter the key again.'=>'Waxaa keydiyay nooc ka cusub fur-hayeha (plugin): cusbooneysii fur-hayehan, ama mar kale geli furaha.','The saved key can no longer be opened (the site\'s security keys changed). Enter it again.'=>'Furaha la keydiyay dib dambe looma furi karo (furayaasha amniga ee goobta ayaa isbeddelay). Dib u geli.','Not connected'=>'Kuma xirna','Connected — last test passed %s'=>'Waa ku xidhan yahay — tijaabadii ugu dambaysay waxay guulaysatay %s','Last test failed: %s'=>'Tijaabadii ugu dambeysay waa fashilantay: %s','Connected — not tested yet'=>'Ku xiran — weli lama tijaabin','Which model to use'=>'Qaabkee la isticmaalayaa','★ marks our recommendation for that task. The list includes every model your key can use, read live from the provider.'=>'★ waxay muujinaysaa taladayada hawshaas ku saabsan. Liisku wuxuu ka kooban yahay nooc kasta oo furahaagu isticmaali karo, oo si toos ah looga akhriyey adeeg-bixiyaha.','— Recommended for the provider —'=>'— Waxaa lagula talinayaa bixiyaha —','Save models'=>'Keydi moodallada','Refresh the model lists from the providers'=>'Liisaska moodeellada ka cusbooneysii bixiyeyaasha','Images'=>'Sawirro','Connect OpenAI or Google Gemini to make images.'=>'Ku xidh OpenAI ama Google Gemini si aad sawirro u samayso.','— The newest image model of the first connected provider —'=>'— Qaabka sawirka ugu cusub ee adeeg-bixiyaha koowaad ee ku xiran —','Site search (embeddings)'=>'Raadinta goobta (ku dhex-dhafan)','Connect Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or OpenRouter to build a search index of your site.'=>'Ku xidh Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral ama OpenRouter si aad u dhisto tusmada raadinta ee goobtaada.','— The newest embedding model of the first connected provider —'=>'— Qaabka ugu cusub ee gelinta ee bixiyaha koowaad ee ku xiran —','Changing this rebuilds the search index of every plugin that uses it.'=>'Beddelidda tani waxay dib u dhisaysaa tusmada raadinta ee furin kasta oo isticmaala.','best quality'=>'tayada ugu fiican','lowest cost'=>'kharashka ugu hooseeya','fastest'=>'Ugu dheereeya','Add a model yourself'=>'Adigu ku dar nooc','A model came out today? Paste its exact name to use it straight away.'=>'Moodeel cusub ma maantaa soo baxay? Ku dheji magaciisa saxda ah si aad isla markiiba u isticmaasho.','Model name'=>'Magaca nooca','Add model'=>'Ku dar moodel','Recommended models list'=>'Liiska noocyada lagu taliyay','The recommended models list could not be verified, so no recommendations are shown. Reinstall the plugin, or turn on daily updates below.'=>'Liiska moodallada lagu taliyay lama xaqiijin karin, sidaas darteed wax talooyin ah lama muujinayo. Dib u rakib fur-hubeeyaha (plugin-ka), ama shid cusbooneysiinta maalinlaha ah ee hoose.','The list in use was published on %s. Each plugin update brings a fresh one.'=>'Liiska la isticmaalayo waxaa la daabacay %s. Cusbooneysiin kasta oo plugin ah waxay keentaa mid cusub.','Also check Zinn Digital® once a day for an updated list.'=>'Sidoo kale ka hubi Zinn Digital® hal mar maalintii liis la cusboonaysiiyay.','Only a plain download request is sent: no key, no site address, nothing about your content. The list is signed, and a list that fails the signature check is ignored.'=>'Kaliya codsi soo dejin caadi ah ayaa la diraa: fure ma jiro, ciwaan goob ma jiro, wax ku saabsan nuxurkaagana ma jiro. Liiska waa la saxiixay, liiskii ku guuldareysta hubinta saxiixana waa la iska indhatiraa.','Last checked %1$s: %2$s.'=>'Hubintii ugu dambaysay %1$s: %2$s.','Save, and check now if turned on'=>'Keydi, oo hadda hubi haddii la daaray','a newer list was installed'=>'liis ka cusub ayaa la rakibay','already up to date'=>'hore ayaa loo cusbooneysiiyay','the download failed the signature check and was ignored'=>'soo dejintu waxay ku guuldarraysatay hubinta saxiixa waana la iska indhatiray','Zinn Digital® could not be reached; the current list stays in use'=>'Lama xiriiri karin Zinn Digital®; liiska hadda jira ayaa sii shaqeynaya','turned off'=>'Daran','Open'=>'Fur','Check their status page'=>'Fiiri boggooda xaaladda','Open your billing page'=>'Fur boggaaga qaansheegta','Open your API keys page'=>'Fur bogga furayaashaaga API','Open the AI settings'=>'Fur habaynta AI-ga','Sorry, you are not allowed to do that.'=>'Waan ka xunnahay, laguu ma oggola inaad sidaas samayso.','Unknown provider.'=>'Bixiye aan la aqoon.','Enter the address of your service, for example http://localhost:11434/v1.'=>'Geli ciwaanka adeeggaaga, tusaale ahaan http://localhost:11434/v1.','That does not look like an API key. Copy it again, without spaces.'=>'Taasi uma eka furaha API. Mar labaad koobiyeey, adigoon meel banaan ku darin.','Paste your API key first.'=>'Marka hore ku dheji furahaaga API.','Key removed.'=>'Furaha waa la saaray.','Models saved.'=>'Moodallada waa la keydiyay.','Enter the model\'s exact name, for example as the provider\'s documentation writes it.'=>'Geli magaca saxda ah ee moodeelka, tusaale ahaan sida dukumintiga bixiyuhu u qoray.','Added %s. Choose it under "Which model to use".'=>'Waa lagu daray %s. Ka dooro qaybta hoose ee "Qaabkee la isticmaalayaa".','Model removed.'=>'Moodalka waa la saaray.','Daily updates are off. The list that came with the plugin is used.'=>'Cusbooneysiinta maalinlaha ah waa dansan yihiin. Waxaa la isticmaalayaa liiskii la socday furaha (plugin).','Checked: %s.'=>'La hubiyey: %s.','Model lists refreshed.'=>'Liisaska moodeellada waa la cusbooneysiiyay.','Your AI key was saved by a newer version of one of your plugins. Update this plugin, or enter the key again in the AI settings.'=>'Furahaaga AI waxaa keydiyay nooc ka cusub mid ka mid ah furayaashaada (plugins). Cusbooneysii plugin-kan, ama mar kale furaha ku geli habaynta AI.','Your saved AI key can no longer be opened (the site\'s security keys changed). Enter it again in the AI settings.'=>'Furahaaga AI ee la keydiyay dib dambe looma furi karo (furayaasha amniga ee goobta ayaa isbeddelay). Dib ugu geli xulashooyinka AI.','AI is not set up yet. Add a key for an AI provider in the AI settings.'=>'AI-ga weli lama habayn. Ku dar fure loogu talagalay bixiyaha AI gudaha habaynta AI.','No model is chosen for this task. Pick one in the AI settings.'=>'Lama dooran qaab hawshan loogu talagalay. Mid ka dooro goobaha AI.','That AI provider is not supported by this version of the plugin.'=>'Bixiyahaas AI lama taageero noocaan ka midka ah furitaanka.','No AI provider that can make images is connected. Add an OpenAI or Google Gemini key in the AI settings.'=>'Ma jiro adeeg bixiye AI ah oo sawirro samayn kara oo ku xidhan. Kudar furaha OpenAI ama Google Gemini qaybta habaynta AI.','This AI provider cannot make images. Choose OpenAI or Google Gemini for images in the AI settings.'=>'Bixiyahan AI ma samayn karo sawirro. Dooro OpenAI ama Google Gemini sawirrada ee ku jira habaynta AI.','Your AI key cannot use any image model. Check the key\'s permissions with the provider, or choose another provider for images.'=>'Furahaaga AI ma isticmaali karo wax nooc sawir ah. Ka hubi rukhsadaha furaha adeeg-bixiyaha, ama dooro adeeg-bixiye kale oo loogu talagalay sawirrada.','No connected AI provider can build a search index. Add a Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or OpenRouter key in the AI settings.'=>'Ma jiro adeeg bixiye AI ah oo ku xiran oo dhisi kara tusmada raadinta. Ku dar furaha Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral ama OpenRouter goobaha AI.','Your AI key cannot use any embedding model. Check the key\'s permissions with the provider, or choose another provider for site search.'=>'Furahaaga AI ma isticmaali karo wax nooc ku-dhex-jira ah. Ka hubi rukhsadaha furaha bixiyahaaga, ama dooro bixiye kale oo loogu talagalay baaritaanka goobta.','This AI provider cannot build a search index. Connect Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or a compatible service for site search.'=>'Bixiyahan AI ma dhisi karo tusmada raadinta. Ku xidh Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral ama adeeg la jaanqaadi kara si aad goobta uga raadiso.','This site could not reach your AI service. Check that it is running and that its address is reachable from your web server (a service on your own computer is not reachable from a hosted site).'=>'Boggani ma awoodin inuu gaadho adeeggaaga AI. Hubi inuu shaqaynayo iyo in ciwaankiisa laga gaadhi karo seerfarkaaga mareegta (adeeg ku yaal kombiyuutarkaaga lagama gaadhi karo degel la martigeliyay).','This site could not reach %s. Check their status page; if they are up, your host may be blocking outgoing connections, or the address is wrong.'=>'Boggani ma gaari karin %s. Hubi bogga xaaladdooda; haddii ay shaqaynayaan, martigeliyahaagu waxa laga yaabaa inuu xannibayo xidhiidhyada baxaya, ama ciwaanka ayaa khaldan.','%s says your account has no credit or quota left. Add credit or raise your limit in your account with them, then try again.'=>'%s wuxuu sheegayaa in koontadaadu aysan ku harin wax dhibco ama kooto ah. Kudar dhibco ama kordhi xadkaaga koontada aad ku leedahay iyaga, ka dibna mar kale isku day.','%s did not accept your key. It may be mistyped, revoked or expired. Create a new key and paste it here.'=>'%s ma uusan aqbalin furahaaga. Waxaa laga yaabaa in si khaldan loo qoray, la baabbi\'iyay ama uu dhacay. Samee fure cusub oo ku dheji halkan.','%s refused this request for your key. The key may not have access to this model or feature, or your account needs verifying.'=>'%s wuxuu diiday codsigan ee furahaaga. Waxaa laga yaabaa in furuhu uusan heli karin qaabkan ama muuqaalkan, ama koontadaadu waxay u baahan tahay xaqiijin.','The model "%1$s" is not available from %2$s for your key. Choose another model in the AI settings.'=>'Qaabka "%1$s" lagama heli karo %2$s furahaaga. Ka dooro qaab kale habaynta AI-ga.','Your %2$s plan does not include the model "%1$s". Choose another model in the AI settings, or upgrade your plan with them.'=>'Qorshahaaga %2$s kuma jiro nooca "%1$s". Ka dooro nooc kale goobaha AI-da, ama ku cusbooneysii qorshahaaga iyaga.','%s is limiting how fast your key can send requests. Wait a minute and try again, or raise your rate limit with them.'=>'%s wuxuu xaddidayaa sida dhakhsaha leh ee furahaagu codsiyada u diri karo. Sug daqiiqad oo mar kale isku day, ama kala kordhi xadka heerkaaga iyaga.','%s is having problems right now (an outage or overload on their side). Nothing is wrong with your settings. Try again shortly.'=>'%s hadda dhibaatooyin ayaa haysta (cilad ama culays xad-dhaaf ah oo dhankooda ah). Wax dhibaato ah kama jiraan habayntaada. Mar dhow mar kale isku day.','The AI request failed for a reason we could not identify. Try again; if it keeps happening, contact support with the details below.'=>'Codsiga AI wuu fashilmay sabab aanan garan karin. Isku day mar kale; haddii ay sii dhacdo, la xiriir taageerada oo u dir macluumaadka hoose.','The AI provider answered in a form this plugin could not read. Try again; if it keeps happening, choose another model or contact support.'=>'Bixiyaha AI wuxuu ku jawaabay qaab aysan furin-kordhintani akhriyi karin. Mar kale isku day; haddii ay sii socoto, dooro nooc kale ama la xiriir qaybta caawinta.','Custom (OpenAI-compatible)'=>'Caadiga ah (la jaanqaadi kara OpenAI)','Save a key for this provider first.'=>'Marka hore furaha bixiyahan keydi.','Your key works, but the provider lists no text model for it. Add a model yourself below.'=>'Furahaagu wuu shaqaynayaa, laakiin bixiyuhu uma qorin wax qaab qoraal ah. Hoos adigu qaab ku darso.','Connected. %1$s answered using %2$s. Your AI features are ready to use.'=>'Waa ku xidhan yahay. %1$s waxa uu kaga jawaabay %2$s. Astaamahaaga AI waxay diyaar u yihiin in la isticmaalo.','Your user role is not allowed to use AI on this site. Ask an administrator.'=>'Doorkaaga isticmaale looma oggola inuu AI ku isticmaalo boggan. Weydii maamulaha.','This site has reached its monthly AI spending limit. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'Boggan wuxuu gaaray xadka kharashka AI-ga ee bishii. Maamuluhu wuxuu ku kordhin karaa habaynta AI-ga.','This site has reached its monthly limit of AI requests. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'Boggan wuxuu gaaray xadka billaha ah ee codsiyada AI. Maamuluhu wuxuu ku kordhin karaa goobaha AI.','Usage and cost'=>'Isticmaalka iyo qiimaha','The log, limits and role permissions apply to AI used through: %s.'=>'Diiwaanka, xuduudaha iyo rukhsadaha doorka waxay khuseeyaan AI-ga loo adeegsado: %s.','Costs are approximate, worked out from published prices; a model with no known price counts as zero.'=>'Kharashyadu waa qiyaas, waxaana laga xisaabiyay qiimayaasha la daabacay; moodalka aan lahayn qiimo la yaqaan waxa loo tiriyaa eber.','This month: %1$s requests, about %2$s.'=>'Bishan: %1$s codsiyo, qiyaastii %2$s.','When'=>'Goorta','Who'=>'Yaa','Used for'=>'Loo adeegsaday','Model'=>'Nooc','Tokens in / out'=>'Astaamaha soo gelaya / baxaya','About'=>'Ku saabsan','Result'=>'Natiijo','No AI requests have been made yet.'=>'Weli wax codsiyo AI ah lama samayn.','Done'=>'Waa dhammaatay','Limits and permissions'=>'Xaddidaadaha iyo oggolaanshaha','Monthly spending limit (US dollars)'=>'Xadka kharashka bishii (Doolarka US)','Leave empty for no limit. AI stops for the rest of the month once the approximate cost reaches it.'=>'Faaruq uga tag xad la\'aan darteed. AI-gu wuxuu joogsanayaa inta ka dhiman bisha marka qiimaha qiyaasta ahi uu gaadho.','Monthly request limit'=>'Xadka codsiyada bishii','Leave empty for no limit.'=>'Bannaan uga tag haddii aysan xad lahayn.','Who may use AI'=>'Yaa isticmaali kara AI','Tick none to let everyone who can use the plugin\'s features use AI. Administrators can always use it.'=>'Ha calaamadin midna si qof kasta oo isticmaali kara astaamaha balaarinta loogu oggolaado inuu isticmaalo AI. Maamulayaashu mar walba way isticmaali karaan.','Save limits and permissions'=>'Kaydi xadka iyo oggolaanshaha','Limits and permissions saved.'=>'Xaddidyada iyo oggolaanshaha waa la keydiyay.','Security error, please refresh the page and try again.'=>'Khalad dhanka amniga ah, fadlan dib u cusboonaysii bogga oo mar kale isku day.','Missing newsletter settings. Please contact the admin.'=>'Lama helin goobaha warsidaha. Fadlan la xiriir maamulaha.','Invalid newsletter settings. Please contact the admin.'=>'Hagaajinta warsidaha sax ma aha. Fadlan la xiriir maamulaha.','Invalid email address.'=>'Cinwaanka iimaylka aan saxda ahayn.','Please tick the box to agree before subscribing.'=>'Fadlan calaamadee sanduuqa si aad u aqbasho ka hor inta aadan is qorin.','Too many attempts. Please try again in a few minutes.'=>'Isku dayo aad u badan. Fadlan dhowr daqiiqo ka dib mar kale isku day.','Something went wrong. Please contact the admin.'=>'Wax baa qaldamay. Fadlan la xiriir maamulaha.','Map'=>'Khariidad','Background video'=>'Muuqaalka asalka','%1$s: %2$d font files stored, stylesheet %3$s'=>'%1$s: %2$d faylasha farta waa la kaydiyay, xaashida qaabka %3$s','That family is not stored.'=>'Qoyskaas lama keydin.','Removed.'=>'Waa laga saaray.','That is not a valid font family name.'=>'Kaasi ma ahan magac qoys farta oo sax ah.','Google Fonts did not return that family. Check the name and try again.'=>'Google Fonts ma soo celin qoyskaas farta. Hubi magaca oo mar kale isku day.','The font files could not be downloaded or saved. Check that the uploads folder is writable.'=>'Faylasha farta lama soo dejin karin lamana keydin karin. Hubi in galka wax lagu shubo (uploads) wax lagu qori karo.','The font stylesheet could not be saved. Check that the uploads folder is writable.'=>'Xaashida qaabka farta lama keydin karin. Hubi in galka waxyaabaha la geliyo (uploads) wax lagu qori karo.','Dismiss this notice'=>'Diid ogeysiiskan','(opens in a new tab)'=>'(waxay ku furmaysaa tab cusub)','Done:'=>'Dhammaystiran:','To do:'=>'Waxa la qabanayo:','Glossary index'=>'Tusmada qaamuuska','Rated %1$s out of %2$s'=>'Lagu qiimeeyay %1$s marka loo eego %2$s','Progress'=>'Horumarka','%s%%'=>'%s%%','Copy code'=>'Koobiye koodhka','Copied'=>'Waa la koobiyey','That widget is not available on this site.'=>'Widget-kaasi lagama heli karo boggan.','Email'=>'Iimayl','Phone'=>'Telefoon','RSS feed'=>'Qulqulka RSS','Website'=>'Websayt','Link'=>'Xiriirso','%s (opens in a new tab)'=>'%s (waxay ku furmaysaa taab cusub)','Rated %d out of 5'=>'Waxaa lagu qiimeeyay %d marka loo eego 5','(recommended)'=>'(lagu taliyay)','Included'=>'Ku jira','Not included'=>'Kuma jira','Comparison table'=>'Shaxda isbarbardhigga','Call %s'=>'Wac %s','Email %s'=>'Iimaylka %s','Text %s'=>'Qoraal %s','Chat on WhatsApp'=>'Kula xiriir WhatsApp','Contact us'=>'Nala soo xiriir','Chat with us on WhatsApp'=>'Nagala sheekeyso WhatsApp','This form is not available right now.'=>'Foomkan hadda lama heli karo.','This form cannot be shown because %s is not active.'=>'Foomkan lama muujin karo sababtoo ah %s ma shaqaynayo.','Map: %s'=>'Khariidad: %s','Showing the map loads it from OpenStreetMap.'=>'Muujinta khariidadda waxay ka soo dejinaysaa OpenStreetMap.','Show the map'=>'Muuji khariidadda','Open the map on OpenStreetMap'=>'Khariidadda ka fur OpenStreetMap','Booking calendar from %s'=>'Jadwalka ballansashada ee ka socda %s','Showing the booking calendar loads it from %s.'=>'Muujinta kalandar