 off your first payment. Renewals are at the normal price.'=>'Macaamil martigelinta Zinn Digital® ahaan waxaad helaysaa koodh gaar ah oo %d%% dhimis ah lacag-bixintaada koowaad. Cusboonaysiintu waxay ku socotaa qiimaha caadiga ah.','Get my %d%% code and go to checkout'=>'Hel koodhkayga %d%% oo u gudub bixinta','This discount is for customers with a paid hosting plan in good standing. Free trials do not qualify.'=>'Qiimo-dhimistan waxa loogu talagalay macaamiisha haysta qorshe martigelinta oo lacag lagu bixiyay oo xaaladdiisu wanaagsan tahay. Tijaabooyinka bilaashka ahi uma qalmaan.','You have already used your hosting-customer discount for this plugin.'=>'Hore ayaad u isticmaashay qiimo-dhimistaada macmiilka martigelinta ee furahan.','We could not get your code just now. Please try again in a few minutes.'=>'Ma aanan heli karin koodhkaaga hadda. Fadlan isku day mar kale daqiiqado ka dib.','The prefix must be 1 to 8 lowercase letters or digits, start with a letter, and must not name the plugin.'=>'Horgalaha waa inuu noqdaa 1 ilaa 8 xaraf oo yaryar ama nambaro, ku bilowdaa xaraf, waana inaanu magacaabin furaha.','The kit could not be read. Try again later.'=>'Xirmada lama akhrin karin. Mar dambe isku day.','This kit comes with Page Builder Sandwich Pro.'=>'Xirmadan waxay la socotaa Page Builder Sandwich Pro.','The kit library could not be reached. Check this site can make outgoing connections, then try again.'=>'Lama gaari karin maktabadda qalabka. Hubi in boggani uu sameyn karo xiriirro dibadda ah, ka dibna mar kale isku day.','The kit library refused the request.'=>'Maktabadda kit-ka ayaa diidday codsiga.','Page Builder Sandwich sections'=>'Qaybaha Page Builder Sandwich','Ready-made sections from Page Builder Sandwich.'=>'Qaybo diyaarsan oo ka socda Page Builder Sandwich.','%1$s (%2$s)'=>'%1$s (%2$s)','Casino Guide'=>'Hagaha Khamaarka','This month\'s top-rated casinos'=>'Kasiinooyinka ugu qiimeynta sarreeya bishan','Scores come from our own tests. Bonuses change oft