htforward advice on growing vegetables, caring for lawns and choosing the right tools, written by people who garden every weekend.'=>'Talooyin toos ah oo ku saabsan beerashada khudaarta, daryeelka cawska iyo doorashada qalabka saxda ah, oo ay qoreen dad beerta fasha dhammaadka toddobaad kasta.','Read the latest guides'=>'Akhriso hagayaashii ugu dambeeyay','About the author'=>'Ku saabsan qoraaga','Estate Agency'=>'Wakaaladda Guryaha','What is your home worth?'=>'Immisa ayuu gurigaagu qiimihiisu yahay?','Book a free, no-obligation valuation.'=>'Qabso qiimeyn bilaash ah oo aan wax waajibaad ah lahayn.','Book a valuation'=>'Qabso qiimeyn','Free valuation'=>'Qiyaas lacag la\'aan ah','An agent visits and prices your home.'=>'Wakiil ayaa soo booqda oo qiimeeya gurigaaga.','Launch'=>'Bilow','Photos, floor plan and listing live within days.'=>'Sawirrada, qorshaha dabaqa iyo liiska waxay toos u noqon doonaan maalmo gudahood.','Sold'=>'La iibiyay','We negotiate and manage the sale to completion.'=>'Waxaan ka wada xaajoonnaa oo maamulnaa iibka ilaa laga dhammaystiro.','Bistro'=>'Bistro','Open Tuesday to Sunday'=>'Furan Talaado ilaa Axad','Seasonal cooking, made for sharing'=>'Karinta xilliyada, oo loo sameeyay in la wadaago','Local produce, a wood-fired oven and a wine list chosen by people who love it. Lunch and dinner, six days a week.'=>'Balaastikada maxalliga ah, foorno alwaax lagu shito iyo liiska khamriga oo ay doorteen dad jecel. Qadada iyo cashada, lix maalmood usbuucii.','Book a table'=>'Qabso miis','See the menu'=>'Eeg liiska','From our kitchen'=>'Laga soo bilaabo jikadayada','A short menu that changes with the seasons. Ask us about allergies: we are happy to adapt.'=>'Liis cunto oo gaaban oo isbeddela xilliyada la socda. Na weydii waxyaabaha xasaasiyadda: waxaan ku faraxsan nahay inaan la qabsanno.','Small plates'=>'Saxanno yaryar','Charred flatbreads, cured meats and garden vegetables to start.'=>'Rooti fidsan oo la dubay, hilib qallalan iyo khudaarta beerta si loo bilaabo.','From the fire'=>'Laga bilaabo dabka','Whole fish, aged steaks and roasted vegetables from the wood oven.'=>'Kalluun dhan, hilib dabacsan oo bisil iyo khudaar lagu dubay foornada qoryaha.','Fresh pasta'=>'Baasto cusub','Made by hand every morning, served with seasonal sauces.'=>'Gacanta lagu sameeyaa subax kasta, laguna adeegaa suugada xilliyeedka ah.','Desserts'=>'Macmacaanka','Tarts, ices and a cheese board from local makers.'=>'Taartyo, jalaato iyo loox jiis ah oo ka yimid kuwa maxalliga ah.','Set lunch'=>'Qado go\'an','Two or three courses at a fixed price, Tuesday to Friday.'=>'Laba ama saddex kooras oo qiimo go\'an ah, Talaado ilaa Jimce.','Private dining'=>'Cunno qaadasho gaar ah','A private room for up to 18 guests with a tailored menu.'=>'Qol gaar ah oo qaada ilaa 18 marti ah oo leh cunto gaar loogu talagalay.','SaaS Product'=>'Balaadhka SaaS','Is there a free plan?'=>'Ma jiraa qorshe bilaash ah?','Yes, free for small teams, and every paid plan starts with a 14-day trial.'=>'Haa, waa lacag la\'aan kooxaha yaryar, qorshe kasta oo lacag ahna wuxuu ku bilaabmaa tijaabo 14 maalmood ah.','Can I cancel any time?'=>'Miyaan joojin karaa wakhti kasta?','Yes. Monthly plans can be cancelled at any time.'=>'Haa. Qorshayaasha bishii la bixiyo waa la tirtiri karaa wakhti kasta.','Where is my data stored?'=>'Halkee ayaa xogtayda lagu kaydiyaa?','In secure, encrypted data centres, with daily backups.'=>'Xarumaha xogta ee sugan oo sir ah, oo leh kayd maalinle ah.','Everything your team needs'=>'Wax kasta oo kooxdaadu u baahan tahay','Boards and timelines'=>'Looxyada iyo jadwallada waqtiga','Switch between kanban boards and timelines in one click.'=>'U kala beddel looxyada kanban iyo jaantusyada waqtiga hal gujis oo keliya.','Automations'=>'Siwadaajiyada','Move tasks, assign owners and send reminders automatically.'=>'Dhaqaaji hawlaha, u xilsaar mulkiilayaasha oo si toos ah u dir xusuusiyeyaasha.','Shared files'=>'Faylasha la wadaagay','Keep documents next to the work they belong to.'=>'Ku hay dukumintiyada shaqada ay ka tirsan yihiin agteeda.','Reports'=>'Warbixinno','Live dashboards for workload, progress and deadlines.'=>'Dashboodhyo toos ah oo loogu talagalay culayska shaqada, horumarka iyo xilliyada kama dambaysta ah.','Integrations'=>'Isku-xirka','Connect the email, chat and storage tools you already use.'=>'Ku xir qalabka iimaylka, wada-sheekaysiga iyo kaydinta ee aad hadda isticmaasho.','Security'=>'Amniga','Single sign-on, audit logs and encrypted data.'=>'Galitaanka hal mar ah, diiwaannada dabagalka iyo xogta qarsoon.','14-day free trial, no card needed'=>'14-maalmood oo tijaabo bilaash ah, kaar looma baahna','Plan projects, not spreadsheets'=>'Qorshee mashaariicda, ee ha qorsheyn xaashiyaha xisaabinta','One workspace for tasks, deadlines and files. Your team sees what matters today, and you see progress without asking for updates.'=>'Halkii goob shaqo oo loogu talagalay hawlaha, waqtiyada kama dambaysta ah iyo faylasha. Kooxdaadu waxay arkaysaa waxa muhiimka ah maanta, adiguna waxaad arkaysaa horumarka adiga oo aan weydiisan xog-cusub.','Start free trial'=>'Bilow tijaabo bilaash ah','See features'=>'Eeg astaamaha','Up and running in minutes'=>'Diyaar ah oo shaqeynaya daqiiqado gudahood','Create a workspace'=>'Abuur meel shaqo','Sign up and invite your team in minutes.'=>'Isku qor oo kooxdaada ku soo martiqaad daqiiqado gudahood.','Import your work'=>'Soo dhoofso shaqadaada','Bring tasks in from a spreadsheet or another tool.'=>'Ka soo geli hawlaha xaashida faafinta ama qalab kale.','Get moving'=>'Bilaab','Templates and automations do the busywork.'=>'Qaababka iyo shaqooyinka tooska ah ayaa qabta shaqada culus ee joogtada ah.','You are not allowed to edit this item.'=>'Loma oggola inaad wax ka beddesho shaygan.','You are not allowed to do this.'=>'Loma oggola inaad tan sameyso.','Safe mode was turned off because it no longer matches your login. Reload the page.'=>'Habka bedqabka waa la damiyay maxaa yeelay mar dambe lama mid aha gelitaankaaga. Dib u soo geli bogga.','Only an administrator can use safe mode.'=>'Kaliya maamule ayaa isticmaali kara habka badbaadada leh.','Safe mode needs a normal browser login.'=>'Habka bedqabka wuxuu u baahan yahay gelitaan biraawsar oo caadi ah.','Safe mode could not be set up.'=>'Habka bedbaadada lama diyaarin karin.','Safe mode needs write access to the wp-content/mu-plugins folder.'=>'Habka bedbaadada wuxuu u baahan yahay oggolaanshaha qoraalka galalka wp-content/mu-plugins.','Safe mode could not write to the wp-content/mu-plugins folder.'=>'Habka bedqabka ah (safe mode) ma awoodin inuu wax ku qoro galka wp-content/mu-plugins.','Sandwich Studio'=>'Sandwich Studio','That page does not exist, or it has been deleted.'=>'Boggaasi ma jiro, ama waa la tirtiray.','Sandwich Studio works with the block editor, and the block editor is switched off for this item. A plugin such as Classic Editor does that: allow the block editor for this item in its settings (Settings → Writing), then open Sandwich Studio again.'=>'Sandwich Studio waxay la shaqaysaa tifaftiraha baloogga, tifaftiraha baloogguna wuu u dansan yahay shaygan. Furin sida Classic Editor ah ayaa sidaas samaysa: u oggolow tifaftiraha baloogga shaygan xagga habayntiisa (Habaynta → Qorista), ka dibna mar kale fur Sandwich Studio.','Sorry, you are not allowed to edit this item in Sandwich Studio.'=>'Waan ka xunnahay, laguu ma oggola inaad shaygan ku wax ka beddesho Sandwich Studio.','Sandwich Studio is not built. Reinstall the plugin.'=>'Sandwich Studio lama dhisin. Dib u rakib furaha.','Add title'=>'Ku dar cinwaan','Type / to choose a block'=>'Qor / si aad baloog u doorato','Loading Sandwich Studio…'=>'Sandwich Studio ayaa la soo gelinayaa…','Sandwich Studio needs JavaScript. Use the normal editor instead.'=>'Sandwich Studio waxay u baahan tahay JavaScript. Beddelkeeda isticmaal tifaftiraha caadiga ah.','Edit “%s” with Sandwich Studio'=>'Ku wax ka beddel “%s” adigoo isticmaalaya Sandwich Studio','Edit with Sandwich Studio'=>'Ku wax ka beddel Sandwich Studio','Blank canvas'=>'Shiraac madhan','Skip to content'=>'U gudub nuxurka','The tablet width must be a whole number of pixels from 480 to 2560.'=>'Balaaca kaniiniga (tablet) waa inuu ahaadaa tiro buuxda oo pixels ah oo u dhexeysa 480 ilaa 2560.','The mobile width must be a whole number of pixels, at least 240 and smaller than the tablet width.'=>'Ballaca mobilka waa inuu ahaadaa tiro buuxda oo pixels ah, ugu yaraan 240 kana yar ballaca tablet-ka.','Each custom breakpoint needs its own id: 2 to 12 lowercase letters or digits, starting with a letter.'=>'Barta kasta oo gaar ah waxay u baahan tahay id u gaar ah: 2 ilaa 12 xaraf oo yaryar ama lambarro ah, oo ka bilaabmaya xaraf.','A custom breakpoint applies either up to a width (200 to 4000 pixels) or from a width (200 to 6000 pixels), not both.'=>'Barta kala-goysiga gaarka ah waxay shaqaynaysaa ilaa ballac (200 ilaa 4000 pixels) ama laga bilaabo ballac (200 ilaa 6000 pixels), labadaba ma wada aha.','Tablet'=>'Taablet','Mobile'=>'Mobil','Site design'=>'Naqshadda bogga','Colours, fonts and styles shared by every page of the site and by your theme.'=>'Midabbada, xarfaha iyo qaababka ay wadaagaan bog kasta oo goobta ah iyo mawduucaaga.','The site\'s global styles could not be opened.'=>'Lama furi karin qaababka guud ee bogga.','That font is not one of the site\'s fonts.'=>'Far-qoraalkaas kama mid aha xarfaha bogga.','Each colour needs a unique name made of lowercase letters, digits and hyphens.'=>'Midab kastaa wuxuu u baahan yahay magac gaar ah oo ka kooban xarfo yaryar, tirooyin iyo xariiqmo.','The colour "%s" is not a valid CSS colour.'=>'Midabka "%s" ma aha midab CSS sax ah.','Each font needs a unique name made of lowercase letters, digits and hyphens.'=>'Far kasta waxay u baahan tahay magac gaar ah oo ka kooban xarfo yaryar, tirooyin iyo xariiqo.','The font stack for "%s" may contain only font names, quotes, commas and spaces.'=>'Xariiqda farta ee "%s" waxa ku jiri kara oo keliya magacyada farta, xigashooyinka, hakadyada iyo meelaha banaan.','Uploaded icons'=>'Astaamaha la soo geliyay','Icon'=>'Astaanta','This file is not an SVG icon we can use. It may be damaged, or it only held content that is removed for safety (scripts, links, embedded images or fonts).'=>'Faylkani ma aha astaanta SVG ee aan isticmaali karno. Waxaa laga yaabaa inuu xumaaday, ama wuxuu kaliya haystay waxyaabo loo saaray sababo ammaan dartood (qoraallada koodhka, xiriiriyeyaasha, sawirrada ku dhex jira ama fartamaha).','The icon could not be deleted.'=>'Astaanta lama tiri karin.','Part of the message telling the user what they should receive via email.a license key'=>'furaha shatiga','A user has not yet been associated with the license, which is necessary to prevent unauthorized activation. To assign the license to your user, you agree to share your WordPress user\'s full name and email address.'=>'Weli isticmaale laguma xiriirin shatiga, taasoo lagama maarmaan u ah ka hortagga hawlgelinta aan la oggolayn. Si aad shatiga ugu qoondeyso isticmaalahaaga, waxaad oggolaatay inaad wadaagto magaca buuxa iyo ciwaanka iimaylka ee isticmaalahaaga WordPress.','the above-mentioned sites'=>'goobaha kor lagu xusay','Account'=>'Koonto','Account Details'=>'Xogta Akoonka','Account is pending activation. Please check your email and click the link to activate your account and then submit the affiliate form again.'=>'Koontadu waxay sugaysaa hawlgelin. Fadlan hubi iimaylkaaga oo guji xidhiidhka si aad u hawlgeliso koontadaada, ka dibna mar kale soo gudbi foomka shuraakada.','Would you like to merge %1$s into %2$s?'=>'Ma jeclaan lahayd inaad %1$s ku darto %2$s?','Actions'=>'Ficillo','Activate'=>'Kici','Activate Free Version'=>'Daar Nooca Bilaashka ah','Activate License'=>'Hawlgeli Shatiga','activate a license here'=>'Halkan ka hawlgeli shatiga','Please enter the license key that you received in the email right after the purchase:'=>'Fadlan geli furaha shatiga ee aad ku heshay iimaylka isla markiiba iibsiga ka dib:','Activate license on all sites in the network.'=>'Ka hawlgeli shatiga dhammaan boggaga ku jira shabakadda.','Activate license on all pending sites.'=>'Ka hawlgeli shatiga dhammaan boggaga sugaya.',' The paid version of %1$s is already installed. Please activate it to start benefiting from the %2$s features. %3$s'=>' Nooca lacag bixinta ah ee %1$s mar hore ayaa la rakibay. Fadlan shid si aad u bilowdo ka faa\'iidaysiga astaamaha %2$s. %3$s',' The paid version of %1$s is already installed. Please navigate to the %2$s to activate it and start benefiting from the %3$s features.'=>' Nooca lacagta ah ee %1$s mar hore ayaa la rakibay. Fadlan u gudub %2$s si aad u dhaqaajiso oo aad u bilowdo ka faa\'iidaysiga astaamaha %3$s.','Activate this add-on'=>'Kala xiriir fur-furahan','Activate %s'=>'Kici %s','Activate %s features'=>'Daar astaamaha %s','%s - plugin name. As complete "PluginX" activation nowComplete "%s" Activation Now'=>'Dhammaystir Hawlgelinta "%s" Hadda','Activate %s Plan'=>'Hawlgeli Qorshaha %s','Activated'=>'La hawlgeliyay','Activating'=>'Dhaqaajinaya','Activating license'=>'Laysanka waa la hawlgelinayaa','Your account was successfully activated with the %s plan.'=>'Koontadaada si guul leh ayaa loogu hawlgaliyay qorshaha %s.','active add-onActive'=>'Shaqeynaya','Add another domain'=>'Ku dar domain kale','Add-Ons'=>'Ku-darmooyin','Add Ons for %s'=>'Ku-darka loogu talagalay %s','We couldn\'t load the add-ons list. It\'s probably an issue on our side, please try to come back in few minutes.'=>'Waan ku guuldarraysanay inaan soo rarno liiska waxyaabaha lagu kordhiyo. Waxay u badan tahay inay dhibaato ka jirto dhankeena, fadlan isku day inaad dib ugu soo laabato dhowr daqiiqo gudahood.','Add-On'=>'Kordhin','%s is a premium only add-on. You have to purchase a license first before activating the plugin.'=>'%s waa kordhin loogu talagalay kaliya kuwa lacagta bixiya (premium). Waa inaad marka hore iibsataa ruqsad ka hor inta aadan shaqaysiin fur-hagaajiyaha.','%s Add-on was successfully purchased.'=>'Kordhinta %s si guul leh ayaa loo iibsaday.','Your %s Add-on plan was successfully upgraded.'=>'Qorshahaaga dheeriga ah ee %s si guul leh ayaa loo cusboonaysiiyay.','%s free trial was successfully cancelled. Since the add-on is premium only it was automatically deactivated. If you like to use it in the future, you\'ll have to purchase a license.'=>'Tijaabada bilaashka ah ee %s si guul leh ayaa loo joojiyay. Maadaama kordhintu ay tahay nooca lacagta ah oo keliya, si toos ah ayaa loo demiyay. Haddii aad jeclaan lahayd inaad mustaqbalka isticmaasho, waa inaad iibsataa shati.','addonX cannot run...%s cannot run without the plugin.'=>'%s ma shaqayn karo la\'aanta fur-hagaajiyaha.','addonX cannot run without pluginY%1$s cannot run without %2$s.'=>'%1$s ma shaqeyn karo la\'aanta %2$s.','Just letting you know that the add-ons information of %s is being pulled from an external server.'=>'Kaliya waxaan ku ogeysiinaynaa in xogta ku-darka ah ee %s laga soo qaadanayo adeegaha dibadda ah.','Add Ons of module %s'=>'Ku-darka qaybta %s','Address Line %d'=>'Sadarka Ciwaanka %d','Affiliate'=>'Xiriirye','Due to violation of our affiliation terms, we decided to temporarily block your affiliation account. If you have any questions, please contact support.'=>'Ku xad-gudubka shuruudaha ku-xirnaanshaheenna dartiis, waxaan go\'aansannay inaan si ku-meel-gaar ah u xannibno koontadaada ku-xirnaanshaha. Haddii aad wax su\'aalo ah qabtid, fadlan la xiriir qeybta taageerada.','Your affiliation account was temporarily suspended.'=>'Koontadaada xiriirka si ku-meel-gaar ah ayaa loo hakiyay.','Your affiliate application for %1$s has been accepted! Log in to your affiliate area at: %2$s.'=>'Codsigaagii ku-xirnaanta ee %1$s waa la aqbalay! Ka gal aaggaaga ku-xirnaanta: %2$s.','Thank you for applying for our affiliate program, unfortunately, we\'ve decided at this point to reject your application. Please try again in 30 days.'=>'W