ection was successfulConnected'=>'Ku xiran','Once you are done, deactivate the %s and activate it again.'=>'Markaad dhamaysato, dami %s ka dibna mar kale shid.','Contact'=>'Xiriir','Please let us know if you\'d like us to contact you for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers:'=>'Fadlan nala soo socodsii haddii aad jeclaan lahayd inaan kula soo xiriirno wixii ku saabsan cusboonaysiinta amniga iyo astaamaha cusub, xogta waxbarashada, iyo dalabyada xilliyada qaarkood:','Contact Support'=>'La xiriir Taageerada','Sorry for the inconvenience and we are here to help if you give us a chance.'=>'Waan ka xunnahay dhibka kugu yimid, waxaana diyaar u nahay inaan ku caawinno haddii aad fursad na siiso.','Contact Us'=>'Nala Soo Xiriir','Please contact us here'=>'Fadlan halkan nagala soo xiriir','Please contact us with the following message:'=>'Fadlan nagala soo xiriir fariintan soo socota:','Continue'=>'Sii wad','Contributors'=>'Ka-qaybqaatayaasha','Couldn\'t activate %s.'=>'Lama hawlgelin karin %s.','Country'=>'Dalka','Cron Type'=>'Nooca Cron','We use PHP cURL library for the API calls, which is a very common library and usually installed and activated out of the box. Unfortunately, cURL is not activated (or disabled) on your server.'=>'Waxaan u isticmaalnaa maktabadda PHP cURL wicitaannada API, taasoo ah maktabad aad u caan ah oo inta badan la rakibo lana hawlgeliyo marka horeba. Nasiib-darro, cURL kama hawlgelin (ama waa laga damiyay) serfarkaaga.','data'=>'Xog','Debug mode was successfully enabled and will be automatically disabled in 60 min. You can also disable it earlier by clicking the "Stop Debug" link.'=>'Habka debug-ga si guul leh ayaa loo furay waxaana si toos ah loo damin doonaa 60 daqiiqo gudahood. Waxaad sidoo kale damin kartaa waqti hore adigoo gujinaya xiriiriyaha "Stop Debug".','Date'=>'Taariikh','Deactivate'=>'Dami','Deactivate the free version'=>'Dami nooca bilaashka ah','Deactivate License'=>'Dami Shatiga','Deactivating your 