pected error, try again in 5 minutes. If the error persists, please contact support.'=>'Khalad aan la filayn, isku day mar kale 5 daqiiqo kadib. Haddii khaladku sii socdo, fadlan la xiriir qaybta caawinta.','Uninstalling the %s will automatically disable the license, which you\'ll be able to use on another site.'=>'Ka saarista %s waxay si toos ah u joojin doontaa shatiga, kaas oo aad awoodi doonto inaad ku isticmaasho degel kale.','An unknown error has occurred.'=>'Khalad aan la garanayn ayaa dhacay.','Unlimited commissions.'=>'Komiishanno aan xadidnayn.','Unlimited Updates'=>'Cusbooneysiinno aan xadidnayn','verbUpdate'=>'Cusboonaysii','Would you like to proceed with the update?'=>'Ma jeclaan lahayd inaad sii waddo cusboonaysiinta?','Update'=>'Cusboonaysii','Update License'=>'Cusboonaysii Shatiga','Upgrade'=>'Kordhi','Important Upgrade Notice:'=>'Ogeysiis Muhiim ah oo ku saabsan Casriyeynta:','Upload and activate the downloaded version'=>'Soo geli oo shaqaysii nooca la soo dejiyay','User Dashboard'=>'Xog-sheegaha Isticmaalaha','Sorry, we could not complete the email update. Another user with the same email is already registered.'=>'Waan ka xunnahay, ma aannu dhammaystiri karin cusboonaysiinta iimaylka. Isticmaale kale oo wata isla iimaylkan ayaa horay loo diiwaangeliyay.','If you would like to give up the ownership of the %1$s\'s account to %2$s click the Change Ownership button.'=>'Haddii aad jeclaan lahayd inaad wareejiso lahaanshaha koontada %1$s una wareejiso %2$s guji batoonka Beddel Lahaanshaha.','User ID'=>'Aqoonsiga Isticmaalaha','User key'=>'Furaha isticmaalaha','Users'=>'Isticmaalayaasha','Value'=>'Qiimaha','Verification mail was just sent to %s. If you can\'t find it after 5 min, please check your spam box.'=>'Iimaylka xaqiijinta ayaa hadda loo diray %s. Haddii aadan helin 5 daqiiqo ka dib, fadlan hubi sanduuqaaga spam-ka.','Verified'=>'La xaqiijiyay','Verify Email'=>'Xaqiiji Iimaylka','product versionVersion'=>'Nuuca','Version %s was released.'=>'Nooca %s waa la sii daayay.','View details'=>'Eeg macluumaadka','Click to view full-size screenshot %d'=>'Guji si aad u aragto sawirka shaashadda oo baaxad buuxda leh %d','View paid features'=>'Eeg astaamaha lacag-bixinta ah','Warning'=>'Digniin','What is your %s?'=>'Waa maxay %s-gaaga?','Used to express elation, enthusiasm, or triumph (especially in electronic communication).W00t'=>'Guul!','WordPress.org Plugin Page'=>'Bogga Fur-kordhiyaha WordPress.org','It seems like one of the authentication parameters is wrong. Update your Public Key, Secret Key & User ID, and try again.'=>'Waxay u muuqataa in mid ka mid ah xuduudaha xaqiijinta uu khaldan yahay. Cusbooneysii Public Key, Secret Key & User ID-gaaga, ka dibna mar kale isku day.','%s ago'=>'%s kahor','as 5 licenses left%s left'=>'%s ayaa hadhay','%s or higher'=>'%s ama ka sarreeya','%s\'s paid features'=>'Astaamaha lacag bixinta ah ee %s','e.g. Professional Plan%s Plan'=>'Qorshaha %s','%s rating'=>'Qiimeynta %s','%s ratings'=>'%s qiimayn','%s sec'=>'%s ilb','%s star'=>'%s xiddig','%s stars'=>'%s xiddigood','%s time'=>'Waqtiga %s','%s times'=>'%s jeer','You have successfully updated your %s.'=>'Waxaad si guul leh u cusboonaysiisay %s kaaga.','as annual periodyear'=>'Sannad','interjection expressing joy or exuberanceYee-haw'=>'Haye!','Yes'=>'Haa','You are all good!'=>'Wax walba waa hagaag!','You are just one step away - %s'=>'Waxaad u jirtaa hal tallaabo oo keliya - %s','Seems like you got the latest release.'=>'Waxay u muuqataa inaad heshay noocii ugu dambeeyay.','You should receive %3$s for %1$s to your mailbox at %2$s in the next 5 minutes.'=>'Waa inaad ku heshaa %3$s oo loogu talagalay %1$s sanduuqaaga boostada ee %2$s 5-ta daqiiqo ee soo socota gudahooda.','ZIP / Postal Code'=>'Koodhka Boostada',' %1$s to access version %2$s security & feature updates, and support.'=>' %1$s si aad u hesho cusboonaysiinta amniga iyo astaamaha nooca %2$s, iyo taageero.','%1$s automatic security & feature updates and paid functionality will keep working without interruptions until %2$s (or when your license expires, whatever comes first).'=>'%1$s cusbooneysiinta tooska ah ee amniga & qaababka iyo shaqooyinka lacagta lagu bixiyo waxay sii shaqeyn doonaan carqalad la\'aan ilaa %2$s (ama marka uu shatigaagu dhaco, kii soo hor maraba).','%1$s to access version %2$s security & feature updates, and support.'=>'%1$s si aad u hesho cusboonaysiinta amniga & astaamaha ee nooca %2$s, iyo taageerada.','API'=>'API','An unknown error has occurred while trying to set the user\'s beta mode.'=>'Khalad aan la aqoon ayaa dhacay intii la isku dayayey in la dejiyo habka tijaabada (beta) ee isticmaalaha.','An unknown error has occurred while trying to toggle the license\'s white-label mode.'=>'Khalad aan la garanayn ayaa dhacay intii la isku dayayey in la rogo habka calaamadda cad ee shatiga.','Annual'=>'Sannadle ah','By clicking "Opt Out", %s will no longer be able to view your name and email.'=>'Markaad gujiso "Ka bax", %s mar dambe ma awoodi doono inuu arko magacaaga iyo iimaylkaaga.','By clicking "Opt Out", diagnostic data will no longer be sent to %s.'=>'Markaad gujiso "Ka bax", xogta baaritaanka mar dambe looma diri doono %s.','By disconnecting the website, previously shared diagnostic data about %1$s will be deleted and no longer visible to %2$s.'=>'Marka la gooyo xiriirka bogga internetka, xogta ogaanshaha ee hore loo wadaagay ee ku saabsan %1$s waa la tirtiri doonaa loomana arki doono %2$s mar dambe.','By opting out from sharing this information with the updates server, you’ll have to check for new %1$s releases and manually download & install them. Not just a hassle, but missing an update can put your site at risk and cause undue compatibility issues, so we highly recommend keeping these essential permissions on.'=>'Markaad ka baxdo wadaagista macluumaadkan lala wadaagayo serferka cusboonaysiinta, waa inaad adigu iskaa u hubisaa noocyada cusub ee %1$s oo aad gacanta ku soo dejisataa oo aad ku rakibtaa. Kaliya maahan dhibaato, laakiin ka baaqsashada cusboonaysiinta waxay gelin kartaa boggaaga khatar waxayna sababi kartaa arrimo is-waafajin oo aan loo baahnayn, sidaas darteed waxaan si adag ugu talinaynaa in oggolaanshahaan muhiimka ah la shido.','Cancel %1$s - I no longer need any security & feature updates, nor support for %2$s because I\'m not planning to use the %3$s on this, or any other site.'=>'Jooji %1$s - Uma baahni wax dambe oo ah cusboonaysiinta amniga & astaamaha, ama taageerada %2$s sababtoo ah qorshaha iguma jirto inaan %3$s ku isticmaalo kan, ama degel kale toona.','Cancel %s?'=>'Ma joojisaa %s?','Cancelling %s'=>'Waa la baabi\'inayaa %s','Cancelling %s...'=>'Waxa la baabi\'inayaa %s...','Click here'=>'Halkan guji','Deactivating'=>'Deminaya','Disconnecting the website will permanently remove %s from your User Dashboard\'s account.'=>'Kala goynta websaydhadhku waxay si joogto ah %s uga saari doontaa koontadaada Dashboodhka Isticmaalaha.','For automatic delivery of security & feature updates, and license management & protection, %s needs to:'=>'Si si toos ah loogu helo cusbooneysiinta amniga iyo astaamaha, iyo maamulka iyo ilaalinta shatiga, %s wuxuu u baahan yahay inuu:','For delivery of security & feature updates, and license management, %s needs to'=>'Si loo bixiyo cusbooneysiinta amniga iyo astaamaha, iyo maareynta shatiga, %s wuxuu u baahan yahay inuu','Freemius is our licensing and software updates engine'=>'Freemius waa habka aan u adeegsanno shatiyada iyo cusboonaysiinta barnaamijyada','If this is a long term duplicate, to keep automatic updates and paid functionality after %1$s, please %2$s.'=>'Haddii tani tahay nuqul waqti dheer ah, si aad u sii haysato cusboonaysiinta tooska ah iyo shaqooyinka lacagta lagu bixiyo kadib %1$s, fadlan %2$s.','Is %2$s a duplicate of %4$s?'=>'%2$s ma nuqul labaad baa ka mid ah %4$s?','Join the Beta Program'=>'Ku biir Barnaamijka Beta-da','Join the Beta program'=>'Ku biir barnaamijka Beta','License'=>'Shatiga','License Key'=>'Furaha Shatiga','License key'=>'Furaha shatiga','Monthly'=>'Bishiiba','Names, slugs, versions, and if active or not'=>'Magacyada, slagyada, noocyada, iyo haddii uu shaqaynayo iyo haddii kale','New Version Available'=>'Nooc Cusub Ayaa Diyaar Ah','Optional'=>'Ikhtiyaari','Plan'=>'Qorshe','Products'=>'Alaabta','Sharing diagnostic data helps to provide additional functionality that\'s relevant to your website, avoid WordPress or PHP version incompatibilities that can break the website, and recognize which languages & regions the %s should be translated and tailored to.'=>'Wadaagista xogta ogaanshaha waxay gacan ka geysataa bixinta shaqooyin dheeraad ah oo khuseeya mareegtaada, ka fogaanshaha is-waafaqid la\'aanta nooca WordPress ama PHP ee burburin kara mareegta, iyo garashada luqadaha & gobollada ay tahay in %s loo turjumo loona habeeyo.','So you can reuse the license when the %s is no longer active.'=>'Si aad dib ugu isticmaasho shatiga marka %s uusan mar dambe shaqeyneyn.','Subscription'=>'Rukummada','The %1$s will be periodically sending essential license data to %2$s to check for security and feature updates, and verify the validity of your license.'=>'%1$s wuxuu xilliyo go\'an xogta muhiimka ah ee shatiga u diri doonaa %2$s si uu u hubiyo cusboonaysiinta amniga iyo astaamaha cusub, ugana xaqiijiyo ansaxnimada shatigaaga.','There is a %1$s of %2$s available.'=>'Waxaa jira %1$s oo ka mid ah %2$s oo la heli karo.','To ensure compatibility and avoid conflicts with your installed plugins and themes.'=>'Si loo xaqiijiyo iswaafaqsanaanta loogana fogaado iska hor imaadyada ku lifaaqyadaada iyo mawduucyadaada rakiban.','Trial'=>'Tijaabo','View %s State'=>'Fiiri Xaaladda %s','View Basic %s Info'=>'Arag macluumaadka guud ee %s','Yes, %2$s is a duplicate of %4$s for the purpose of testing, staging, or development.'=>'Haa, %2$s waa nuqul ka mid ah %4$s oo loogu talagalay tijaabinta, diyaargarowga, ama horumarinta.','You have a %s license.'=>'Waxaad haysataa shatiga %s.','You have purchased a %s license.'=>'Waxaad iibsatay shatiga %s.','You should receive a confirmation email for %1$s to your mailbox at %2$s. Please make sure you click the button in that email to %3$s.'=>'Waa inaad iimayl xaqiijin ah oo ku saabsan %1$s ku heshaa sanduuqaaga boostada ee %2$s. Fadlan hubi inaad riixdo batoonka ku jira iimaylkaas si aad u %3$s.','days'=>'maalmood','deactivating'=>'la daminayaa','hour'=>'saac','hours'=>'Saacado','license'=>'laysin','optional'=>'ikhtiyaari ah','products'=>'Badeecadaha','skip'=>'Ka bood','subscription'=>'Rukummada','trial'=>'Tijaabo','Clone resolution admin notice products list labelProducts'=>'Balaaxyada','as activating pluginActivating'=>'Hawlgelinaya','as software licenseLicense'=>'Shatiga','close a windowDismiss'=>'Iska indhatir','close windowDismiss'=>'Iska indhatir','like websitesSites'=>'Goobaha','nounPricing'=>'Qiimaha','trial periodTrial'=>'Tijaabo','verbOpt In'=>'Ka Qaybgal','verbOpt Out'=>'Ka bax','verbSkip'=>'Ka bood','verbUpgrade'=>'Casriyeey','x-ago%s ago'=>'%s kahor','The action could not be completed. Try again, and if it keeps failing, contact the site administrator.'=>'Falka lama dhamaystiri karin. Mar kale isku day, haddii ay weli shaqayn weydana, la xiriir maamulaha goobta.','A required value is missing or has the wrong form. Check the ability\'s input schema.'=>'Qiime loo baahnaa ayaa maqan ama qaab khaldan leh. Fiiri nidaamka gelinta (input schema) ee awoodda.','The site refused the request.'=>'Boggu wuxuu diiday codsigii.','AI agents (MCP)'=>'Wakiillada AI (MCP)','Let AI assistants such as Claude, Cursor or VS Code work on this site for you through MCP (Model Context Protocol). They sign in as a WordPress user with an application password and can do only what that user is allowed to do.'=>'U oggolow kaaliyeyaasha AI sida Claude, Cursor ama VS Code inay goobtan kuugu shaqeeyaan iyagoo adeegsanaya MCP (Model Context Protocol). Waxay ku soo galaan isticmaale WordPress ahaan iyagoo wata erayga sirta ah ee abka, waxayna qaban karaan oo keliya waxa isticmaalahaas loo oggol yahay inuu sameeyo.','AI agents need WordPress 6.9 or later. Update WordPress to use them.'=>'Wakiilada AI waxay u baahan yihiin WordPress 6.9 ama ka dambeeya. Cusboonaysii WordPress si aad u isticmaasho.','Allow AI agents (MCP)'=>'Oggolow wakiilada AI (MCP)','Off: the tools below and their REST routes are not registered at all.'=>'Dami: qalabka hoose iyo waddooyinkooda REST gabi ahaanba lama diiwaangelin.','Connection address (MCP endpoint)'=>'Cinwaanka xiriirka (barta dhammaadka MCP)','Create an application password for your user'=>'U samee furaha sirta ah ee abka isticmaalahaaga','Add this to your AI app’s MCP settings, with your username and that password:'=>'Ku dar tan habaynta MCP ee barnaamijkaaga AI, adigoo wata magacaaga isticmaalaha iyo eraygaas sirta ah:','VS Code: put the same entry under "servers" in .vscode/mcp.json, not under "mcpServers".'=>'VS Code: geli isla gelitaanka hoosta "servers" ee .vscode/mcp.json, ee ha gelin hoosta "mcpServers".','Tools an AI agent can use here (%d):'=>'Qalabka wakiilka AI uu halkan ku isticmaali karo (%d):','User guide: AI agents and MCP'=>'Hagaha isticmaalaha: Wakiilada AI iyo MCP','Developer docs: abilities, REST and MCP'=>'Dukumentiyada horumariyaha: awoodaha, REST iyo MCP','Build and edit this site\'s pages from Page Builder Sandwich sections and website kits.'=>'Ka dhis oo wax ka beddel boggaga goobtan qaybaha Page Builder Sandwich iyo qalabka degelka.','Pages, sections and website kits.'=>'Bogag, qaybo iyo qalabka mareegaha.','List pages'=>'Liis garee boggaga','Lists the pages you can edit, newest first, with an optional search.'=>'Waxay liis gareysaa boggaga aad wax ka beddeli karto, kuwa ugu cusub marka hore, oo leh raadin ikhtiyaari ah.','Words to search for in the title and content.'=>'Erayada laga raadinayo cinwaanka iyo nuxurka.','Read a page'=>'Akhriso bog','Returns a page\'s title, status, links and block content, and the sections (top-level blocks) it is made of.'=>'Waxay soo celisaa cinwaanka bogga, heerka, xiriiriyeyaasha iyo nuxurka baloogga, iyo qaybaha (baloogyada heerka sare) ee uu ka kooban yahay.','Create a page'=>'Samee bog','Creates a page from sections (see pbs/list-sections) and/or block content. A new page is a draft unless another status is asked for.'=>'Waxay bog ka abuurtaa qaybo (eeg pbs/list-sections) iyo/ama nuxurka baloogga. Bog cusub waa qabyo-qoraal ilaa xaalad kale la codsado mooyee.','Update a page'=>'Cusboonaysii bog','Changes a page\'s title, status or block content. Content you send replaces the page\'s content.'=>'Waxay beddeshaa cinwaanka bogga, xaaladda ama nuxurka baloogga. Nuxurka aad dirto wuxuu beddelayaa nuxurka bogga.','List sections'=>'Qaybaha tax','Lists the ready-made sections (hero, features, FAQ, testimonials, call to action and more) that can be added to a page.'=>'Waxay liis gareysaa qaybaha diyaarka ah (hero, astaamaha, Su\'aalaha Badanaa La Isweydiiyo, markhaatiyada, baaq ficil iyo waxyaabo kale) ee lagu dari karo bogga.','Words to match in a section\'s name or keywords.'=>'Erayada lagu beegsanayo magaca qaybta ama ereyada furaha.','Add a section to a page'=>'Ku dar qayb bogga','Adds a ready-made section to a page: at the start, at the end, or after the section at a given position.'=>'Bogga wuxuu ku darayaa qayb diyaarsan: bilowga, dhammaadka, ama ka dib qaybta ku taal meel cayiman.','A section name from pbs/list-sections.'=>'Magaca qayb ka socda pbs/list-sections.','With position "after": the 0-based position of the section to insert after.'=>'Booska "after": booska eber-ku-saleysan ee qaybta la gelinayo kaddib.','List website kits'=>'Liis garee qalabka shabakadda','Lists the website kits (a set of ready-made pages for one kind of business) this site can import.'=>'Waxay liis gareysaa xirmooyinka websaydka (bogag diyaarsan oo loogu talagalay hal nooc oo ganacsi ah) ee goobtan ay soo dejisan karto.','Import a website kit'=>'Soo dhoofso xirmo shabakadeed','Imports a website kit\'s pages (all of them, or the ones named), optionally publishing them, setting the home page and adding them to a menu. Importing again updates the same pages.'=>'Wuxuu soo geliyaa bogagga xirmada shabakadda (dhammaantood, ama kuwa la magacaabay), iyadoo ikhtiyaar loo leeyahay in la daabaco, la dejiyo bogga hoyga lagana daro meenuga. Dib u soo gelinta mar kale waxay cusbooneysiisaa isla bogaggaas.','List the builder blocks'=>'Liis garee baloogyada dhisaha','Lists every Page Builder Sandwich block this site can use (Pro blocks too when Pro is active): name, title, category and description. Use pbs/get-block for a block\'s settings, then put the block in a page\'s content.'=>'Wuxuu taxaa baloog kasta oo Page Builder Sandwich ah oo goobtani isticmaali karto (baloogyada Pro sidoo kale marka Pro uu shaqaynayo): magaca, cinwaanka, qaybta iyo sharaxaadda. U isticmaal pbs/get-block habaynta baloogga, ka dibna baloogga geli nuxurka bogga.','Describe a builder block'=>'Sharax baloogga dhise','Returns one block\'s settings (attributes with their types, choices and defaults), what it supports, which blocks it may contain, and a ready-to-use example in block markup.'=>'Waxay soo celisaa habaynta hal baloog (sifooyinka leh noocyadooda, xulashooyinka iyo kuwa caadiga ah), waxa ay taageerto, baloogyada ay ka koobnaan karto, iyo tusaale diyaarsan oo loo adeegsan karo calaamadaynta baloogga.','Where the block is: its position among the page\'s sections, then among that block\'s inner blocks, and so on (0-based), as pbs/get-page lists them.'=>'Halka balooggu ku yaal: booskiisa ka dhex jira qaybaha bogga, ka dibna baloogyada gudaha ee balooggaas, iyo wixii la mid ah (oo ka bilaabmaya 0), sida pbs/get-page u taxdo.','Change one block\'s settings'=>'Beddel habaynta hal baloog','Changes the settings (attributes) of one block inside a page, found by its path; attributes you send are merged over the current ones. Works on blocks the site renders from their settings; for a block whose HTML is saved in the page, send new markup with pbs/update-page.'=>'Waxay wax ka beddeshaa habaynta (sifooyinka) hal baloog oo ku dhex jira bog, oo lagu helo jidkiisa; sifooyinka aad dirto waxa lagu dhex daraa kuwa hadda jira. Waxay ku shaqaysaa baloogyada goobtu ka soo saarto habayntooda; baloogga HTML-kiisa lagu kaydiyay bogga, u soo dir calaamadayn cusub oo wadata pbs/update-page.','Remove a block from a page'=>'Ka saar baloog bogga','Removes one block (a whole section, or a block inside one) from a page, found by its path. The page\'s previous version stays in its revisions.'=>'Waxay bog ka saartaa hal baloog (qayb dhan, ama baloog ku dhex jira), oo lagu helay jidkiisa. Noocii hore ee bogga wuxuu ku sii jiraa dib-u-eegisyadiisa.','Move a section'=>'U rar qayb','Moves a section of a page from one position to another (0-based, as pbs/get-page lists them).'=>'Waxay qayb ka mid ah bogga ka raraysaa meel una wareejinaysaa meel kale (ku saleysan 0, sida ay pbs/get-page u taxdo).','Duplicate a page'=>'Nuqul ka samee bog','Copies a page (its title, content and template) into a new draft.'=>'Waxay bog (cinwaankiisa, nuxurkiisa iyo qaab-dhismeedkiisa) ku koobiyaysaa qabyo-qoraal cusub.','Move a page to the trash'=>'Bogga u rar qashinka','Moves a page to the trash. It can be restored from Pages, Trash for 30 days.'=>'Bogga wuxuu u rarayaa qashinka. Waxaa dib looga soo celin karaa Bogagga, Qashinka muddo 30 maalmood ah.','Build a landing page'=>'Dhis bogga soo degista','A guided workflow: the agent picks sections that fit your business, builds the page as a draft and writes its text.'=>'Hannaan shaqo oo la hago: wakiilku wuxuu dooranayaa qaybaha ku habboon meheraddaada, wuxuu u dhisayaa bogga qabyo-qoraal ahaan, wuxuuna qorayaa qoraalkiisa.','The business, its offer and its audience.'=>'Ganacsiga, waxa uu bixiyo iyo dhagaystayaashiisa.','A page can be a draft, pending review, published or private.'=>'Boggu wuxuu noqon karaa qabyo, dib u eegis sugaya, la daabacay ama mid gaar ah.','Give the page a title.'=>'Bogga cinwaan u yeel.','%s saves its HTML in the page, so its settings cannot be changed on their own. Send the page\'s new markup with pbs/update-page.'=>'%s wuxuu HTML-kiisa ku keydiyaa bogga, sidaas darteed habeyntiisa si gaar ah looma beddeli karo. Ku dir calaamadeynta cusub ee bogga pbs/update-page.','%s (copy)'=>'%s (koobi)','The page could not be moved to the trash.'=>'Bogga looma wareejin karin qashinka.','Build a landing page on this WordPress site for: %s. Steps: 1) call pbs-list-sections and choose 4 to 6 sections in a sensible order (hero first, a call to action last); 2) call pbs-create-page with a title and those sections, as a draft; 3) call pbs-get-page and rewrite every piece of placeholder text for this business with pbs-update-page (keep every block comment and tag as it is); 4) if pbs-generate-page is available, you may use it instead of steps 1 to 3; 5) report the page\'s edit link and do not publish it without asking.'=>'Ka dhis bog degis ah goobtan WordPress ee: %s. Tallaabooyinka: 1) wac pbs-list-sections oo dooro 4 ilaa 6 qaybood oo si macquul ah u kala horreeya (hero ugu horreeyo, baaq tallaabo ugu dambeeyo); 2) wac pbs-create-page adigoo wata cinwaan iyo qaybahaas, sida qabyo-qoraal ahaan; 3) wac pbs-get-page oo dib u qor qoraal kasta oo meel-haye ah ganacsigan adigoo isticmaalaya pbs-update-page (halkeedii ku daa faallada block-ga iyo calaamad kasta); 4) haddii pbs-generate-page la heli karo, waxaad u isticmaali kartaa beddelka tallaabooyinka 1 ilaa 3; 5) soo sheeg xiriirka wax-ka-beddelka bogga hana daabicin adigoon weydiin.','There is no block at that position. Read the page with pbs/get-page first.'=>'Booskaas wax baloog ah ma yaallaan. Marka hore ku akhri bogga pbs/get-page.','There is no block called "%s". See pbs/list-blocks.'=>'Ma jiro baloog la yiraahdo "%s". Eeg pbs/list-blocks.','The page has no section at that position.'=>'Boggu ma laha qayb meeshaas ku taal.','That is not a kit name. See pbs/list-kits.'=>'Kaasi ma aha magac xidhmo. Eeg pbs/list-kits.','There is no section called "%s". See pbs/list-sections.'=>'Ma jiro qayb la yiraahdo "%s". Eeg pbs/list-sections.','Section names from pbs/list-sections, in page order. They come before any content given.'=>'Magacyada qaybta ee laga helay pbs/list-sections, sida ay u kala horreeyaan bogga. Waxay ka horreeyaan wax kasta oo nuxur ah oo la bixiyay.','Block markup (the format the block editor saves).'=>'Calaamadeynta baloogga (qaabka uu tifaftiraha balooggu u keydiyo).','There is no page with that ID.'=>'Ma jiro bog leh aqoonsigaas.','You are not allowed to do that to this page.'=>'Laguma oggola inaad taas ku samayso boggan.','Connect Adobe Fonts (Pro)'=>'Ku xidh Adobe Fonts (Pro)','Connects an Adobe Fonts (Typekit) web project by its kit id, so its fonts appear in the font pickers.'=>'Wuxuu ku xiraa mashruuc shabakadeed oo Adobe Fonts (Typekit) ah adoo adeegsanaya kit id-giisa, si xarfahiisu uga soo muuqdaan meelaha xarfaha laga doorto.','Change the brand kit (Pro)'=>'Beddel qalabka sumadda (Pro)','Saves the brand kit: name, logo, colours, heading and body fonts, and the brand voice AI writing uses.'=>'Waxay kaydisaa qalabka astaanta: magaca, calaamadda, midabbada, farta cinwaanka iyo farta qoraalka guud, iyo codka astaanta ee qoraalka AI adeegsado.','Apply the brand kit (Pro)'=>'Codso qalabka sumadda (Pro)','Applies the saved brand kit\'s colours and fonts to the site design.'=>'Waxay midabada iyo xuruufta xirmada sumadda ee la keydiyay ku dabaqaysaa naqshadda goobta.','Read the responsive breakpoints'=>'Akhriso barta jabinta ee ka jawaab-celinta leh','Returns the tablet and mobile widths (and custom breakpoints in Pro) the responsive controls use.'=>'Waxay soo celisaa ballacyada tablet-ka iyo moobilka (iyo baraha kala goynta gaarka ah ee Pro) ee ay koontaroolada wax-ka-beddelka adeegsadaan.','Change the responsive breakpoints'=>'Beddel barta kala-jebinta ee jawaab-celinta leh','Changes the tablet and mobile widths in pixels; with Pro, custom extra breakpoints.'=>'Waxay ku beddelaysaa ballaca tablet-ka iyo moobiilka pixels; iyadoo leh Pro, meelo kale oo gaar ah oo lagu kala gooyo.','Create a global class (Pro)'=>'Abuur fasal caalami ah (Pro)','Creates a reusable global style class: label, slug and its styles (s).'=>'Waxay abuurtaa fasalka qaabka caalamiga ah ee dib loo isticmaali karo: sumad, slug iyo qaabkiisa (qaababkiisa).','Delete a global class (Pro)'=>'Tir fasalka guud (Pro)','Deletes a global class. Elements that used it keep their content and lose its styles.'=>'Waxay masaxdaa fasal guud. Walxaha isticmaalayay waxay sii haystaan waxa ku jira, laakiin waxay waayaan qaababkiisa.','Change a global class (Pro)'=>'Beddel fasal guud (Pro)','Changes a global class\'s label, slug or styles; every element using it updates.'=>'Waxay beddeshaa sumadda, slug-ga ama qaababka fasalka guud; curiye kasta oo isticmaalaya ayaa cusboonaysiisma.','Duplicate a global class (Pro)'=>'Nuqul ka samee fasalka guud (Pro)','Copies a global class under a new id.'=>'Waxay fasal caalami ah ku koobiyeysaa id cusub hoostiisa.','Turn on an uploaded font (Pro)'=>'Daar farta la soo geliyay (Pro)','Makes an uploaded custom font (a font file in the media library, by id) available in the font pickers.'=>'Waxay ka dhigaysaa farta gaarka ah ee la soo geliyay (faylka farta ee ku jira maktabadda warbaahinta, iyada oo la raacayo id) mid laga heli karo xulayaasha farta.','Turn off an uploaded font (Pro)'=>'Dami farta la soo geliyay (Pro)','Removes a custom font (by slug) from the font pickers.'=>'Waxay xaraf gaar ah (iyadoo la adeegsanayo slug) ka saartaa xulayaasha xarfaha.','Change dark mode (Pro)'=>'Baddal habka mugdiga (Pro)','Sets dark mode (mode: off, auto or toggle) and its colours.'=>'Wuxuu dejiyaa habka mugdiga ah (habka: dami, toos ama beddel) iyo midabbadiisa.','Read the site design'=>'Akhri qaabeynta bogga','Returns the site-wide colours and fonts (heading and body) every block uses, as the Site design screen shows them.'=>'Wuxuu soo celinayaa midabbada iyo xarfaha guud ahaan goobta (cinwaanka iyo qoraalka guud) ee baloog kasta isticmaalo, sida uu shaashadda naqshadda Goobtu u muujiso.','Change the site design'=>'Beddel qaabka goobta','Changes the site-wide colours (colors), fonts (fonts, headingFont, bodyFont). Every page picks the change up; the theme\'s theme.json is kept in sync.'=>'Waxay beddeshaa midabbada guud ee goobta (colors), faraha (fonts, headingFont, bodyFont). Bog kastaa wuxuu qaadanayaa isbeddelka; theme.json-ka mawduuca waxaa lagu hayaa iswaafajin.','Read the design system (Pro)'=>'Akhriso habka naqshadaynta (Pro)','Returns the Pro design system: global classes, variables, design tokens, dark mode, brand kit and custom fonts.'=>'Waxay soo celisaa nidaamka naqshadaynta Pro: fasallada caalamiga ah, doorsoomayaasha, calaamadaha naqshadaynta, qaabka mugdiga ah, xirmada astaanta iyo fartii gaarka ah.','Change the design tokens (Pro)'=>'Beddel calaamadaha naqshadda (Pro)','Changes the spacing, radius and shadow scales (space, radius, shadow), or resets them (reset).'=>'Waxay beddeshaa cabbirrada kala-fogaanshaha, wareegga iyo hooska (space, radius, shadow), ama dib ayay u dajisaa (reset).','Change the CSS variables (Pro)'=>'Beddel doorsoomayaasha CSS (Pro)','Replaces the site\'s design variables (variables: a list of name and value).'=>'Waxay beddeshaa doorsoomayaasha naqshadda goobta (doorsoomayaal: liis magac iyo qiimo ah).','List the dynamic content sources (Pro)'=>'Liiska ilaha nuxurka firfircoon (Pro)','Returns what a block can be filled from (post, author, site, archive, custom field, product) with each source\'s fields, the field plugins on this site (ACF, Meta Box, Pods, JetEngine, Toolset, post meta) and a post type\'s fields (postType). Bind a block with pbs/update-block: attributes.metadata.bindings.<attribute> = {source, args}.'=>'Waxay soo celisaa waxa baloog laga buuxin karo (post, author, site, archive, custom field, product) oo ay weheliyaan goobaha il kasta, furayaasha goobta ee goobtan (ACF, Meta Box, Pods, JetEngine, Toolset, post meta) iyo goobaha nooca qoraalka (postType). Ku xidh baloog pbs/update-block: attributes.metadata.bindings.<attribute> = {source, args}.','Preview a dynamic value (Pro)'=>'Hordhac qiimo firfircoon (Pro)','Returns what a binding shows on one post (post, source, and field or provider + key, as text|url), to check a binding before or after adding it.'=>'Waxay soo celisaa waxa xidhiidhintu ku muujiso hal qoraal (qoraal, il, iyo beer ama bixiye + fure, ahaan text|url), si loo hubiyo xidhiidhinta ka hor ama ka dib marka lagu daro.','Remove a self-hosted font'=>'Ka saar fartan aad adigu martigelisay','Deletes a self-hosted font family\'s files.'=>'Waxay masaxdaa faylasha qoyska farta ee boggan isagu martigeliyo.','List self-hosted fonts'=>'Liis garee farta martigelinta madaxa-bannaan','Lists the Google fonts this site hosts itself (downloaded once, served from the site, no request to Google).'=>'Waxay taxdaa faraha Google ee goobtan lafteedu martigeliso (hal mar la soo dejiyay, laga bixiyo goobta, wax codsi ah Google uma socdo).','Self-host a font'=>'Isku-martiqaad far-qoraal','Downloads a Google font family (family, weights, italic) and serves it from this site.'=>'Waxay soo dejisaa qoyska farta Google (qoyska, culeysyada, farta faalka ah) waxayna ka adeegtaa boggan.','List forms'=>'Liis garee foomamka','Lists the forms built with the Form block and the form plugins it can embed.'=>'Waxay liis gartaa foomamka lagu dhisay baloogga Form iyo furayaasha foomamka ee ay ku dhex dari karto.','List uploaded icons'=>'Liis garee astaamaha la soo galiyay','Lists the SVG icons uploaded to the icon library, newest first.'=>'Wuxuu taxaa astaamaha SVG ee lagu shubay maktabadda astaamaha, kan ugu cusub ayaa ugu horreeya.','Upload an icon'=>'Soo geli astaan','Adds an SVG icon (name, svg markup) to the icon library; the SVG is sanitised first.'=>'Wuxuu ku darayaa astaanta SVG (magaca, calaamadaynta svg) maktabadda astaamaha; marka hore SVG-ga waa la safeeyaa.','Delete an uploaded icon'=>'Tirtir calaamad la soo geliyay','Removes an uploaded icon; blocks that used it keep their own copy.'=>'Waxay meesha ka saaraysaa astaanta la soo geliyay; baloogyadii adeegsaday waxay haysanayaan nuqulkooda.','Read the licence'=>'Akhriso shatiga','Returns this site\'s Page Builder Sandwich plan, licence state, renewal date and what the plan includes.'=>'Waxay soo celisaa qorshaha Page Builder Sandwich ee boggan, heerka shatiga, taariikhda dib-u-cusboonaysiinta iyo waxa uu qorshuhu ka kooban yahay.','Disconnect from support'=>'Ka go\' taageerada','Disconnects this site from support.'=>'Goobtan waxa ay ka goynaysaa taageerada.','Read the support connection'=>'Akhriso xiriirka taageerada','Says whether this site is connected to Zinn Digital® support, and as whom.'=>'Waxay sheegaysaa haddii boggani ku xidhan yahay taageerada Zinn Digital®, iyo qofka ahaan.','Connect to support'=>'Ku xirnow taageerada','Connects this site to Zinn Digital® support (name, email, consent).'=>'Waxay goobtan ku xiraysaa taageerada Zinn Digital® (magaca, iimaylka, oggolaanshaha).','Consent to support diagnostics'=>'Oggolaanshaha baaritaanka caawinta','Records the administrator\'s consent to send diagnostics with support tickets.'=>'Wuxuu diiwaangeliyaa oggolaanshaha maamulaha ee dirista xogta ogaanshaha cilladaha oo la socota codsiyada caawinta.','Read the site diagnostics'=>'Akhri baaritaannada goobta','Returns the diagnostics a support ticket would carry: versions, active plugins, limits and recent errors.'=>'Waxay soo celisaa ogaanshaha cilladaha uu kaar taageero wadan lahaa: noocyada, furayaasha firfircoon, xaddidaadaha iyo khaladaadka dhowaan dhacay.','Open a support ticket'=>'Fur tigidhka caawinta','Files a support ticket (subject, message, kind, email), with this site\'s diagnostics when the administrator agreed. It never creates a login or sends one.'=>'Waxay gudbisaa tigidh taageero (mawduuc, fariin, nooc, iimayl), oo ay la socdaan xogta baadhista boggan marka maamuluhu oggolaado. Weligeed ma abuurto galitaanka mana dirto midna.','Start the free Pro trial'=>'Bilow tijaabada bilaashka ah ee Pro','Starts the 14-day Page Builder Sandwich Pro trial for this site (no payment needed).'=>'Waxay bilaabaysaa tijaabada 14-ka maalmood ee Page Builder Sandwich Pro ee goobtan (wax lacag bixin ah looma baahna).','Read the cloud library account (Pro)'=>'Akhriso koontada maktabadda daruurta (Pro)','Returns the cloud library\'s storage use, plan quota and team facts.'=>'Waxay soo celisaa isticmaalka kaydka maktabadda daruurta, xaddiga qorshaha iyo xogta kooxda.','List cloud library designs (Pro)'=>'Qor naqshadaha maktabadda daruurta (Pro)','Lists the designs saved to the cloud library (kind: section, page or pattern; team: a team\'s library).'=>'Waxay liis gareysaa naqshadaha lagu keydiyay maktabadda daruuraha (nooca: qayb, bog ama qaab; kooxda: maktabadda kooxda).','Save a design to the cloud library (Pro)'=>'Ku kaydi naqshad maktabadda daruuraha (Pro)','Saves block markup (title, kind, markup, styles, tags) to your cloud library or a team\'s; images are packed with it.'=>'Waxay ku kaydisaa calaamadaynta baloogga (cinwaanka, nooca, calaamadaynta, qaababka, summadaha) maktabaddaada daruurta ama tan kooxda; sawirrada waxa lagu xidhaa iyada.','Delete a cloud library design (Pro)'=>'Tirtir naqshadda maktabadda daruurta (Pro)','Deletes a design from the cloud library.'=>'Waxay naqshad ka masaxdaa maktabadda daruuraha.','Get a cloud library design (Pro)'=>'Hel naqshadda maktabadda daruurta (Pro)','Returns one saved design, ready to insert on this site (its images brought into the media library).'=>'Waxay soo celisaa hal naqshad oo la keydiyay, diyaarna u ah in lagu daro boggan (sawirradeeda waxaa la keenay maktabadda warbaahinta).','Leave a team (Pro)'=>'Ka bax koox (Pro)','Leaves the team library this site joined.'=>'Waxay ka baxaysaa maktabadda kooxda ee goobtan ku biirtay.','Join a team (Pro)'=>'Ku biir koox (Pro)','Joins a team library with an invite code.'=>'Ku biir maktabadda kooxda adoo adeegsanaya koodhka casuumaadda.','Stop using your own storage (Pro)'=>'Jooji isticmaalka kaydintaada (Pro)','Removes the bring-your-own storage settings; the plan storage is used again.'=>'Waxay meesha ka saaraysaa habaynta kaydinta aad adigu keensatay; kaydinta qorshaha ayaa dib loo isticmaali doonaa.','Read the own-storage settings (Pro)'=>'Akhri goobaha kaydintaada (Pro)','Returns the bring-your-own R2/S3 storage settings (the secret is never returned).'=>'Waxay soo celisaa habaynta kaydinta R2/S3 ee aad adigu keensatay (sirta waligeed lama soo celiyo).','Use your own storage (Pro)'=>'Isticmaal kaydintaada gaarka ah (Pro)','Saves bring-your-own storage: provider (r2 or s3), bucket, region, endpoint, prefix, key_id, secret, enabled.'=>'Wuxuu kaydiyaa keen-kaydintaada: bixiyaha (r2 ama s3), bucket, gobolka, endpoint, prefix, key_id, secret, shaqaynaya.','Test your own storage (Pro)'=>'Tijaabi kaydkaaga gaarka ah (Pro)','Writes, reads and deletes a test object in your own storage and reports each step.'=>'Waxay ku qortaa, ka akhrisaa oo ka tirtirtaa walax tijaabo ah kaydkaaga waxayna soo sheegtaa tallaabo kasta.','List library teams (Pro)'=>'Liis garee kooxaha maktabadda (Pro)','Lists the teams this site belongs to or owns.'=>'Waxay liis gareysaa kooxaha ay boggani ka tirsan tahay ama ay leedahay.','Create a library team (Agency)'=>'Samee koox maktabad ah (Wakaalad)','Creates a team library (name) that other sites can join with an invite code.'=>'Wuxuu abuuraa maktabad kooxeed (magac) oo boggaga kale kaga biiri karaan koodhka casuumaadda.','Delete a library team (Agency)'=>'Tirtir kooxda maktabadda (Wakaaladda)','Deletes a team and every design in its library.'=>'Waxay masaxdaa koox iyo naqshad kasta oo ku jirta maktabaddeeda.','Invite a site to a team (Agency)'=>'Ku martiqaad degel koox (Wakaalad)','Creates a single-use invite code (role: read or write; label; days valid). The code is shown once.'=>'Wuxuu abuuraa koodh martiqaad oo hal mar la isticmaalo (doorka: akhrin ama qoris; summad; maalmaha uu shaqaynayo). Koodhka waxaa la muujiyaa hal mar oo keliya.','List team members (Pro)'=>'Liis garee xubnaha kooxda (Pro)','Lists the sites in a team and their access.'=>'Waxay taxdaa boggaga kooxda ku jira iyo gelitaankooda.','Remove a team member (Agency)'=>'Ka saar xubin kooxda (Wakaalad)','Removes a site from a team.'=>'Bogga wuxuu ka saarayaa koox.','Add a query loop (Pro)'=>'Ku dar wareegga weydiinta (Pro)','Adds a query loop with a ready-made card, on a new page (pageTitle, status) or at the end of a post (post): source posts|users|terms|field, postType (product for a shop grid), perPage, columns, orderBy, order, pagination, and live filters [{type: search|taxonomy|meta|sort|price|onsale|instock, taxonomy, key, label, ui}].'=>'Waxay ku daraysaa wareegga weydiinta (query loop) oo wata kaadh diyaarsan, bog cusub (pageTitle, status) ama dhamaadka qoraalka (post): ilaha posts|users|terms|field, postType (product ee shaxda dukaanka), perPage, columns, orderBy, order, bogeynta, iyo shaandhooyinka tooska ah [{type: search|taxonomy|meta|sort|price|onsale|instock, taxonomy, key, label, ui}].','List Lottie animations (Pro)'=>'Liis garee dhaqdhaqaaqyada Lottie (Pro)','Lists the uploaded Lottie animations.'=>'Waxay liis gareysaa animations-ka Lottie ee la soo geliyay.','Upload a Lottie animation (Pro)'=>'Soo geli muuqaal socda oo Lottie ah (Pro)','Validates a Lottie JSON document (json, name) and publishes it as a static file for the Lottie block.'=>'Wuxuu ansixinayaa dukumeentiga Lottie JSON (json, name) wuxuuna u daabacayaa sidii fayl ma guurto ah oo loogu talagalay Lottie block.','List the A/B tests and their results (Pro)'=>'Liis garee tijaabooyinka A/B iyo natiijooyinkooda (Pro)','Lists the A/B tests with each version\'s visitors and conversions, and which one is winning.'=>'Waxay liis garaysaa tijaabooyinka A/B oo ay la socdaan booqdayaasha iyo beddelka nooc kasta, iyo midka guuleysanaya.','Create an A/B test (Pro)'=>'Abuur tijaabada A/B (Pro)','Adds a test of two versions of a section to the end of a post (post, name, a, b; split and goal optional).'=>'Waxay imtixaan laba nooc oo qayb ah ku daraysaa dhammaadka qoraalka (qoraal, magac, a, b; kala qaybinta iyo yoolka waa ikhtiyaari).','Reset an A/B test\'s results (Pro)'=>'Dib u deji natiijooyinka tijaabada A/B (Pro)','Clears a test\'s counts and starts it again (test).'=>'Waxay tirtirtaa tirinta tijaabada waxayna dib u bilawdaa mar kale (tijaabo).','List the mailing-list connections (Pro)'=>'Liis garee xiriirada liiska fariimaha (Pro)','Lists the mailing-list services (Mailchimp, Brevo, MailerLite, Kit, ActiveCampaign) and which are connected. Keys are never returned.'=>'Waxay liis gareysaa adeegyada liiska boostada (Mailchimp, Brevo, MailerLite, Kit, ActiveCampaign) iyo kuwa ku xiran. Furayaasha waligood dib looma soo celiyo.','Connect a mailing-list service (Pro)'=>'Ku xidh adeegga liiska boostada (Pro)','Connects a mailing-list service with its API key (service, key; account where the service needs one), or disconnects it with an empty key.'=>'Waxay ku xireysaa adeegga liiska boostada furihiisa API (adeegga, furaha; akoonka meesha adeeggu mid uga baahan yahay), ama waxay ku goysaa fure madhan.','List a service\'s mailing lists (Pro)'=>'Liis garee liisaska boostada ee adeegga (Pro)','Lists the audiences or lists of a connected mailing-list service, for a form\'s subscribe action.'=>'Waxay liis gareysaa dhagaystayaasha ama liisaska adeegga liiska boostada ee ku xiran, ficilka isdiiwaangelinta foomka.','Read the cookie consent banner (Pro)'=>'Akhriso boorarka oggolaanshaha cookie-ga (Pro)','Returns the consent banner: whether it is on, its text and design, the categories, and where it applies.'=>'Waxay soo celisaa boorarka oggolaanshaha: haddii uu shaqaynayo, qoraalkiisa iyo qaab-dhismeedkiisa, qaybaha, iyo meelaha uu ka shaqeeyo.','Change the cookie consent banner (Pro)'=>'Beddel boorarka ogolaanshaha kookiyada (Pro)','Changes the consent banner. While it is on, tracking scripts wait for the visitor\'s consent.'=>'Wuxuu beddelaa boodhka oggolaanshaha. Inta uu shidan yahay, qoraallada raadraaca waxay sugayaan oggolaanshaha booqdaha.','Create a starter cookie banner (Pro)'=>'Abuur boodhka buskudka ee bilowga ah (Pro)','Creates a ready-made consent banner design to start from.'=>'Waxay abuurtaa naqshad banner oggolaansho ah oo diyaarsan oo laga bilaabo.','List the form-builder forms (Pro)'=>'Liis garee foomamka sameeyaha foomamka (Pro)','Lists every form made with the form builder: the page it is on, its fields and what happens when it is sent.'=>'Wuxuu taxaa foom kasta oo lagu sameeyay dhisaha foomka: bogga uu ku yaal, meelaha bannaan ee la buuxiyo iyo waxa dhacaya marka la diro.','Create a form (Pro)'=>'Samee foom (Pro)','Creates a form (contact, quote, signup or multi-step: fields, steps, settings and actions such as email, save, webhook or a mailing list), on a new page or at the end of an existing post (post).'=>'Wuxuu abuuraa foom (xiriir, qiime-sheegid, isdiiwaangelin ama tallaabooyin badan: beeraha xogta, tallaabooyinka, habaynta iyo ficillada sida iimaylka, keydinta, webhook ama liiska boostada), bog cusub ama dhammaadka qoraal hore u jiray (qoraal).','Change a form (Pro)'=>'Beddel foom (Pro)','Changes one form (post, form): settings and actions merge with what is there; fields (and steps) replace the fields.'=>'Waxay beddeshaa hal foom (qoraal, foom): goobaha iyo ficillada waxay ku milmaan waxa meesha yaal; meelaha bannaan (iyo tallaabooyinka) waxay beddelaan meelaha bannaan.','List the animation and interaction settings (Pro)'=>'Liis garee habaynta animation-ka iyo isdhexgalka (Pro)','Returns every motion setting (entrance animation, its length and delay, scroll effect, hover effect, stay in view, parallax, follow the pointer) with its choices or range, and the site\'s breakpoints.'=>'Waxay soo celinaysaa habayn kasta oo dhaqdhaqaaq ah (dhaqdhaqaaqa gelitaanka, dhererkiisa iyo dib-u-dhiciisa, saamaynta rogga, saamaynta dul-istaagga, ku jiritaanka aragga, parallax, raacitaanka tilmaamaha) oo ay la socdaan kala-doorashooyinkiisa ama inta uu le\'eg yahay, iyo baraha kala-jabsanaanta ee goobta.','Animate a block (Pro)'=>'Dhaqaaji baloog (Pro)','Sets or removes (null) motion settings on one block of a page, found by its path, at a breakpoint (base by default). Works on any block, including core blocks whose HTML is saved in the page. Visitors who ask for reduced motion never see the movement.'=>'Wuxuu dejiyaa ama ka saaraa (null) dejinta dhaqaaqa ee hal xir oo bog ku jira, oo lagu helo jidkiisa, barta jabinta (base haddii aan la cayimin). Wuxuu ku shaqeeyaa xir kasta, oo ay ku jiraan xirarka aasaasiga ah ee HTML-koodu ku kaydsan yahay bogga. Booqdayaasha codsada dhaqaaq yar weligood ma arkaan dhaqaaqa.','List the popups (Pro)'=>'Liis garee daaqadaha soo booda (Pro)','Lists the popups, slide-ins and bars with their triggers, frequency rules and where they show.'=>'Waxay taxdaa daaqadaha soo booda, kuwa dhinaca ka soo gala iyo xariijimaha, iyo waxa kiciya, xeerarka inta jeer ee ay muuqdaan iyo meelaha ay ka muuqdaan.','Create a popup (Pro)'=>'Samee daaqad soo boodda ah (Pro)','Creates a popup, slide-in or bar: its content, trigger (exit intent, scroll, time, click), frequency and the pages it shows on.'=>'Waxay abuurtaa daaqad soo boodda, mid soo siqaysa ama baar: nuxurkeeda, waxa kiciya (damaca bixitaanka, rogidda bogga, wakhtiga, gujinta), inta jeer iyo boggaga ay ka soo muuqanayso.','Change a popup (Pro)'=>'Beddel daaqad boodda (Pro)','Changes a popup, slide-in or bar (id): content, trigger, frequency or where it shows.'=>'Waxay wax ka beddeshaa daaqad soo boodda, mid soo siqaysa ama baar (id): nuxurka, waxa kiciya, inta jeer ama meesha ay ka muuqanayso.','Read form submissions (Pro)'=>'Akhri xogaha foomka la soo gudbiyay (Pro)','Lists what visitors sent through the forms that save submissions (form narrows it), a page at a time.'=>'Wuxuu taxaa waxa booqdayaashu ku soo direen foomamka kaydiya soo-gudbinta (foomka ayaa soo koobaya), hal bog markiiba.','Read the conversion tracking (Pro)'=>'Akhriso dabagalka beddelka (Pro)','Returns the Google Analytics 4, Google Tag Manager and Meta Pixel settings and which clicks and form submissions are sent.'=>'Waxay soo celisaa habaynta Google Analytics 4, Google Tag Manager iyo Meta Pixel iyo gujisyada iyo gudbinta foomamka la diro.','Change the conversion tracking (Pro)'=>'Beddel la-socoshada beddelka (Pro)','Changes the Google Analytics 4, Google Tag Manager and Meta Pixel settings and which events are sent.'=>'Waxay beddeshaa goobaha Google Analytics 4, Google Tag Manager iyo Meta Pixel iyo dhacdooyinka la diro.','Read the legacy migration'=>'Akhriso u guuriddii hore','Returns the 5.x content conversion\'s progress and report.'=>'Waxay soo celisaa horumarka iyo warbixinta beddelka nuxurka 5.x.','Convert legacy content'=>'Beddel nuxurka duugga ah','Starts (or restarts) converting every 5.x page to blocks; each post is backed up first.'=>'Wuxuu bilaabayaa (ama dib u bilaabayaa) u beddelidda bog kasta oo 5.x ah baloocyo; qoraal kasta marka hore waa la kaydiyaa.','Undo the legacy migration'=>'Ka noqo guuritaankii hore','Restores every converted post from its backup.'=>'Wuxuu dib u soo celiyaa qoraal kasta oo la beddelay isagoo ka keenaya kaydkiisa.','Read the newsletter connection (Pro)'=>'Akhriso xidhiidhka wargeyska (Pro)','Says whether a Mailchimp key is saved (the key itself is never returned).'=>'Waxay sheegaysaa haddii furaha Mailchimp la keydiyay (furaha laftiisa dib looma soo celiyo).','Connect Mailchimp (Pro)'=>'Ku xidh Mailchimp (Pro)','Saves (or, with an empty value, removes) the Mailchimp API key the newsletter block uses.'=>'Wuxuu kaydiyaa (ama, haddii qiimuhu maran yahay, ka saaraa) furaha Mailchimp API ee baloogga wargeysku isticmaalo.','Convert one legacy page'=>'Beddel hal bog oo hore','Converts one 5.x page to blocks (backed up first).'=>'Waxay hal bog oo 5.x ah u beddeshaa baloocyo (horay ayaa loo kaydiyay).','Undo one conversion'=>'Ka noqo hal beddelid','Restores one converted page from its backup.'=>'Waxay hal bog oo la beddelay ka soo celisaa kaydkiisa.','Read the reviews sources (Pro)'=>'Akhri ilaha faallooyinka (Pro)','Returns the Google and Trustpilot sources the Reviews block shows.'=>'Waxay soo celisaa ilaha Google iyo Trustpilot ee baloogga Reviews uu muujiyo.','Change the reviews sources (Pro)'=>'Beddel ilaha faallooyinka (Pro)','Sets the Google place and Trustpilot business the Reviews block reads.'=>'Waxay dejisaa goobta Google iyo ganacsiga Trustpilot ee baloogga Reviews akhriyo.','Refresh reviews now (Pro)'=>'Hada dib u cusboonaysii faallooyinka (Pro)','Fetches the latest Trustpilot reviews now instead of waiting for the daily refresh.'=>'Hadda ayuu soo qaadanayaa faallooyinkii Trustpilot ee ugu dambeeyay halkii la sugi lahaa cusboonaysiinta maalinlaha ah.','Read the plugin settings'=>'Akhriso habaynta fur-horyaalka','Returns the front-end class prefix, the beta-updates state and whether AI agents (MCP) are allowed.'=>'Waxay soo celisaa horgalaha fasalka ee xagga hore (front-end), heerka cusboonaysiinta beta iyo haddii wakiilada AI (MCP) la oggol yahay.','Change the plugin settings'=>'Beddel habaynta fur-xirka','Changes the front-end class prefix (1 to 8 lowercase letters or digits, starting with a letter) and/or turns AI agents (MCP) on or off (mcp: false removes every ability and the MCP endpoint).'=>'Waxay beddeshaa horgalaha fasalka front-end (1 ilaa 8 xaraf oo yaryar ama lambarro ah, oo ka bilaabmaya xaraf) iyo/ama shidaa ama damisaa wakiillada AI (MCP) (mcp: false waxay meesha ka saaraysaa awood kasta iyo barta dhammaadka ee MCP).','Add a product block or mini cart (Pro)'=>'Ku dar baloog badeecadeed ama gaari-gadeed yar (Pro)','Adds a WooCommerce block at the end of a post: a product element (part: title, gallery, image, price, rating, excerpt, description, add_to_cart, meta, tabs, related, upsells, sale_badge, stock; productId, or 0 for the product being viewed) or a mini cart (label).'=>'Waxay ku dartaa baloog WooCommerce dhammaadka qoraal: curiye badeecad (qayb: title, gallery, image, price, rating, excerpt, description, add_to_cart, meta, tabs, related, upsells, sale_badge, stock; productId, ama 0 badeecadda hadda la eegayo) ama gaari-yare (label).','Read the theme builder\'s choices (Pro)'=>'Akhriso xulashooyinka dhisaha mawduuca (Pro)','Returns the template types, the display-condition kinds (page, post type, term, archive, search, 404, logged in, role, device, date, time, URL parameter, referrer, language, cart) with their choices on this site (roles, languages, post types, taxonomies), and the block attribute (pbswConditions: {match, rules}) that shows or hides any block — set it with pbs/update-block.'=>'Waxay soo celisaa noocyada qaab-dhismeedka, noocyada xaaladda muujinta (bog, nooca qoraalka, eray, kayd, raadin, 404, ku jira nidaamka, doorka, aaladda, taariikhda, wakhtiga, cabbirka URL, tixraacaha, luqadda, gaadhiga wax-iibsiga) oo ay weheliyaan xulashooyinkooda goobtan (doorarka, luqadaha, noocyada qoraalka, canshuuraha), iyo sifo baloog (pbswConditions: {match, rules}) oo muujisa ama qarisa baloog kasta — ku deji pbs/update-block.','List the theme templates (Pro)'=>'Liis garee tusaalooyinka mawduuca (Pro)','Lists the theme builder\'s templates (header, footer, single, archive, search, 404 and, with WooCommerce, product, shop, cart, checkout, thank-you and My Account): each one\'s type, where it shows (include/exclude rules), priority, status and blocks.'=>'Waxay liis gareysaa tusmooyinka dhisaha mawduuca (madaxa, cagta, kelida, kaydka, raadinta, 404 iyo, marka la helo WooCommerce, alaabta, dukaanka, gaariga wax-iibsiga, bixinta lacagta, mahadnaqa iyo My Account): nooca mid kasta, meesha ay ka muuqato (xeerarka ku-daridda/ka-saaridda), mudnaanta, heerka xaaladda iyo baloogyada.','Create a theme template (Pro)'=>'Samee qaab-dhismeedka mawduuca (Pro)','Creates a template (title, type) that replaces that part of every matching page, on classic and block themes. Without content it starts from a ready-made design for its type. include/exclude are display-condition rules ({kind, values, key, value, from, to, days}; see pbs/get-theme-builder-options); priority breaks ties; status publish (live) or draft.'=>'Waxay abuurtaa template (title, type) kaas oo beddelaya qaybtaas bog kasta oo ku habboon, ee themes-ka classic-ka iyo block-ga ah. Haddii uusan lahayn wax kooban waxa uu ka bilaabmayaa naqshad diyaar u ah noociisa. include/exclude waa shuruucda shuruudaha soo-bandhigidda ({kind, values, key, value, from, to, days}; eeg pbs/get-theme-builder-options); priority waxay xallisaa barbar-dhaca; status waa publish (toos) ama draft.','Delete a theme template (Pro)'=>'Tirtir qaabka dulucda (Pro)','Moves one template (id) to the trash; the theme\'s own design shows again where it applied. Restorable from the trash.'=>'Waxay hal tembShoot (id) u rartaa qashinka; naqshadda mawduuca laftiisa ayaa mar kale ka muuqanaysa meeshii lagu dabaqay. Dib ayaa looga soo celin karaa qashinka.','Change a theme template (Pro)'=>'Beddel qaab-dhismeedka mawduuca (Pro)','Changes one template (id): any of title, type, content (block markup), include, exclude, priority, status. Only what you send changes.'=>'Waxay beddeshaa hal template (id): mid kasta oo ka mid ah cinwaanka, nooca, nuxurka (calaamadaynta baloogga), ku dar, ka reeb, mudnaanta, xaaladda. Waxa aad soo dirto oo keliya ayaa isbeddelaya.','Export designs and settings'=>'Dhoofi naqshadaha iyo habaynta','Exports the chosen templates and patterns (ids) and, optionally, settings as one package for another site.'=>'Wuxuu u dhoofiyaa qaababka iyo naqshadaha la doortay (ids) iyo, haddii la rabo, habaynnada hal xidhmo ahaan goob kale.','Import designs and settings'=>'Soo dhoofso naqshadaha iyo habaynnada','Imports a package made by pbs/export-designs (dryRun first to see what would change; mode: skip or replace; media; settings).'=>'Wuxuu soo dajiyaa xirmo ay sameysay pbs/export-designs (marka hore samee dryRun si aad u aragto waxa isbedeli doona; habka: skip ama replace; warbaahinta; dejinta).','List what can be exported'=>'Liis garee waxa la dhoofin karo','Lists the templates, patterns and settings that can be exported to another site.'=>'Waxay taxaysaa qaababka, qaabab-dhismeedka iyo habaynnada loo dhoofin karo degel kale.','Read maintenance mode (Pro)'=>'Akhriso habka dayactirka (Pro)','Returns maintenance / coming-soon mode: mode, page, retry-after and which roles still see the site.'=>'Waxay soo celisaa habka dayactirka / dhowaan-imaanaya: habka, bogga, retry-after iyo doorarka weli arkaya bogga.','Change maintenance mode (Pro)'=>'Beddel habka dayactirka (Pro)','Turns maintenance (503) or coming-soon mode on or off (mode), with the page to show (page_id), retry_after and the roles that bypass it.'=>'Wuxuu daaraa ama damiyaa habka dayactirka (503) ama dhowaan-filo (mode), oo ay la socdaan bogga la muujinayo (page_id), retry_after iyo doorarka ka gudbaya.','List find-and-replace jobs (Pro)'=>'Liis garee howlaha raadinta-iyo-beddelka (Pro)','Lists the site-wide find-and-replace jobs and their state.'=>'Waxay taxaysaa shaqooyinka raadinta-iyo-beddelka ee goobta oo dhan iyo xaaladdooda.','Find and replace across the site (Pro)'=>'Ka raadi oo ku beddel goobta oo dhan (Pro)','Starts a block-safe find-and-replace (find, replace, kind: text, link or colour; match_case; types). Nothing changes until pbs/apply-replace.'=>'Wuxuu bilaabayaa raadin-iyo-beddel ammaan u ah baloogga (raadi, beddel, nooc: qoraal, xiriiriye ama midab; match_case; noocyo). Waxba isma beddelayaan ilaa pbs/apply-replace.','Preview a find-and-replace (Pro)'=>'Horu-eeg raadi-oo-beddel (Pro)','Returns a job\'s matches, page by page, to review before applying.'=>'Waxay soo celisaa iswaafajinta shaqada, bogba bog, si dib loogu eego ka hor inta aan la codsan.','Apply a find-and-replace (Pro)'=>'Codso raadi-oo-beddel (Pro)','Applies a previewed job. Every changed post keeps a backup for pbs/undo-replace.'=>'Wuxuu adeegsadaa shaqo horay loo sii eegay. Qoraal kasta oo la beddelay wuxuu hayaa koobi kayd ah oo loogu talagalay pbs/undo-replace.','Undo a find-and-replace (Pro)'=>'Ka noqo raadi-oo-beddel (Pro)','Restores the posts a job changed (a post edited since keeps its edit).'=>'Waxay dib u soo celisaa qoraalladii uu shaqo beddelay (qoraalkii la beddelay wixii markaas ka dambeeyay wuxuu haynayaa beddelkiisa).','Read builder permissions (Pro)'=>'Akhriso rukhsadaha dhisaha (Pro)','Returns which roles may use the builder, design, code and templates (client mode).'=>'Waxay soo celinaysaa doorarka isticmaali kara dhisaha, naqshadda, koodhka iyo tusaalooyinka (habka macmiilka).','Change builder permissions (Pro)'=>'Beddel oggolaanshaha dhisaha (Pro)','Sets per role what the builder allows (roles), e.g. a content-only client role.'=>'Waxay door kasta u dejisaa waxa uu dhisuhu oggol yahay (doorarka), tusaale ahaan doorka macmiilka ee nuxurka keliya.','Read white label (Agency)'=>'Akhriso sumadda cad (Wakaalad)','Returns the white-label settings: on or off, the name shown and which users still see the original.'=>'Waxay soo celisaa habaynta calaamadda cad: shid ama dami, magaca la soo bandhigay iyo isticmaalayaasha weli arkaya asalka.','Change white label (Agency)'=>'Beddel sumadda gaarka ah (Wakaaladda)','Turns white label on or off and sets the name clients see (enabled, name, agency_users).'=>'Waxay shiddaa ama damisaa sumad-cadaynta (white label) waxayna dejisaa magaca ay macaamiishu arkaan (enabled, name, agency_users).','Build several pages'=>'Dhis bogag dhowr ah','Creates up to 50 pages in one call, each from sections and/or block content. Each page is checked and created on its own; the answer lists every page made and every one refused, with the reason.'=>'Wuxuu ku abuuraa ilaa 50 bog hal wicitaan gudaheed, mid kasta oo ka kooban qaybo iyo/ama nuxurka baloogga. Bog kasta si gaar ah ayaa loo hubiyaa loona abuuraa; jawaabtu waxay taxaysaa bog kasta oo la sameeyay iyo mid kasta oo la diiday, oo ay la socoto sababtu.','Write a page with AI'=>'Ku qor bog AI','Builds a page from sections (given, or chosen by AI from the section library) and has AI rewrite all of its text for your brief, keeping the design. Uses the AI provider set up in the plugin\'s AI settings. The page is a draft unless another status is asked for.'=>'Waxay bog ka dhisaysaa qaybo (la bixiyay, ama AI ka dooratay maktabadda qaybaha) waxayna u diraysaa AI inay dhammaan qoraalkiisa dib ugu qorto koobitaankaaga, iyadoo ilaalinaysa naqshadda. Waxay isticmaashaa bixiyaha AI ee lagu habeeyay dejinta AI ee furitaanka. Boggu waa qabyo haddii aan xaalad kale la codsan.','What the page is for: the business, the offer, the audience and the tone.'=>'Waxa boggu ku saabsan yahay: ganacsiga, dalabka, dhagaystayaasha iyo hab-dhaca.','Send between 1 and %d pages.'=>'Dir inta u dhaxaysa 1 iyo %d bog.','AI is not available in this build.'=>'AI lagama heli karo dhismahan.','Describe the page in at least a sentence.'=>'Ku sharax bogga ugu yaraan hal jumlad.','The AI did not choose any section from the library. Name the sections yourself, or try a more detailed brief.'=>'AI-gu ma dooran qayb ka mid ah maktabadda. Adigu magacaw qaybaha, ama isku day sharaxaad dheer oo cad.','The AI rewrote %1$d of the page\'s %2$d pieces of text, so nothing was saved. Try again.'=>'AI-gu wuxuu dib u qoray %1$d ka mid ah %2$d-ka qoraal ee bogga, sidaas darteed waxba lama keydin. Isku day mar kale.','The AI request failed. Try again.'=>'Codsiga AI wuu fashilmay. Isku day mar kale.','A migration step is running right now. Try again in a minute.'=>'Tallaabo guuritaan ah ayaa hadda socota. Isku day mar kale hal daqiiqo kaddib.','Rated 