xt month'=>'Bisha soo socota','Scrolling text'=>'Qoraal wareegaya','Pause the scrolling text'=>'Hakad qoraalka rogmanaya','Organisation chart'=>'Shaxda ururka','Google reviews are loaded live on the published page (Google does not allow them to be stored), so they do not show in the editor.'=>'Faallooyinka Google waxaa si toos ah looga soo geliyaa bogga la daabacay (Google ma oggola in la keydiyo), sidaas darteed kuma soo baxaan tafatiraha dhexdiisa.','No reviews to show yet. Add your Google or Trustpilot details in Site design › Reviews; Trustpilot reviews appear after the first refresh, within a minute or two.'=>'Weli ma jiraan faallooyin la muujiyo. Ku dar faahfaahintaada Google ama Trustpilot meesha Naqshadda goobta › Faallooyinka; faallooyinka Trustpilot waxay soo bixi doonaan ka dib dib-u-cusbooneysiinta koowaad, hal ama laba daqiiqo gudahood.','Customer reviews'=>'Faallooyinka macaamiisha','carousel'=>'Wareegto','Previous reviews'=>'Faallooyinkii hore','Next reviews'=>'Dib-u-eegisyada xiga','slide'=>'Silayd','%1$d of %2$d'=>'%1$d ka mid ah %2$d','A customer'=>'Macaamiil','on %s'=>'%s dushiisa','%s review'=>'%s dib u eegis' . "\0" . '%s dib u eegis','Rated %2$s out of 5 on %1$s'=>'Waxa lagu qiimeeyay %2$s marka laga reebo 5 ee %1$s','Planned'=>'La qorsheeyay','In progress'=>'Wuu socdaa','%d item'=>'%d shay' . "\0" . '%d shay','Nothing here yet.'=>'Weli waxba halkan ma jiraan.','Our locations'=>'Goobahayaga','%d locations match.'=>'%d goobood ayaa u dhigma.','No location matches. Try another town or postcode.'=>'Ma jiraan goobo u dhigma. Isku day magaalo kale ama koodhka boostada.','Your position is not available, so the list keeps its order.'=>'Booskaagu ma heli karo, sidaas darteed liisku wuxuu sii heystaa nidaamkiisa.','Map of the locations'=>'Khariidadda goobaha','Find a location'=>'Raadi meel','Town, street or postcode'=>'Magaalo, waddo ama lambarka boostada','Nearest to me'=>'Ugu dhow aniga','The map comes from OpenStreetMap. Showing it sends your IP address to their servers.'=>'Khariidaddu waxay ka timid OpenStreetMap. Muujinteedu waxay cinwaankaaga IP u diraysaa server-yadooda.',': %s'=>': %s','Directions'=>'Jihooyinka',' to %s (opens OpenStreetMap in a new tab)'=>' ku socota %s (waxay ku furaysaa OpenStreetMap tab cusub)','Stop the slide show'=>'Jooji soo bandhigidda sawirrada','Start the slide show'=>'Bilow bandhigga sawirrada','Slides'=>'Baraamijyada','Previous slide'=>'Baraaqaddii hore','Next slide'=>'Balaqqa xigta','Choose a slide'=>'Dooro salaayd','Slide %d'=>'Balaq %d','Thank you for subscribing!'=>'Waad ku mahadsan tahay is-diiwaangelintaada!','Something went wrong. Please contact the administrator.'=>'Wax baa qaldamay. Fadlan la xiriir maamulaha.','Years'=>'Sanado','Months'=>'Bilo','Weeks'=>'Toddobaadyo','Go to slide %d'=>'Aad bogga %d','You\'re already subscribed to our newsletter'=>'Hore ayaad u rukumatay warsidahayaga','Email address is already subscribed.'=>'Cinwaanka iimaylka mar hore ayaa la diiwaangeliyay.','MailPoet plugin not found. Please contact the admin.'=>'Furaha MailPoet lama helin. Fadlan la xiriir maamulaha.','That bucket name is not valid: use 3 to 63 lower-case letters, numbers, dots and dashes.'=>'Magacaas bucket-ka ma ansax aha: isticmaal 3 ilaa 63 xaraf oo yaryar, tirooyin, dhibco iyo xariiqo.','The file read back was not the file written.'=>'Faylka dib loo akhriyay ma ahayn faylkii la qoray.','The test file is still there after deleting it. The key may be missing delete permission.'=>'Faylka tijaabada ayaa wali yaalla ka dib markii la tirtiray. Waxaa laga yaabaa in fureha uu ka maqan yahay oggolaanshaha tirtirka.','Your cloud library is full. Delete designs you no longer need, or upgrade your plan for more space.'=>'Maktabaddaada daruurtu waa ay buuxsantay. Tirtir naqshadaha aadan hadda u baahnayn, ama cusbooneysii qorshahaaga si aad meel bannaan oo dheeraad ah u hesho.','Your cloud library holds as many designs as your plan allows. Delete some to save more.'=>'Maktabaddaada daruurta waxay haysaa inta naqshadood ee qorshahaagu oggol yahay. Tirtir qaar si aad u kaydiso wax badan.','This design is too large to save to the cloud library (2 MB at most).'=>'Naqshaddan aad bay u weyn tahay in lagu keydiyo maktabadda daruurta (ugu badnaan 2 MB).','An image in this design is too large for the cloud library.'=>'Sawir ku jira naqshaddan ayaa aad ugu weyn maktabadda daruurta.','An image in this design could not be saved. The cloud library keeps WebP, JPEG, PNG, GIF and AVIF images.'=>'Sawir ku jira naqshaddan lama kaydin karin. Maktabadda daruurta waxay kaydisaa sawirrada WebP, JPEG, PNG, GIF iyo AVIF.','Your licence has expired or was cancelled, so nothing new can be saved. Your saved designs are still here; renew to save again.'=>'Shatigalkaagu wuu dhacay ama waa la joojiyay, sidaa darteed wax cusub lama kaydin karo. Naqshadahaagii la kaydiyay weli halkaan ayay yaallaan; cusboonaysii si aad mar kale wax u kaydiso.','We could not confirm a Page Builder Sandwich Pro licence on this site. Check that the licence is activated here (Account screen).'=>'Ma aannu xaqiijin karin shatiga Page Builder Sandwich Pro ee boggan. Hubi in shatiga halkan laga hawlgeliyay (Shaashadda Koontada).','This needs Page Builder Sandwich Pro.'=>'Tani waxay u baahan tahay Page Builder Sandwich Pro.','This site can use the team library but not change it. Ask the team owner for write access.'=>'Boggani wuxuu isticmaali karaa maktabadda kooxda laakiin ma beddeli karo. Weydiiso mulkiilaha kooxda oggolaanshaha wax-ka-beddelka.','Team libraries come with the Agency plan.'=>'Maktabadaha kooxda waxay la socdaan qorshaha Agency.','Only the licence owner\'s sites can manage teams.'=>'Kaliya bogagga mulkiilaha shatiga ayaa maamuli kara kooxaha.','That invite code is not valid or has already been used.'=>'Koodhkaas martiqaadku ma shaqeynayo ama mar hore ayaa la isticmaalay.','You have reached a team limit of your plan.'=>'Waxaad gaadhay xadka kooxda ee qorshahaaga.','That library item was not found. It may have been deleted on another site.'=>'Shaygaas maktabadda lagama helin. Waxaa laga yaabaa in laga tirtiray degel kale.','This site\'s connection to the cloud library has expired. Try again: it reconnects automatically.'=>'Xiriirka boggan ee maktabadda daruurta wuu dhacay. Isku day mar kale: si toos ah ayuu dib ugu xirmayaa.','The connection request was too old. Check that this server\'s clock is correct, then try again.'=>'Codsiga xiriirku aad buu u duugoobay. Hubi in saacadda serfarkani sax tahay, ka dibna mar kale isku day.','The cloud library is not available just now. Try again in a few minutes.'=>'Maktabadda daruurta hadda lama heli karo. Isku day mar kale dhowr daqiiqo ka dib.','The cloud library could not complete this request.'=>'Maktabadda daruurta ma awoodin inay dhamaystirto codsigan.','Team libraries use Zinn Digital® storage. Switch off your own storage to share with a team.'=>'Maktabadaha kooxdu waxay isticmaalaan keydka Zinn Digital®. Demi keydkaaga si aad ula wadaagto koox.','The storage address must start with https:// and a bucket name is required.'=>'Cinwaanka kaydinta waa inuu ku bilaabmaa https:// waana inuu lahaadaa magaca baaldiga (bucket).','Your storage could not be reached from this site. Check the address.'=>'Kaydintaada lagama geli karin goobtan. Hubi cinwaanka.','Not found in your storage.'=>'Lagama helin kaydkaaga.','Your storage refused the request. Check the access key, the secret and that the key may read and write this bucket.'=>'Kaydintaadu waxay diidday codsiga. Hubi furaha gelitaanka, sirta iyo in furuhu wax ka akhriyi karo waxna ku qori karo baaldigan.','Your storage answered with an error (HTTP %d).'=>'Kaydkaagu wuxuu kaga jawaabay qalad (HTTP %d).','The cloud library could not be reached a moment ago. Try again in a few minutes.'=>'Maktabadda daruurta lama gaari karin waxyar ka hor. Isku day mar kale dhowr daqiiqo ka dib.','The cloud library comes with Page Builder Sandwich Pro.'=>'Maktabadda daruurta waxay la socotaa Page Builder Sandwich Pro.','Activate your Page Builder Sandwich Pro licence on this site first (Account screen), then try again.'=>'Marka hore ka hawlgeli shatigaaga Page Builder Sandwich Pro boggan (shaashadda Koontada), ka dibna mar kale isku day.','Offers top-list'=>'Liiska dalabyada ugu sarreeya','Casino Top-List Pro'=>'Liiska ugu Sarreeya ee Kasiinada Pro','Top casinos this month'=>'Kasiinooyinka ugu sarreeya bishan','Ranked by our test scores. Bonuses change often: always check the terms.'=>'Waxaa loo kala sarreeysiiyay dhibcaha imtixaankayaga. Gunnooyinku inta badan way isbeddelaan: mar walba hubi shuruudaha.','100% up to 200 + 50 spins'=>'100% ilaa 200 + 50 wareeg','Payouts in 24 h
