es.'=>'Dejisyadan dhaqdhaqaaqa lama yaqaan ama xadka way ka baxsan yihiin: %s. GET /pbs/v1/marketing/motion waxay taxaysaa xulashooyinka.','No block at that path.'=>'Waddadaas ma jiro wax baloog ah.','That page does not exist.'=>'Boggaasi ma jiro.','Popups'=>'Daaqadaha soo booda','Popup'=>'Daaqad soo boodda','Add popup'=>'Ku dar popup','Edit popup'=>'Wax ka beddel daaqadda soo boodda','No popups yet.'=>'Weli ma jiraan daaqado soo booda.','Form submissions'=>'Soo-gudbinta foomka','Form submission'=>'Gudbinta foomka','No submissions yet.'=>'Weli ma jiraan wax la soo gudbiyay.','Search submissions'=>'Raadi xogaha la soo gudbiyay','Submitted values'=>'Qiimayaasha la gudbiyay','Sent from %s'=>'Laga soo diray %s','Webhook'=>'Webhook','Mailing list'=>'Liiska boostada','sent'=>'La diray','failed'=>'Wuu fashilmay','Submission'=>'Gudbin','The file is no longer available.'=>'Faylka hadda lama heli karo.','Export CSV'=>'Dhoofso CSV','There are no live reviews here.'=>'Halkan ma jiraan faallooyin toos ah.','Too many requests. Try again in a few minutes.'=>'Codsiyadu aad bay u bateen. Isku day mar kale dhowr daqiiqo ka dib.','That is not a Google place ID. It looks like ChIJN1t_tDeuEmsRUsoyG83frY4.'=>'Taasi ma aha aqoonsiga goobta Google. Waxay u egtahay ChIJN1t_tDeuEmsRUsoyG83frY4.','That is not a Trustpilot business unit ID. It is 24 letters and digits, from your Trustpilot Business account.'=>'Kaasi ma aha Trustpilot business unit ID. Waa 24 xaraf iyo lambar, oo laga helayo koontadaada Trustpilot Business.','That does not look like an API key: it should be one line of letters, digits and symbols, with no spaces.'=>'Taasi uma eka furaha API: waa inay noqotaa hal xariiq oo xarfo, nambaro iyo calaamado ah, oo aan lahayn wax bannaan ah.','Google reviews are not set up.'=>'Faallooyinka Google lama habaynin.','The review service could not be reached. The last reviews stay on the site; the next refresh tries again.'=>'Lama xiriiri karin adeegga dib-u-eegista. Dib-u-eegistii ugu dambeysay waxay ku sii jiri doontaa barta; dib-u-cusbooneysiinta xigta ayaa mar kale isku dayi doonta.','The review service refused the request (HTTP %d). Check the API key and the ID.'=>'Adeegga dib-u-eegistu wuxuu diiday codsigii (HTTP %d). Hubi furaha API iyo ID-ga.','The review service says the API quota is used up. The last reviews stay on the site.'=>'Adeegga dib-u-eegista wuxuu sheegayaa in qoondadii API la dhammeeyay. Dib-u-eegistii ugu dambeysay waxay ku sii jirayaan goobta.','The review service answered with an error (HTTP %d). The last reviews stay on the site.'=>'Adeegga dib-u-eegistu wuxuu kaga jawaabay khalad (HTTP %d). Dib-u-eegistii ugu dambeysay waxay ku sii jiri doontaa bogga.','That template type does not exist on this site.'=>'Noocaas naqshad ahi kuma jiro boggan.','The template could not be saved.'=>'Lama keydin karin qaab-dhismeedka.','The template could not be moved to the trash.'=>'Mala-awaalka looma rari karin qashinka.','That post does not exist.'=>'Qoraalkaas ma jiro.','List'=>'Liis','Activate WooCommerce first.'=>'Marka hore shid WooCommerce.','You cannot create pages.'=>'Ma abuuri kartid bogag.','Entire site'=>'Bogga oo dhan','Front page'=>'Bogga hore','Specific posts or pages'=>'Qoraallo ama bogag gaar ah','In a category or tag'=>'Qayb ama sumad dhexdeeda','Search results'=>'Natiijooyinka raadinta','Page not found (404)'=>'Bogga lama helin (404)','Logged in or out'=>'Gudaha ku jira ama ka baxsan','User role'=>'Doorka isticmaalaha','Device'=>'Qalab','Date range'=>'Xadka taariikhda','Time of day'=>'Waqtiga maalinta','URL parameter'=>'Halbeegga URL','Referrer'=>'Tixraace','Language'=>'Luqadda','Cart contents'=>'Waxyaabaha ku jira gaariga wax lagu gato','%1$s; except: %2$s'=>'%1$s; marka laga reebo: %2$s','The page you were looking for is not here. Try a search instead.'=>'Bogga aad raadinaysay halkan ma yaallo. Isku day inaad raadiso beddelkeeda.','Thank you for your order'=>'Waad ku mahadsan tahay dalabkaaga','Design this template with any blocks.'=>'Ku naqshadee qaabkan baloocyo kasta.','Header'=>'Madaxa sare','Footer'=>'Qeybta hoose','Single post or page'=>'Qoraal ama bog kaliya','Archive (category, tag, author, blog)'=>'Kayd (qayb, sumad, qoraa, baloog)','Theme templates'=>'Qaababka mawduuca','Theme template'=>'Qaab-dhismeedka mawduuca','Add template'=>'Ku dar qaab-dhismeed','Edit template'=>'Wax ka beddel tusmada','No templates yet.'=>'Weli ma jiraan qaabab.','Theme builder'=>'Dhisaha mawduuca','Shows on'=>'Ka muuqata','Sale!'=>'Qiimo-dhimis!','Cart'=>'Gaadhiga wax-iibsiga','%s item'=>'%s shay' . "\0" . '%s shay','Single product'=>'Badeecad kaliya','Shop and product categories'=>'Dukaan iyo qaybaha alaabta','Order received (thank you)'=>'Dalabka waa la helay (waad mahadsan tahay)','My Account'=>'Koontadayda','Product'=>'Badeecad','Regular price'=>'Qiimaha caadiga ah','Sale price'=>'Qiimaha iibka','SKU'=>'SKU','Stock status'=>'Xaaladda kaydka','Average rating'=>'Qiimaynta celceliska','Number of reviews'=>'Tirada dib u eegista','Short description'=>'Faahfaahin kooban','Categories'=>'Qeybaha','Product image'=>'Sawirka alaabta','Add to cart link'=>'Xiriirinta ku dar gaadhigacan','Add to cart label'=>'Sumadda ku dar gaariga wax lagu gato','Price: low to high'=>'Qiimaha: hooseeyo ilaa mid sareeyo','Price: high to low'=>'Qiimaha: sare ilaa hoose','Highest rated'=>'Ugu qiimaynta sarreeya','We are doing some maintenance on this site. Please check back soon.'=>'Waxaan goobtan ku samaynaynaa xoogaa dayactir ah. Fadlan dib u soo eeg dhowaan.','This site is launching soon.'=>'Boggan waxa la daah-furi doonaa dhowaan.','Maintenance mode is on'=>'Habka dayactirka wuu shaqaynayaa','Pre-launch mode is on'=>'Habka furitaanka ka hor waa shaqaynayaa','Network templates'=>'Qaababka shabakadda','That find-and-replace job no longer exists.'=>'Shaqadaas raadinta iyo beddelka hadda ma jirto.','That step is not available for this job right now.'=>'Talaabadaas hadda looma heli karo shaqadan.','Enter what to find.'=>'Geli waxa la raadinayo.','Colours must be hex codes such as #1a73e8 or #fff.'=>'Midabbadu waa inay noqdaan koodhadhka hex sida #1a73e8 ama #fff.','The new link must be a full web address (https://…), a path starting with /, or an anchor starting with #.'=>'Xiriirinta cusub waa inay noqotaa cinwaan shabakadeed oo buuxa (https://…), waddo ku bilaabanta /, ama barroosinka ku bilaabanta #.','Client review comments'=>'Faallooyinka dib-u-eegista macmiilka','Write a comment first.'=>'Marka hore qor faallo.','Client'=>'Macmiil','That comment no longer exists.'=>'Faalladaasi hadda ma jirto.','New review comment on “%s”'=>'Faallo dib-u-eegis oo cusub oo ku saabsan “%s”','%1$s wrote:

%2$s

Open the page in the editor to answer or resolve it:
%3$s'=>'%1$s wuxuu qoray:

%2$s

Ku fur bogga tifaftiraha si aad uga jawaabto ama u xalliso:
%3$s','This review link is not valid any more. Ask for a new one.'=>'Xiriirintan dib-u-eegista hadda ma shaqaynayso. Weydiiso mid cusub.','Too many comments from this link in the last hour. Try again later.'=>'Faallooyin aad u badan ayaa ka yimid xiriirintan saacaddii u dambeysay. Isku day mar dambe.','Your role cannot create templates or patterns.'=>'Doorkaagu ma abuuri karo jaangooyooyin ama qaabab.','You can change the text and images on this page, but not its layout or design. Your change was not saved.'=>'Waad beddeli kartaa qoraalka iyo sawirrada ku yaal boggan, laakiin ma beddeli kartid qaabeyntiisa ama naqshaddiisa. Beddelkaaga lama keydin.','Your role cannot change styles. Undo the style changes and save again.'=>'Doorkaagu ma beddeli karo qaababka. Ka noqo isbeddelada qaabka oo mar kale kaydi.','Your role cannot add or change custom code (custom CSS or HTML blocks). Undo those changes and save again.'=>'Doorkaagu ma ku dari karo mana beddeli karo koodh gaar ah (buloogyada CSS ama HTML ee gaarka ah). Ka noqo isbeddelladaas oo mar kale keydi.','This is not an export file from this plugin.'=>'Kani ma aha fayl laga dhoofiyay furinkan.','This export file was made by a newer version of the plugin. Update the plugin on this site, then import it again.'=>'Faylkan la dhoofiyay waxaa sameeyay nooc ka cusub fur-hayeha (plugin). Ku cusboonaysii fur-hayeha boggan, ka dibna mar kale soo dhoofso.','The export file is damaged: its list of items is missing.'=>'Faylka dhoofintu wuu waxyeeloobay: liiska waxyaabihiisa ayaa maqan.','The export file is damaged or was edited after it was made (its checksum does not match). Export it again from the other site.'=>'Faylka dhoofintu wuu xumaaday ama wax baa laga beddelay ka dib markii la sameeyay (wadarta hubintiisa ma matchesan). Mar kale ka dhoofi goobta kale.','“%s” was not imported: this site does not have that kind of item.'=>'“%s” lama soo dejin: goobtani ma laha shayga noocaas ah.','“%s” was not imported: you are not allowed 