 count toward your site limit.'=>'Nuqullada staging, tijaabada iyo localhost ee goobtu waa bilaash waligoodna laguma xisaabin doono xadka goobtaada.','Your plan includes priority support.'=>'Qorshahaaga waxa ku jira taageero mudnaan leh.','Manage your licence and billing'=>'Maamul shatigaaga iyo qaansheegadkaaga','Get more with Pro'=>'Ku hel wax badan Pro','Start a free %d-day trial, no card needed'=>'Bilaab tijaabo bilaash ah oo %d-maalmood ah, kaadh looma baahna' . "\0" . 'Bilow tijaabo bilaash ah oo %d-maalmood ah, kaadh looma baahna','See plans and prices'=>'Fiiri qorshayaasha iyo qiimaha','Use Tranzly and Page Builder Sandwich together? The bundle includes both Pro plugins for less.'=>'Ma wada isticmaalaysaa Tranzly iyo Page Builder Sandwich? Xidhmada waxaa ku jira labada furin ee Pro oo qiimo jaban.','Your licence has expired. Renew it to keep getting updates and Pro features.'=>'Laysankaagu wuu dhacay. Cusboonaysii si aad u sii wadato helitaanka wararka cusub iyo astaamaha Pro.','Renew now'=>'Cusboonaysii hadda','Compare the plans'=>'Isbarbardhig qorshayaasha','Search features'=>'Raadi astaamaha','Area'=>'Aag','Included in'=>'Ku jira','No feature matches.'=>'Ma jiro muuqaal u dhigma.','Features by plan'=>'Astaamaha qorshe ahaan','Hide'=>'Qari','Activate it on the Plugins screen'=>'Ka hawlgeli shaashadda Plugins-ka','Install it'=>'Ku rakib','Overview'=>'Dulmar guud','Setup'=>'Dejinta','Plans and licence'=>'Qorshayaasha iyo shatiga','Add-ons'=>'Kordhinta','Feedback'=>'Faallo','Your choice could not be saved.'=>'Doorashadaada lama keydin karin.','The setup state could not be saved.'=>'Xaaladda habaynta lama keydin karin.','Match my computer'=>'Ku waafaji kombuyuutarkayga','Light'=>'Iftiin','Dark'=>'Madow','Colour scheme'=>'Isku-dubbaridka midabka','Help'=>'Caawinaad','Guide to this screen'=>'Hagaha shaashaddan','Take the tour'=>'Bilaab kormeerka','Get help or report a bug'=>'Hel caawimaad ama soo sheeg cillad','Plugin screens'=>'Shaashadaha fur-hagaajiyaha','That could not be saved.'=>'Taas lama kaydin karin.','Before you contact support'=>'Kahor inta aadan la xiriirin qaybta caawinta','Your request is sent from this site to %s, who make this plugin. We send:'=>'Codsigaaga waxaa laga soo diray boggan waxaana loo diray %s, kuwaas oo sameeyay furitaankan. Waxaan direynaa:','your e-mail address and name, so we can reply;'=>'cinwaankaaga iimaylka iyo magacaaga, si aan uga jawaabno;','the subject and message you write;'=>'mawduuca iyo farriinta aad qorto;','your licence ID, so paying customers get priority;'=>'aqoonsigaaga shatiga, si macaamiisha wax bixiya ay u helaan mudnaanta;','only if you tick it: site details (WordPress and PHP versions, theme, plugins, an excerpt of the error log with passwords and e-mail addresses removed), which you can read before sending;'=>'kaliya haddii aad calaamadiso: faahfaahinta goobta (noocyada WordPress iyo PHP, mawduuca, plugins-ka, qayb ka mid ah diiwaanka khaladaadka oo laga saaray furayaasha sirta ah iyo cinwaannada iimaylka), oo aad akhrisan karto ka hor intaadan dirin;','I agree, continue'=>'Waan raacsanahay, sii wad','The connection could not be checked.'=>'Xiriirka lama hubin karin.','That did not work. Try again.'=>'Taasi ma shaqaynin. Isku day mar kale.','Zinn Digital® support disconnected this site.'=>'Taageerada Zinn Digital® waxay ka jartay xiriirka boggan.','Zinn Digital® support no longer recognises this site.'=>'Taageerada Zinn Digital® mar dambe ma aqoonsana boggan.','You disconnected this site.'=>'Waxaad ka goysay goobtan.','Connect this site to support'=>'Ku xidh boggan taageerada','Connected. Replies go to %s.'=>'Waa ku xidhan yahay. Jawaabuhu waxay tegayaan %s.','Not connected. You can still send a request with your e-mail address below; connecting saves typing it each time.'=>'Kuma xirna. Weli waxaad codsi ku diri kartaa cinwaankaaga iimaylka ee hoose; isku xirku wuxuu badbaadinayaa qoristiisa mar kasta.','E-mail address'=>'Cinwaanka iimaylka','Your name (optional)'=>'Magacaaga (ikhtiyaari)','I agree to connect this site to Zinn Digital® support. It sends this site’s address, WordPress and PHP versions and the plugin version, and can be disconnected at any time from here or by Zinn Digital®.'=>'Waxaan oggolahay inaan goobtan ku xidho taageerada Zinn Digital®. Waxay diraysaa ciwaanka goobtan, noocyada WordPress iyo PHP iyo nooca fur-hagaajiyaha (plugin), waxaana laga jari karaa xidhiidhka wakhti kasta halkan ama Zinn Digital®.','Connect'=>'Ku xidh','I need help'=>'Waxaan u baahanahay caawimaad','Report a bug'=>'Soo sheeg cillad','Send feedback'=>'Dir ra\'yi-celin','Request a feature'=>'Codso astaan','The site details could not be read.'=>'Faahfaahinta goobta lama akhrin karo.','Your request could not be sent. Try again in a few minutes.'=>'Codsigaaga lama diri karin. Isku day mar kale dhowr daqiiqo ka dib.','Feedback and feature requests'=>'Faallooyinka iyo codsiyada astaamaha cusub','Sent. Your reference is %s, and our reply will come by e-mail.'=>'Waa la diray. Tixraacaagu waa %s, jawaabtayaduna waxay ku iman doontaa iimayl.','What is it about?'=>'Maxay ku saabsan tahay?','Reply to (e-mail)'=>'U jawaab (i-maylka)','Subject'=>'Mowduuc','What did you do, what did you expect, and what happened instead?'=>'Maxaad samaysay, maxaad filaysay, maxaase dhacay taasi beddelkeeda?','Include site details (versions, theme, plugins, error log excerpt)'=>'Ku dar faahfaahinta goobta (noocyada, mawduuca, plugins-ka iyo qayb ka mid ah diiwaanka khaladaadka)','See exactly what is sent'=>'Arag waxa saxda ah ee la diray','Loading…'=>'Waa la soo gelinayaa…','Step %1$d of %2$d'=>'Tallaabada %1$d ee %2$d','Close the tour'=>'Xir kormeerka','Everything in one place'=>'Wax walba hal meel','These tabs lead to every screen of the plugin: setup, settings, your licence, help and more.'=>'Kombiyuutarradan waxay kuu hoggaaminayaan shaashad kasta oo furaha ah: dejinta, habaynta, shatigaaga, caawinta iyo waxyaabo kale.','Help on every screen'=>'Caawinaad shaashad kasta','Open this menu for the guide to the screen you are on, this tour, or to ask us for help.'=>'Fur menu-kan si aad u hesho hagaha shaashadda aad ku sugan tahay, socod-socodkan, ama si aad nooga codsato caawimo.','Light or dark'=>'Iftiin ama madow','Choose light, dark, or the same as your computer. Your choice is remembered for you only.'=>'Dooro iftiin, mugdi, ama sida kombiyuutarkaaga oo kale. Doorashadaada waxaa loo xusuustaa adiga keliya.','Welcome'=>'Ku soo dhawoow','This short tour shows where things are. You can leave it at any time with Escape.'=>'Booqashadan gaaban waxay ku tusinaysaa meesha ay waxyaabuhu ku yaallaan. Waad ka bixi kartaa wakhti kasta adigoo isticmaalaya Escape.','Your site at a glance'=>'Boggaaga oo kooban','Setup progress and your plan are shown here, with the next thing worth doing.'=>'Horumarka habaynta iyo qorshahaaga halkan ayaa lagu soo bandhigay, oo ay weheliso waxa xiga ee mudan in la sameeyo.','Your plan, how many sites it covers, and whether this copy of the site counts toward that limit.'=>'Qorshahaaga, tirada bogagga uu daboolayo, iyo haddii koobigan boggaagu uu ku xisaabtamayo xadkaas.','Try Pro or upgrade'=>'Tijaabi Pro ama kor u qaad','Start a free trial without a card, upgrade, or renew, all from here.'=>'Ku bilow tijaabo bilaash ah adigoon kaar wadan, kor u qaad, ama cusbooneysii, dhammaan halkan.','Every feature and the plan that includes it. Search for a feature or show one area at a time.'=>'Astaankasta iyo qorshaha ay ku jirto. Raadi astaan ama muuji hal meel markiiba.','More from Zinn Digital®'=>'Wax intaa ka badan oo ka socda Zinn Digital®','Plugins that work with this one, and services from the same team. Cards you hid on other screens can be shown again here.'=>'Balanballo la shaqeeya kan, iyo adeegyo ka socda isla kooxda. Kaararkii aad ku qarisay shaashadaha kale dib ayaa halkan loogu muujin karaa.','Connect for faster help'=>'Ku xirnow caawimaad degdeg ah','Connecting is optional. It lets you send requests without typing your e-mail each time, and you can disconnect whenever you like.'=>'Isku xiriddu waa ikhtiyaari. Waxay kuu oggolaanaysaa inaad dirto codsiyada adigoon qorin iimaylkaaga mar kasta, waxaadna goyn kartaa xiriirka mar kasta oo aad rabto.','Ask for help or report a bug'=>'Weydi caawimaad ama soo sheeg cillad','Describe what happened. You choose whether to attach site information, and you can see exactly what it contains first.'=>'Sharax waxa dhacay. Adiga ayaa dooranaya in aad ku lifaaqdo macluumaadka bogga, waxaadna marka hore si sax ah u arki kartaa waxa uu ka kooban yahay.','Tell us what to build'=>'Noo sheeg waxa la dhisayo','Send an idea, a feature request or any feedback. It goes straight to the team.'=>'Soo dir fikrad, codsi muuqaal cusub ama faallo kasta. Waxay toos u tagaysaa kooxda.','This takes a few minutes and sets up %s so it works on this site straight away. You can change everything later.'=>'Tani waxay qaadanaysaa dhowr daqiiqo waxayna habaynaysaa %s si ay isla markiiba uga shaqeyso boggan. Wax walba waad beddeli kartaa hadhow.','You are ready. If anything does not work as expected, we are one click away.'=>'Waad diyaar tahay. Haddii ay wax u shaqeyn waayaan sidii la rabay, waxaan jirnaa hal gujin oo keliya.','Step %1$d of %2$d: %3$s'=>'Tallaabada %1$d ee %2$d: %3$s','Finish'=>'Dhammee','Skip setup'=>'Ka bood habaynta','Import “%s”'=>'Soo dhoofso “%s”','%d page imported.'=>'%d bog ayaa la soo dejiyay.' . "\0" . '%d bogag ah ayaa la soo dejiyay.','edit'=>'Wax ka beddel','Pages to import'=>'Bogagga la soo dejinayo','Publish the pages now (otherwise they are saved as drafts)'=>'Daabac bogagga hadda (haddii kale waxaa loo keydinayaa sidii qabyo qoraal)','Use the kit’s home page as the site’s front page'=>'U isticmaal bogga hore ee xirmada bogga hore ee goobta','Create a menu with the imported pages'=>'Ku samee meel-doorasho boggaga la soo dhoofsadey','Importing never changes your existing pages. Importing the same kit again updates the pages it created before.'=>'Soodejintu marnaba ma beddesho boggagaaga jira. Dib u soodejinta isla xirmada mar kale waxay cusbooneysiisaa boggagii ay markii hore abuurtay.','Import'=>'Soo dhoofso','Complete websites you can import in one click: pages, sections and a menu, ready for your own words and pictures. Kits come from Zinn Digital® and new ones are added every month.'=>'Websaytyo dhammaystiran oo aad ku soo dejisan karto hal gujin kaliya: boggag, qaybo iyo liiska kala doorashada, oo diyaar u ah erayadaada iyo sawirradaada gaarka ah. Xirmooyinku waxay ka yimaadaan Zinn Digital® waxaana kuwo cusub lagu daraa bil kasta.','Search kits'=>'Raadi qalabka','Category'=>'Qeybta','All categories'=>'Dhammaan qaybaha','Free and Pro'=>'Bilaash iyo Pro','Go Pro to import'=>'U gudub Pro si aad u soo dejiso','No kit matches these filters.'=>'Ma jiro qalab u dhigma shaandhooyinkan.','My library'=>'Maktabaddayda','Team'=>'Koox','Storage'=>'Kaydinta','Your library is kept in your own storage bucket, so no Zinn Digital® quota applies.'=>'Maktabaddaada waxaa lagu hayaa baakidhkaaga kaydinta u gaarka ah, markaa ma khuseyso wax kooto ah oo Zinn Digital® ahi.','%1$s of %2$s used (%3$d%%)'=>'%1$s ee %2$s ayaa la isticmaalay (%3$d%%)','%1$d of %2$d designs · up to %3$s per design · images are resized to 2560 px and stored once'=>'%1$d ka mid ah %2$d naqshadood · ilaa %3$s naqshad kasta · sawirrada waxaa loo beddelay cabbirka 2560 px waxaana la kaydiyay hal mar','Deleted from your library.'=>'Laga tirtiray maktabaddaada.','Save any section or page from the editor: open the block’s ⋮ menu and choose “Save to cloud library”. Insert saved designs from the Cloud library panel in the editor, on any of your sites.'=>'Ka kaydi qayb kasta ama bog kasta tifaftiraha: fur liiska ⋮ ee baloogga oo dooro "Ku kaydi maktabadda daruurta". Ka geli naqshadaha la kaydiyay qaybta maktabadda Cloud ee tifaftiraha, goob kasta oo ka mid ah boggagaaga.','Show'=>'Muuji','Everything'=>'Wax kasta','Sections'=>'Qaybaha','Styles'=>'Qaababka','Size'=>'Baaxad','Nothing saved yet.'=>'Weli waxba lama keydin.','Delete'=>'Tirtir','Write a test file'=>'Qor fayl tijaabo ah','Read it back'=>'Dib u akhri','Delete it'=>'Tirtir','In your Cloudflare dashboard, open R2 Object Storage and create a bucket (for example “my-pbs-library”). Keep it private: do not connect a public domain.'=>'Gudaha dashboard-kaaga Cloudflare, fur R2 Object Storage oo samee bucket (tusaale ahaan “my-pbs-library”). Ka dhig mid gaar ah: ha ku xirin domain guud.','Open “Manage API tokens” in R2 and create an API token with “Object Read & Write” permission, limited to that one bucket.'=>'Fur "Manage API tokens" ee ku dhex jira R2 oo samee calaamadda API (API token) oo wadata oggolaanshaha "Object Read & Write", kuna kooban xeedhadaas (bucket) keliya.','Copy the Access Key ID and the Secret Access Key it shows (the secret is shown only once).'=>'Koobi Aqoonsiga Furaha Gelitaanka (Access Key ID) iyo Furaha Gelitaanka Qarsoodiga ah ee uu muujiyo (sirta waxa la muujiyaa hal mar oo keliya).','Copy the S3 endpoint for your account. It looks like https://<account-id>.r2.cloudflarestorage.com. Region is “auto”.'=>'Koobiye barta dhamaadka S3 ee koontadaada. Waxay u egtahay https://<account-id>.r2.cloudflarestorage.com. Gobolku waa "auto".','Paste the values below, save, then press “Test connection”. Switch the library to your storage only when the test passes.'=>'Ku dhaji qiyamka hoose, kaydi, ka dibna riix "Tijaabi xiriirka". U wareeji maktabadda kaydsigaaga kaliya marka tijaabadu guulaysato.','Create a private bucket with your provider (Amazon S3, Backblaze B2, Wasabi, MinIO or any S3-compatible service).'=>'Ku samee weel gaar ah (private bucket) adeeg-bixiyahaaga (Amazon S3, Backblaze B2, Wasabi, MinIO ama adeeg kasta oo la jaanqaadi kara S3).','Create an access key that can read, write and delete objects in that bucket only.'=>'Abuur furaha gelitaanka oo kaliya akhrin kara, qori kara, tiri karaana walxaha ku jira baaldigaas.','Find the S3 endpoint (for Amazon S3: %s) and the bucket’s region.'=>'Hel barta dhamaadka S3 (ee Amazon S3: %s) iyo gobolka baaldiga.','Amazon S3 uses virtual-hosted addresses: switch off “Path-style addresses”. Most other services use path-style.'=>'Amazon S3 waxay isticmaashaa ciwaannada martigelinta farsamada ah: dami “Path-style addresses”. Inta badan adeegyada kale waxay isticmaalaan qaabka dariiqa.','Paste the values below, save, then press “Test connection”.'=>'Halkan hoose ku dheji qiyamka, kaydi, ka dibna riix “Test connection”.','Storage settings saved.'=>'Hagaajinta kaydinta waa la keydiyay.','Your cloud library is kept in Zinn Digital® storage with the space your plan includes. You can keep it in your own Cloudflare R2 or S3-compatible bucket instead: then no Zinn Digital® quota applies, and every site you connect to the same bucket shares the library. Team libraries always use Zinn Digital® storage.'=>'Maktabaddaada daruurta waxaa lagu kaydiyaa kaydka Zinn Digital® iyadoo la adeegsanayo booska uu qorshahaagu ku jiro. Taa beddelkeeda waxaad ku kaydsan kartaa Cloudflare R2-kaaga ama baaldiga u dhigma S3: markaas ma khuseyso wax kooto ah oo Zinn Digital®, waxaana goob kasta oo aad ku xirto isla baaldiga ay wadaagaysaa maktabadda. Maktabadaha kooxdu waxay mar walba isticmaalaan kaydka Zinn Digital®.','Connect your own storage: step by step'=>'Ku xir kaydkaaga: tallaabo tallaabo','Another S3-compatible service'=>'Adeeg kale oo la jaanqaadi kara S3','Read the full guide'=>'Akhriso hageha oo dhan','S3 endpoint'=>'Barta dhammaadka S3','Bucket'=>'Baaldi','Region'=>'Gobolka','Cloudflare R2: auto.'=>'Cloudflare R2: toos ah.','Access key ID'=>'Aqoonsiga Furaha Gelitaanka','Stored. Leave empty to keep it.'=>'Waa la kaydiyay. Faaruq uga tag si aad u haysato.','Secret access key'=>'Furaha gelitaanka qarsoodiga ah','Stored encrypted on this site and never shown again. Leave empty to keep it.'=>'Waxaa lagu kaydiyay qarsoodi ahaan goobtan dib dambena looma tusi doono. Faaruq kaga tag si aad u hayso.','Stored encrypted on this site. It is never sent to Zinn Digital®.'=>'Waxa lagu kaydiyey goobtan isaga oo qarsoon. Weligiis looma diro Zinn Digital®.','Path-style addresses'=>'Cinwaannada qaab-waddada','Folder in the bucket'=>'Galka ku jira baaldiga','Save'=>'Kaydi','Test connection'=>'Tijaabi xiriirka','Remove these settings'=>'Ka saar habaynnadan','Keep my library in this storage'=>'Ku hay maktabaddayda kaydkan','The connection test passed.'=>'Tijaabadii xiriirinta waa lagu guulaystay.','Run “Test connection” first.'=>'Marka hore wad “Tijaabi xiriirka”.','Invite a site'=>'Ku martiqaad degel','Who is it for? (optional)'=>'Yaa loogu talagalay? (ikhtiyaari)','Access'=>'Gelitaanka','Use designs (read only)'=>'Isticmaal nashqadaha (akhris kaliya)','Use and save designs'=>'Isticmaal oo kaydi naqshadaha','Create invite code'=>'Abuur koodhka martiqaadka','Give this code to the site owner. It works once, for 7 days, and is shown only now:'=>'Xeerkan sii mulkiilaha goobta. Waxa uu shaqaynayaa hal mar oo keliya, muddo 7 maalmood ah, waxaana la muujinayaa hadda oo keliya:','Copy'=>'Koobi','Members'=>'Xubnaha','No site has joined yet.'=>'Weli ma jiro degel ku soo biiray.','use and save'=>'Isticmaal oo kaydi','read only'=>'akhris kaliya','Delete team'=>'Tir kooxda','Delete this team and every design in its library?'=>'Miyaa la tirtiraa kooxdan iyo naqshad kasta oo ku jirta kaydkeeda?','This site joined the team library.'=>'Boggan wuxuu ku biiray maktabadda kooxda.','This site uses the team library:'=>'Boggani wuxuu adeegsadaa maktabadda kooxda:','Leave'=>'Ka bax','Join a team with an invite code'=>'Ku biir koox adigoo isticmaalaya koodhka martiqaadka','Join'=>'Ku biir','Your teams'=>'Kooxahaaga','New team name'=>'Magaca kooxda cusub','Create team'=>'Samee koox','Creating team libraries comes with the Agency plan.'=>'Abuuritaanka maktabadaha kooxda waxay la socotaa qorshaha Agency.','Save sections, pages and styles to your cloud library and reuse them on all your sites. Agencies can share a library with their team and clients. You can keep the library in Zinn Digital® storage or in your own Cloudflare R2 or S3-compatible bucket.'=>'Ku kaydi qaybaha, bogagga iyo qaababka maktabaddaada daruurta oo dib ugu isticmaal dhammaan boggagaaga. Wakaaladuhu waxay maktabad la wadaagi karaan kooxdooda iyo macaamiishooda. Waxaad maktabadda ku hayn kartaa kaydka Zinn Digital® ama baaldigaaga gaarka ah ee Cloudflare R2 ama midka la jaanqaadi kara S3.','Get Page Builder Sandwich Pro'=>'Hel Page Builder Sandwich Pro','Website kits'=>'Xirmooyinka websaytka','Cloud library'=>'Maktabadda daruurta','Built by Neil Lock, CEO of Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Waxaa dhisay Neil Lock, Agaasimaha Guud ee Zinn Digital® Ltd','Version %s'=>'Nooca %s','Page Builder Sandwich website'=>'Websaytka Page Builder Sandwich','Zinn Digital® website'=>'Websaydhka Zinn Digital®','Settings saved.'=>'Hagaajinta waa la keydiyay.','See the Pro plans and pricing'=>'Eeg qorshayaasha Pro iyo qiimaha','Front-end output'=>'Natiijada qaybta hore','Class name prefix'=>'Horgalaha magaca fasalka','Every class name the plugin prints on your pages starts with this prefix, so the pages do not reveal which plugin built them. 1 to 8 lowercase letters or digits, starting with a letter.'=>'Magac kasta oo class ah oo furintu (plugin) ku daabacdo boggagaaga wuxuu ku bilaabmaa hor-galahan, si boggagu aysan u muujin furinta dhistay. 1 ilaa 8 xaraf oo yaryar ama tirooyin ah, oo ku bilaabmaya xaraf.','Beta updates'=>'Cusbooneysiinta beta','This site receives beta versions as updates.'=>'Boggan wuxuu u helaa noocyada beta casriyeyn ahaan.','This site receives stable versions only.'=>'Boggan wuxuu qaabilaa noocyada xasilloon oo keliya.','Change this on the Account page'=>'Ku beddel tan barta Koontada','Beta versions are offered to licensed Pro installations that are connected to their account. Once connected, you can join from the Account page.'=>'Noocyada Beta-da waxaa loo fidiyaa rakibaadaha Pro ee shatiga haysta ee ku xiran koontadooda. Marka la xiro, waxaad kaga biiri kartaa bogga Koontada.','Breakpoints saved. Pages pick up the new widths on their next view.'=>'Barta kala-goyska waa la keydiyay. Bogaggu waxay qaadan doonaan ballacyada cusub marka xigta ee la eego.','Breakpoints'=>'Barta joogsiyada','Styles set for Tablet apply up to the tablet width, and styles set for Mobile up to the mobile width. Desktop styles apply everywhere else.'=>'Astaamaha loo dejiyay Tablet-ka waxay shaqaynayaan ilaa ballaca tablet-ka, astaamaha loo dejiyay Mobile-kana waxay shaqaynayaan ilaa ballaca mobile-ka. Astaamaha Desktop-ka waxay shaqaynayaan meel kasta oo kale.','Tablet: up to (px)'=>'Kaniini: ilaa (px)','Mobile: up to (px)'=>'Moobayl: ilaa (px)','Save breakpoints'=>'Kaydi meelaha joogsiga','Use the default widths'=>'Isticmaal ballacyada caadiga ah','Settings'=>'Hagaajinta','Templates & kits'=>'Muuqaallo & qalab','The request converting this post stopped before it finished, so the post was skipped. Open it to convert it, or convert it again from here.'=>'Codsigii beddelayey qoraalkan ayaa istaagay ka hor inta uusan dhammaan, sidaas darteed qoraalka waa la booday. Fur si aad u beddesho, ama halkan mar kale kaga beddel.','There is no backup of this post to restore.'=>'Ma jirto koobi kayd ah oo qoraalkan dib loogu soo celiyo.','The converted content could not be saved.'=>'Lama keydin karin nuxurka la beddelay.','Unknown error.'=>'Khalad aan la garanayn.','No legacy content has been checked yet.'=>'Weli wax nuxur duug ah lama hubin.','Restoring legacy content: %1$d of %2$d posts.'=>'Dib u soo celinta nuxurkii hore: %1$d ee %2$d qoraal.','Converting legacy content: %1$d of %2$d posts.'=>'Beddelidda nuxurkii hore: %1$d ee %2$d qoraal.','Undo finished: %1$d restored, %2$d failed.'=>'Ka noqoshadii way dhammaatay: %1$d dib ayaa loo soo celiyay, %2$d way fashilmeen.','Conversion finished: %1$d converted, %2$d unchanged, %3$d failed.'=>'Beddeliddu way dhammaatay: %1$d waa la beddelay, %2$d lama beddelin, %3$d way fashilmeen.','Legacy content'=>'Xogta duugga ah','Pages made with earlier versions of Page Builder Sandwich are converted to blocks in the background. Every post is backed up first, so each conversion can be undone.'=>'Bogagga lagu sameeyay noocyadii hore ee Page Builder Sandwich waxaa gadaasha dambe loogu beddelayaa baloocyo. Qoraal kasta marka hore waa la kaydiyaa, markaa beddelid kasta dib ayaa looga noqon karaa.','%d post still holds legacy content.'=>'%d qoraal ayaa wali wata nuxur duug ah.' . "\0" . '%d qoraal ayaa weli wata nuxurkii hore.','%d post has a backup.'=>'%d qoraal wuxuu leeyahay koobi kayd ah.' . "\0" . '%d qoraal waxay leeyihiin koobi kayd ah.','%d post could not be handled'=>'%d qoraal lama maareyn karin' . "\0" . '%d qoraal lama maareyn karin','Post %d'=>'Qoraalka %d','Conversion started. It continues in the background; you can leave this page.'=>'Beddeliddu way bilaabatay. Waxay ka socotaa xagga dambe; waad ka bixi kartaa boggan.','Restore every converted post to its legacy content? Changes made to those posts since they were converted will be lost.'=>'Dib ma loogu celiyaa qoraal kasta oo la beddelay xogtiisii hore? Wax ka beddelka lagu sameeyay qoraalladaas tan iyo markii la beddelay way lumi doonaan.','Undo started. It continues in the background; you can leave this page.'=>'Ka noqoshada waa la bilaabay. Waxay ku socotaa gadaasha; waad ka bixi kartaa boggan.','Undo all conversions'=>'Ka noqo dhammaan beddelidda','Item'=>'Shay','Open when the page loads'=>'Fur marka boggu soo kaco','Title is a heading'=>'Cinwaanku waa cinwaan weyn','Make the title a heading when the items are sections of the page, so visitors can jump between them.'=>'Cinwaanka ka dhig madax-cinwaan marka waxyaabuhu yihiin qaybo ka mid ah bogga, si booqdayaashu ugu dhex boodi karaan dhexdooda.','Heading %d'=>'Cinwaanka %d','Question or section title'=>'Su\'aal ama cinwaanka qaybta','Accordion'=>'Akkordiyon','Only one item open at a time'=>'Hal shay oo keliya ayaa furan mar kasta','Mark up as FAQ for search engines'=>'U calamadee sidii FAQ ahaan matoorada raadinta','Adds FAQ structured data built from the titles (questions) and their text (answers).'=>'Waxay ku daraysaa xogta qaabaysan ee FAQ oo laga dhisay cinwaannada (su\'aalaha) iyo qoraalkooda (jawaabaha).','Alert'=>'Digniin','Information'=>'Macluumaad','Success'=>'Guul','Warnings and errors are announced to screen reader users straight away; information and success notices are read when they finish what they are doing.'=>'Digniinaha iyo khaladaadka waxaa isla markiiba loo sheegaa isticmaalayaasha aqriyaha shaashadda; ogeysiisyada macluumaadka iyo guusha waxaa la akhriyaa marka ay dhammeeyaan waxa ay qabanayaan.','Show icon'=>'Muuji calaamadda','Visitors can close it'=>'Soo-booqdayaashu way xiri karaan','Title (optional)'=>'Cinwaan (ikhtiyaari ah)','Write the message…'=>'Qor farriinta…','Centre'=>'Xarun','Badge'=>'Astaanta','Colour'=>'Midab','Theme accent'=>'Midabka muhiimka ah ee mawduuca','Neutral'=>'Dhexdhexaad','Position'=>'Boos','Label'=>'Summad','Booking calendar'=>'Kalandarka boos-qabsashada','Service'=>'Adeeg','Booking page address'=>'Cinwaanka bogga ballansashada','For example %s'=>'Tusaale ahaan %s','What the calendar is for, read out by screen readers and shown under it.'=>'Waxa kalandarka loogu talagalay, waxa akhriya akhriyayaasha shaashadda waxaana lagu muujiyaa hoostiisa.','This is not a %s booking page address, so nothing will show on the page.'=>'Kani ma aha ciwaanka bogga ballansashada %s, markaa waxba kama soo muuqan doonaan bogga.','Preview the calendar'=>'Horu-eeg jadwalka','Link address'=>'Cinwaanka xiriirinta','The button shows when it has both a label and an address.'=>'Batoonku wuxuu soo baxayaa marka uu leeyahay sumad iyo ciwaan labadaba.','Open in a new tab'=>'Ku fur tab cusub','Layout'=>'Qaabka','Buttons below'=>'Badhamada hoose','Buttons beside the text'=>'Batoonada qoraalka dhinaciisa ah','Alignment'=>'Isku toosinta','Main button'=>'Batoonka ugu weyn','Second button'=>'Batoonka labaad','Heading…'=>'Cinwaanka…','One sentence on why…'=>'Hal jumlad oo ku saabsan sababta…','Second button (optional)'=>'Batoonka labaad (ikhtiyaari)','Checklist'=>'Liiska hubinta','Tick colour'=>'Midabka calaamadda','Lines'=>'Xadadka','Line %d'=>'Sadarka %d','Task…'=>'Hawl…','Add line'=>'Ku dar layn','Detect automatically'=>'Si toos ah u garo','No highlighting'=>'Bilaa iftiin','File name'=>'Magaca faylka','Shown above the code, for example functions.php.'=>'Ka muuqata xagga sare ee koodhka, tusaale ahaan functions.php.','Line numbers'=>'Lambarrada xariiqda','Copy button'=>'Badhanka koobiyeynta','Wrap long lines'=>'Isku duub khadadka dhaadheer','Write or paste code…'=>'Qor ama dheji koodhka…','Text'=>'Qoraal','Columns'=>'Tiirarka','Highlight %s'=>'Iftiimin %s','Add column'=>'Ku dar tiir','Rows'=>'Safka','Row %d'=>'Safka %d','Add row'=>'Ku dar saf','Caption (what is being compared)'=>'Qoraalka (waxa la isbarbar dhigayo)','Cell type: %s. Change'=>'Nooca qolka: %s. Beddel','Phone call'=>'Wicitaanka taleefanka','Text message'=>'Farriin qoraal ah','WhatsApp'=>'WhatsApp','Buttons'=>'Batoonno','Phone number, with country code'=>'Lambarka taleefanka, oo ay ku jirto koodhka dalka','Button text'=>'Qoraalka badhanka','Remove this button'=>'Ka saar badhankan','Add a button'=>'Ku dar batoon','WhatsApp message to start with (optional)'=>'Farriinta WhatsApp ee lagu bilaabayo (ikhtiyaari)','Contact buttons'=>'Batoonada xiriirka','Add a phone number, an email address or a WhatsApp number in the sidebar.'=>'Ku dar lambar taleefan, cinwaanka iimaylka ama lambarka WhatsApp dhinaca bogga.','Dual heading'=>'Cinwaan labalaab ah','Heading level'=>'Heerka cinwaanka','Use H1 once per page, for its main title.'=>'U isticmaal H1 hal mar bog kasta, cinwaankiisa guud ahaan.','Second part look'=>'Muuqaalka qaybta labaad','Accent colour'=>'Midabka lahjadda','Gradient'=>'Isku-dhafka midabka','Outline'=>'Dulmar','Underline'=>'Xariiq hoosta','Second part on its own line'=>'Qaybta labaad oo ku taal khadkeeda gaarka ah','First part'=>'Qaybta koowaad','second part'=>'Qaybta labaad','Marker pen'=>'Qalinka calaamadeynta','Thick underline'=>'Xariiq hoose oo dhumuc weyn','Background'=>'Gundhig','Highlight'=>'Iftiimin','Remove highlight'=>'Ka saar iftiiminta','Drop cap'=>'Xaraf weyn bilow','Large first letter'=>'Xarafka koowaad oo weyn','For the first letter in a box, choose the "Drop cap in a box" style.'=>'Xarafka koowaad ee sanduuqa ku jira, dooro qaabka "Drop cap in a box".','Drop cap in a box'=>'Xarafka koowaad ee weyn oo sanduuq ku jira','Accent bar'=>'Baarka lahjadda','Pull quote (accent bar)'=>'Xigasho la soo saaray (xariiqda xoojinta)','A quote from the text, set large beside a coloured bar to draw the eye.'=>'Xigasho qoraalka ka mid ah, oo si weyn loogu dhex daray dhinac xariiq midab leh si ay indhaha u soo jiidato.','quote'=>'Xigasho','Feature list'=>'Liiska astaamaha','On phones the features always stack.'=>'Telefoonnada waxyaabaha waxay had iyo jeer isku dul koraan kor iyo hoos.','Feature %d'=>'Muuqaalka %d','Own icon'=>'Astaantaada gaarka ah','Feature…'=>'Muuji…','Describe it…'=>'Sharax…','Add feature'=>'Ku dar sifo','Install and activate Contact Form 7, WPForms, Gravity Forms or Fluent Forms, then choose one of its forms here.'=>'Ku shub oo dhaqaaji Contact Form 7, WPForms, Gravity Forms ama Fluent Forms, ka dibna halkan ka dooro mid ka mid ah foomamkeeda.','Form plugin'=>'Plaginka foomka','Choose a form…'=>'Dooro foom…','%s has no forms yet'=>'%s weli ma laha wax foomam ah','%s is not active on this site, so this form cannot be shown.'=>'%s kama shaqaynayo goobtan, sidaas darteed foomkan lama muujin karo.','The form list could not be loaded.'=>'Liiska foomamka lama soo shubi karin.','Form style'=>'Qaabka foomka','Fields'=>'Kulamada','Outlined'=>'Xariiqsan','Filled'=>'Buuxsamay','Underlined'=>'Xariiq hoosta kaga taal','Button width'=>'Balaadhka badhanka','Fit the text'=>'Ku habkee qoraalka','Full width'=>'Ballac buuxa','Colours, fonts, spacing and corners come from your site design and this block’s design settings.'=>'Midabada, xarfaha, kala dheereynta iyo geesaha waxay ka yimaadaan naqshadda bartaada iyo habaynta naqshadda ee balooggan.','Show a form from your form plugin, styled to match your site.'=>'Muuji foom ka socda fur-halkaaga foomamka, oo loo qaabeeyey si uu ugu habboonaado goobtaada.','Need a form plugin? Contact Form 7 is free.'=>'Ma u baahan tahay furin foom? Contact Form 7 waa bilaash.','Glossary'=>'Qaamuus','Sort A to Z'=>'U kala sooc A ilaa Z','The page shows the terms in alphabetical order; here they stay in the order you wrote them.'=>'Boggu wuxuu shuruudaha ku muujinayaa nidaamka alifbeetada; halkan waxay ku sii jirayaan nidaamkii aad u qortay.','Show an A–Z index'=>'Muuji tusmada A–Z','Link terms used elsewhere on this page'=>'Xiriiri ereyada meelo kale oo boggan ah lagu isticmaalay','The first time each term appears in the page text it links to its definition. Headings, buttons, code and existing links are left alone.'=>'Marka ugu horreysa ee erey kasta uu ka soo muuqdo qoraalka bogga, wuxuu ku xirmayaa qeexitaankiisa. Ciwaannada, badhamada, koodhka iyo xiriiriyeyaasha hadda jira lama taabanayo.','Terms'=>'Shuruudaha','Term %d'=>'Shuruud %d','Term'=>'Muddada','What it means…'=>'Waxa ay ka dhigan tahay…','Add term'=>'Ku dar eray','Icon list'=>'Liiska astaamaha','One below the other'=>'Mid ka hooseeya midka kale','Side by side'=>'Dhinac kasta','List item…'=>'Shayga liiska…','Info box'=>'Sanduuqa macluumaadka','Or choose any icon from the library:'=>'Ama ka dooro calaamad kasta maktabadda:','Link text'=>'Qoraalka xiriirinta','Say where the link goes ("See our prices"), not "Read more".'=>'Sheeg halka xiriirintu u socoto ("Eeg qiimayaashayada"), ee ha dhihin "Wax badan akhri".','A sentence or two…'=>'Hal ama labo jumladood…','section — a thematic section'=>'qayb — qayb mawduuc leh','div — no meaning'=>'div — macno ma leh','header — introductory content'=>'madaxa bogga — nuxurka hordhaca ah','footer — closing content'=>'qeybta hoose — waxyaabaha xiritaanka','article — self-contained content'=>'maqaal — nuxur madax-bannaan','aside — related content'=>'dhinac — nuxurka la xiriira','main — the main content (once per page)'=>'muhiimka — nuxurka muhiimka ah (mar keliya bog kasta)','nav — navigation links'=>'nav — xiriiriyeyaasha hagidda','Stack (flexbox, column)'=>'Isku-dul-habayn (flexbox, tiir)','Row (flexbox)'=>'Safar (flexbox)','Grid'=>'Shabag','Editing: %s'=>'Wax ka beddelaya: %s','Lay out children as'=>'U habee walxaha hoose sida','Inherited (%s)'=>'Laga dhaxlay (%s)','Flexbox'=>'Flexbox','Stacked blocks'=>'Baloogyo dul saaran','Drag in the canvas, or type'=>'Ku jiid shiraaca dhexdiisa, ama qor','Content width'=>'Ballaca nuxurka','Boxed (the theme’s content width)'=>'Sanduuqsan (balaca nuxurka mawduuca)','Minimum height'=>'Dhererka ugu yar','HTML tag'=>'Sumadda HTML','Make the whole block a link to'=>'Ka dhig dhammaan baloogga xiriiriye ku socda','Link text for screen readers'=>'Qoraalka xiriiriyaha ee akhristayaasha shaashadda','What the link does, for visitors who cannot see the block.'=>'Waxa uu xiriiriyuhu qabto, ee loogu talagalay booqdayaasha aan arki karin baloogga.','Do not put links or buttons inside a linked block: a link inside a link does not work in browsers.'=>'Ha dhigin xiriiriyo ama badhammo gudaha baloog leh xiriiriye: xiriiriye ku dhex jira xiriiriye kale kama shaqeeyo daalacayaasha.','Drag to resize these columns'=>'Jiid si aad u cabbir-beddesho tiirarkan','Drag to resize this row'=>'Jiid si aad u cabbir-beddesho safkan','Drag across cells to set how many columns and rows this block spans'=>'Jiid unugyada si aad u dejiso tirada tiirarka iyo safafka uu balooggani daboolayo','+ Column'=>'+ Tiir','− Column'=>'− Tiir','+ Row'=>'+ Saf','− Row'=>'− Saf','Place'=>'Goob','Paste coordinates or an OpenStreetMap link'=>'Ku dheji isuduwayaasha ama xiriirinta OpenStreetMap','On openstreetmap.org, find the place, then copy the address from the browser bar, or right-click the map and choose "Show address".'=>'Bogga openstreetmap.org, ka raadi meesha, kaddibna ka soo koobiye ciwaanka baarka biraawsarka, ama midigta-guji khariidadda oo dooro "Show address".','Latitude'=>'Lool','Longitude'=>'Loolka dhererka','Zoom'=>'Soo dhowee','Name of the place'=>'Magaca goobta','Shown under the map and read out by screen readers.'=>'Waxaa lagu muujiyaa khariidadda hoosteeda waxaana kor u akriya akhristayaasha shaashadda.','Paste coordinates (for example 51.5074, -0.1278) or an OpenStreetMap link.'=>'Ku dheji iskudheellada (tusaale ahaan 51.5074, -0.1278) ama xiriirinta OpenStreetMap.','Coordinates or link'=>'Isku-duwayaal ama xiriiriye','Preview the map'=>'Horu-eeg khariidadda','Check %1$s, %2$s on OpenStreetMap'=>'Ka hubi %1$s, %2$s OpenStreetMap','Published date'=>'Taariikhda la daabacay','Updated date (when it differs)'=>'Taariikhda la cusboonaysiiyay (markay ka duwan tahay)','Tags'=>'Calaamado','Reading time'=>'Waqtiga akhriska','Comment count'=>'Tirada faallooyinka','Details to show'=>'Faahfaahinta la muujinayo','Choose at least one detail to show.'=>'Dooro ugu yaraan hal faahfaahin oo la muujiyo.','Progress bar'=>'Barka horumarka','Maximum'=>'Ugu badan','100 for a percentage; any other number for a count, such as 8 of 10.'=>'100 boqolkiiba ahaan; tiro kasta oo kale tirin ahaan, sida 8 ka mid ah 10.','Show the percentage'=>'Muuji bo boqolkiiba','A password is set. Visitors see a password form instead of this content until they enter it.'=>'Furaha sirta ah waa la dejiyay. Booqdayaashu waxay arki doonaan foomka furaha sirta ah halkii ay ka arki lahaayeen nuxurkan ilaa ay geliyaan.','No password is set yet, so visitors see nothing here.'=>'Weli wax furaha sirta ah lama dejin, sidaas darteed booqdayaashu halkan waxba kuma arkaan.','New password'=>'Furaha sirta ah ee cusub','Set the password'=>'Deji ereyga sirta ah','Password set. Save the page to apply it; visitors who had unlocked it will need the new one.'=>'Furaha sirta ah waa la dejiyay. Kaydi bogga si aad u dhaqangeliso; booqdayaashii hore u furay waxay u baahan doonaan kan cusub.','If Page Builder Sandwich is ever switched off, this content is shown to everyone.'=>'Haddii Page Builder Sandwich waligeed la damiyo, waxyaabahan waxaa loo muujin doonaa qof walba.','Message above the password form (optional)'=>'Farriinta ka korreysa foomka erayga sirta ah (ikhtiyaari)','A/B test'=>'Tijaabada A/B','Test name'=>'Magaca tijaabada','Visitors who see version B (%)'=>'Booqdayaasha arka nooca B (%)','Goal (optional)'=>'Hadaf (ikhtiyaari ah)','A conversion is a click on a link or button, or a form sent, inside the version. To count a click elsewhere on the page instead, enter its CSS selector, for example #buy-now.'=>'Beddeliddu waa gujinta xiriiriye ama badhan, ama foom la diro, oo ku dhex jira nooca. Si aad taa beddelkeeda u tiriso gujin meel kale oo bogga ah, geli xulaha CSS-keeda, tusaale ahaan #buy-now.','See the results'=>'Arag natiijooyinka','An A/B test needs exactly two versions.'=>'Tijaabada A/B waxay u baahan tahay sax laba nooc.','Button'=>'Batoon','Visit site'=>'Booqo bogga','Style'=>'Qaabka','Affiliate button'=>'Batoonka xiriirka','Give the button its text and the offer’s address in the sidebar.'=>'Batoonka sii qoraalkiisa iyo ciwaanka dalabka ee ku yaal geeska.','Age check'=>'Hubinta da\'da','Put this block on every page that needs it, or in your header template part to cover the whole site.'=>'Geli balooggan bog kasta oo u baahan, ama qaybta qaab-dhismeedka madaxaaga si aad u daboosho dhammaan goobta.','Minimum age'=>'Da\'da ugu yar','Ask for'=>'Codso','A yes or no answer'=>'Jawaab ha ama maya ah','The date of birth'=>'Taariikhda dhalashada','Remember the answer for (days)'=>'Xusuusnoow jawaabta muddo (maalmood)','Texts'=>'Qoraallada','Leave a text empty to use the standard one. {age} is replaced by the minimum age.'=>'Qoraalka banaan kaga tag si aad u isticmaasho midka caadiga ah. {age} waxaa lagu beddelayaa da\'da ugu yar.','Question'=>'Su\'aal','When the visitor is too young'=>'Marka uu booqdaha aad u da\' yar yahay','Countries'=>'Waddamo','A different minimum age for visitors from a country, or 0 to close the site to it. The country comes from your host or CDN (for example Cloudflare); where it is unknown, the minimum age above applies. A page cache must keep one copy per country for these rules to apply to cached pages.'=>'Da\'da ugu yar oo ka duwan dadka ka soo booqda waddan, ama 0 si goobta looga xiro. Waddanku wuxuu ka yimaadaa martigeliyahaaga ama CDN (tusaale ahaan Cloudflare); meesha aan la garanayn, da\'da ugu yar ee sare ayaa khuseysa. Kaydka boggu waa inuu koobi midkiiba u hayaa waddan kasta si xeerarkani u khuseeyaan bogagga la kaydiyay.','Add a country'=>'Ku dar waddan','Country code (two letters)'=>'Koodhka dalka (laba xaraf)','For example US, GB, DE.'=>'Tusaale ahaan US, GB, DE.','Minimum age (0: closed)'=>'Da\'da ugu yar (0: xiran)','Age gate'=>'Xaqiijinta da\'da','The age question shows here.'=>'Su\'aasha da\'da waxay ka muuqataa halkan.','Changing words'=>'Beddelaya erayada','Word'=>'Erey','Add a word'=>'Ku dar eray','Animated headline'=>'Cinwaan socdaala','Text before'=>'Qoraalka ka horreeya','Text after'=>'Qoraalka ka dambeeya','Effect'=>'Saamayn','Fade'=>'Madoobee','Slide up'=>'Korsii kor','Typing'=>'Qoraya','Time per word (milliseconds)'=>'Waqtiga ereykiiba (millisekan)','Add the words that change in the block settings.'=>'Ku dar ereyada isbeddelaya ee ku jira habaynta baloogga.','Typewriter'=>'Makinada qoraalka','Words fade in'=>'Erayadu si tartiib ah ayey u soo baxayaan','Words rise in'=>'Erayadu waxay ku kordhaan','Plays once, when the text scrolls into view. Visitors who ask their device for less motion see the text still.'=>'Wuxuu shaqeeyaa hal mar, marka uu qoraalku soo galo shaashadda. Soo-booqdayaasha qalabkooda ka codsada dhaqdhaqaaq yar waxay qoraalka u arkaan mid taagan.','Speed'=>'Xawaaraha','Slow'=>'Gaabis','Normal'=>'Caadi','Fast'=>'Degdeg','Write the text to animate…'=>'Qor qoraalka la dhaqaajinayo…','Audio player'=>'Qalabka dhawaaqa','Show or album name'=>'Magaca bandhigga ama albamka','Replace artwork'=>'Beddel sawirka','Choose artwork'=>'Dooro sawirka','Add an episode'=>'Ku dar qayb','Choose audio file'=>'Dooro faylka codka','Replace audio file'=>'Beddel faylka codka','or its address'=>'ama ciwaankiisa','Add episodes in the sidebar.'=>'Ku dar qaybo dhinaca birta.','Author box'=>'Sanduuqa qoraaga','Picture size (pixels)'=>'Baaxadda sawirka (pixels)','Link to the author’s posts'=>'Xiriirka qoraallada qoraaga','Link to their website'=>'Ku xidh mareegtooda','Name as'=>'Magacow sida','Heading 2'=>'Cinwaanka 2','Heading 3'=>'Cinwaanka 3','Heading 4'=>'Cinwaanka 4','Paragraph'=>'Baaraagaraf','The author of the post shows here.'=>'Qoraaga qoraalka halkan ayaa lagu soo bandhigayaa.','Read out by screen readers, and shown when “Show label” is on.'=>'Waxa akhriya akhriyayaasha shaashadda, waxaana la muujiyaa marka "Muuji sumadda" ay daaran tahay.','Show label'=>'Muuji sumadda','Corner'=>'Konaan','End (right in English)'=>'Dhamaad (midig af Ingiriisi)','Start (left in English)'=>'Bilow (lagu reebay Ingiriisi)','Appear after scrolling (pixels)'=>'Ka muuqo ka dib rogista (pixels)','Before: alternative text'=>'Kahor: qoraal beddel ah','Before: label'=>'Kahor: sumad','After: alternative text'=>'Kadib: qoraal beddel ah','After: label'=>'Kadib: sumad','Slider'=>'Balaadhisaan','Starting position (%)'=>'Booska bilowga (%)','Before and after'=>'Kahor iyo kaddib','Choose the two images in the block settings. Use images of the same size.'=>'Dooro labada sawir ee ku jira habaynta baloogga. Isticmaal sawirro isku cabbir ah.','Start with the home page'=>'Ka bilow bogga hoyga','Home page label'=>'Sumadda bogga hore','Separator'=>'Kala-soocaha','Chevron ›'=>'Fallaadh ›','Slash /'=>'Xariiq qaloocan /','Arrow →'=>'Fallaadh →','Dot ·'=>'Dhibic ·','End with the current page'=>'Ku dhammee bogga hadda jira','Structured data for search engines'=>'Xog habaysan oo loogu talagalay matoorada raadinta','Adds BreadcrumbList data to the page. Turn it off if an SEO plugin already adds breadcrumb data.'=>'Waxay xogta BreadcrumbList ku dartaa bogga. Demi haddii furin SEO ahi uu horey ugu daray xogta breadcrumb-ka.','The path to the current page shows here. The home page has none.'=>'Waddada loo maro bogga hadda jira waxay ka muuqataa halkan. Bogga hoyga ma laha midna.','Remove these hours on %s'=>'Ka saar saacadahan %s','Add hours (for a break)'=>'Ku dar saacado (nasasho)','Copy Monday to Tuesday–Friday'=>'Ka koobi Isniin ilaa Talaado–Jimce','Hours that end after midnight (18:00 to 02:00) belong to the day they start. Times are in the site’s time zone (Settings › General).'=>'Saacadaha dhammaada saqda dhexe ka dib (18:00 ilaa 02:00) waxay ka tirsan yihiin maalinta ay bilaabmaan. Waqtiyadu waxay ku saleysan yihiin aag-saacadeedka goobta (Hagaajinta › Guud).','Display'=>'Muuji','Empty: read out by screen readers only.'=>'Faaruq: waxa akriya akhristayaasha shaashadda keliya.','Say whether it is open now'=>'Sheeg haddii ay furan tahay hadda','Highlight today'=>'Iftiimi maanta','Note under the hours'=>'Xusuus-qor ka hooseeya saacadaha','Closed on public holidays.'=>'Xidhan maalmaha fasaxa guud.','Offers'=>'Dalabyada','Add an offer'=>'Ku dar dalab','New offer'=>'Dalab cusub','Table'=>'Jadwal','Caption'=>'Qoraal kooban','Shown above the table and read out by screen readers.'=>'Waxaa lagu muujiyey shaxda dusheeda waxaana kor u aqrinaya aqriyeyaasha shaashadda.','Rank column'=>'Tiirka darajada','Rating column'=>'Tiirka qiimeynta','Highlights column'=>'Tiirka qodobada muhiimka ah','Notice under the table'=>'Ogeysiis ku hoos yaal shaxda','Casino comparison table'=>'Shaxda isbarbardhigga khamaarka','Add the offers in the sidebar, best first.'=>'Ku dar dalabyada dhinaca bogga, kan ugu fiican marka hore.','Kind'=>'Nooc','Bars'=>'Baararka','Line'=>'Sadarka','Pie (first series only)'=>'Gareeg (taxanaha koowaad kaliya)','Shown above the chart and read out as its name.'=>'Waxaa lagu muujiyey shaxda dulsheeda waxaana loo akriyaa sidii magaceeda.','Before each value'=>'Kahor qiime kasta','For example $ or €.'=>'Tusaale ahaan $ ama €.','After each value'=>'Qiimo kasta kadib','For example kg, or the percent sign.'=>'Tusaale ahaan kg, ama calaamadda boqolkiiba.','Show a legend'=>'Muuji halbeegga sharraxaadda','Print each value on the chart'=>'Ku dabac qiime kasta shaxda','Height'=>'Dherer','Short'=>'Gaaban','Tall'=>'Dheer','Add categories and numbers below to draw the chart.'=>'Ku dar qaybaha iyo tirooyinka hoose si aad jaantuska u sawirto.','Add category'=>'Ku dar qayb','Add series'=>'Ku dar taxane','Click to share quote'=>'Guji si aad u wadaagto xigashada','Quote'=>'Xigasho','X username'=>'Magaca isticmaalaha X','Added as "via @name". Without the @.'=>'Waxa lagu daray sida "via @name". La\'aanta @.','Link to share'=>'Xiriirinta la wadaagayo','Left empty, the address of this page.'=>'Haddii maran looga tago, ciwaanka boggan.','Write the quote in the block settings.'=>'Ku qor xigashada goobaha baloogga.','Content switcher'=>'Beddelaha nuxurka','Name for screen readers'=>'Magaca akhristayaasha shaashadda','What the switch chooses, for example "Billing period".'=>'Waxa furuhu doorto, tusaale ahaan "Muddada qaansheegta".','Add an option'=>'Ku dar dookh','Countdown'=>'Tirinta Hoos','Count down to'=>'Tirinta hoos u socota ilaa','A date and time'=>'Taariikh iyo waqti','A time after each visitor arrives'=>'Waqti ka dib markii booqde kasta yimaado','Ends at'=>'Wuxuu ku egyahay','In the time zone set under Settings, General.'=>'Aagga waqtiga lagu dejiyay qaybta Dejinta, Guud.','Hours after the first visit'=>'Saacado kadib booqashadii ugu horreysay','Text above'=>'Qoraalka kore','Text once it has ended'=>'Qoraalka marka uu dhammaado','Show seconds'=>'Muuji ilbidhiqsyada','Choose the date and time it counts down to.'=>'Dooro taariikhda iyo waqtiga uu tirinta dib-u-dhaca u socdo.','Counter'=>'Tiriyaha','Count to'=>'Ku tiri ilaa','Count from'=>'Ka tiri','Decimal places'=>'Jagooyinka jajabka tobanlaha','Before the number'=>'Lambarka ka hor','For example "$".'=>'Tusaale ahaan "$".','After the number'=>'Lambarka kaddib','For example "+" or "%".'=>'Tusaale ahaan "+" ama "%".','Thousands separator'=>'Kala-saaraha kumanyaasha','Counting time (milliseconds)'=>'Waqtiga tirinta (millisekan)','Set the number to count to.'=>'Deji lambarka lagu tirinayo.','Coupon code'=>'Koodhka kuubanka','Expires'=>'Wuxuu dhacayaa','As you want it shown, for example "31 December".'=>'Sida aad doonayso in loo muujiyo, tusaale ahaan "31 Diseembar".','Enter the code in the block settings.'=>'Geli koodka qaybta habaynta baloogga.','Prices'=>'Qiimayaasha','Show as'=>'U muuji ahaan','Scrolling ticker'=>'Xariiq qoraal oo wareegaysa','Cards'=>'Kaararka','Price chart (one coin)'=>'Shaxda qiimaha (hal qadaadiic)','Period'=>'Muddada','24 hours'=>'24 saacadood','7 days'=>'7 maalmood','30 days'=>'30 maalmood','90 days'=>'90 maalmood','Currency'=>'Lacagta','Coins'=>'Qadaadiic','Prices come from CoinGecko and are kept on your site for a few minutes, so visitors never wait for it.'=>'Qiimayaashu waxay ka yimaadaan CoinGecko waxaana lagu hayaa bartaada dhowr daqiiqo, si aysan soo-booqdayaashu marnaba u sugin.','Crypto prices'=>'Qiimaha crypto','Choose the coins in the sidebar.'=>'Ka dooro qadaadiicda dhinaca.','Cursor effect'=>'Saamaynta calaamadaha','A ring follows the pointer'=>'Fargal ayaa raacaya tilmaamaha','A soft spotlight'=>'Iftiin jilicsan','A trail of dots'=>'Rafta dhibco ah','Where'=>'Xaggee','Over this section'=>'Qaybtan dusheeda','Over the whole page'=>'Bogga oo dhan','The real pointer always stays. The effect is off on touch screens and for visitors who ask their device for less motion.'=>'Tilmaamaha dhabta ahi had iyo jeer wuu joogaa. Saamayntu way dansan tahay shaashadaha taabashada iyo booqdayaasha ka codsada qalabkooda dhaqdhaqaaq yar.','Switch'=>'Beddel','Number'=>'Lambarka','That has no rows under its first line. The first line is used for the column names.'=>'Taasi ma laha safaf ka hooseeya xariiqdeeda koowaad. Xariiqda koowaad waxa loo adeegsadaa magacyada tiirarka.','Import a CSV file'=>'Soo dhoofso faylka CSV','Or paste CSV'=>'Ama dhaji CSV','Comma, semicolon or tab separated. The first line holds the column names. Importing replaces the table.'=>'Waxaa lagu kala saaray hakad, semicolon ama tab. Khadka ugu horreeya wuxuu ka kooban yahay magacyada tiirarka. Soo dejintu waxay beddelaysaa shaxda.','Import pasted CSV'=>'Soo dhoofso CSV-ga la dhajiyay','Says what the table shows. Screen readers announce it even when it is empty on screen.'=>'Waxay sheegaysaa waxa shaxdu muujinayso. Qalabka shaashada akhriya ayaa ku dhawaaqa xitaa marka ay faaruq ku tahay shaashada.','Visitors can sort by a column'=>'Soo-booqdayaashu waxay ku kala saari karaan tiir','Show a search field'=>'Muuji meel wax laga raadiyo','First column names each row'=>'Tiirka koowaad wuxuu magacaabaa saf kasta','Sort “%s” as'=>'U kala saar “%s” ahaan','Remove column'=>'Ka saar tiirka','Import CSV'=>'Soo dhoofso CSV','On a narrow screen'=>'Shaashad cidhiidhi ah dushiisa','Each row becomes a card'=>'Saf kastaa wuxuu noqonayaa kaadh','The table scrolls sideways'=>'Jadwalku dhinac buu u rogmanayaa','Striped rows'=>'Safaf xariiqyo leh','Import a spreadsheet as CSV, paste one, or start with an empty table.'=>'Soo geli xaashida faafinta sida CSV, mid soo dheji, ama ka bilow miis madhan.','Start with an empty table'=>'Ku billow shax madhan','Name of column %d'=>'Magaca tiirka %d','Row %1$d, %2$s'=>'Safka %1$d, %2$s','Remove row %d'=>'Ka saar safka %d','Events'=>'Dhacdooyinka','Add an event'=>'Ku dar dhacdo','Starts'=>'Bilaabmaya','In the site’s time zone (Settings › General).'=>'Aagga waqtiga goobta (Dejinta › Guud).','Ends (optional)'=>'Wuxuu dhammaanayaa (ikhtiyaari)','Web address (optional)'=>'Ciwaanka shabakadda (ikhtiyaari)','Tickets or details. The title links to it.'=>'Tigidhada ama faahfaahinta. Cinwaanku wuxuu ku xirayaa xiriirkiisa.','All day'=>'Maalinta oo dhan','A list'=>'Liis','A month calendar'=>'Kalandarka bisha','Keep past events'=>'Hay dhacdooyinkii hore','Off: an event leaves the page once it has ended.'=>'Dami: dhacdaddu waxay ka baxaysaa bogga marka ay dhammaato.','Add the first event in the sidebar.'=>'Ku dar dhacdada koowaad ee dhinaca.','Front'=>'Hore','Button link'=>'Xiriirinta badhanka','Flip box'=>'Sanduuqa rogrogma','Flip'=>'Rog','Write the front and the back in the block settings.'=>'Ku qor dhinaca hore iyo dhinaca dambe goobaha baloogga.','Loading lists…'=>'Liisaska ayaa la soo dejinayaa…','Choose a list'=>'Dooro liis','Your name'=>'Magacaaga','Form name'=>'Magaca foomka','Shown in the email subject and the submissions list.'=>'Waxaa lagu muujiyay mawduuca iimaylka iyo liiska soo-gudbinta.','Message after sending'=>'Farriinta dirista kaddib','Go to this page after sending (optional)'=>'U gudub boggan ka dib dirista (ikhtiyaari)','Conversion event (optional)'=>'Dhacdada beddelka (ikhtiyaari)','Sent to Google Analytics, Tag Manager and the Meta Pixel when the form is sent. Leave empty for the default (generate_lead).'=>'Waxaa loo diraa Google Analytics, Tag Manager iyo Meta Pixel marka foomka la diro. U dhaaf bannaan qiimaha caadiga ah (generate_lead).','After sending'=>'Diritaanka kaddib','Email the submission'=>'Ku dir gudbinta iimayl','Send to'=>'U dir','One or more addresses, separated by commas. Empty: the site administrator.'=>'Hal cinwaan ama wax ka badan, oo ay hakadyo kala saarayaan. Haddii ay eber tahay: maamulaha goobta.','Save submissions on this site'=>'Ku keydi gudbinta boggan','Listed under Page Builder Sandwich → Form submissions, with a CSV export.'=>'Waxaa lagu qoray Page Builder Sandwich → Form submissions, oo leh dhoofinta CSV.','Send each submission to a webhook address'=>'U dir soo-gudbin kasta ciwaanka webhook','Webhook address (https)'=>'Cinwaanka Webhook (