 dhagax','Justified rows'=>'Safka la caddalad yeelay','Even grid'=>'Shabaq siman','Open images in a lightbox'=>'Sawirrada ku fur sanduuqa iftiinka','Show captions'=>'Muuji qoraalka hoose','Justified gallery'=>'Galaari la simay','Rows of images of equal height, each as wide as its shape.'=>'Safka sawirro dhererkoodu siman yahay, mid walbana ballaciisu la eg yahay qaabkiisa.','Points'=>'Dhibco','Point'=>'Fiiq','Add a point'=>'Ku dar dhibic','Across (%)'=>'Balaac (%)','Down (%)'=>'Xiran (%)','Image'=>'Sawir','Alternative text'=>'Qoraal beddelaad ah','Hotspots'=>'Goobaha xiriirka','Choose an image, then add points in the block settings.'=>'Dooro sawir, ka dibna ku dar dhibco goobaha qaybta.','Panels'=>'Dabaqyada','Add a panel'=>'Ku dar muraayad','Panel %d'=>'Qaybta %d','Choose image'=>'Dooro sawir','Replace image'=>'Beddel sawirka','Link (optional)'=>'Xiriirinta (ikhtiyaari)','Add panels in the sidebar.'=>'Ku dar qaybaha dhinaca.','The form shows only while “Anyone can register” is on in Settings › General.'=>'Foomku wuxuu soo muuqanayaa oo keliya marka “Qof kasta wuu is diiwaangelin karaa” laga shido Dejinta › Guud.','“Remember me” box'=>'Sanduukha "I xasuuso"','Lost password link'=>'Xiriirka sirta luntay','Link to create an account'=>'Xiriirinta samaynta akoon','After logging in, go to'=>'Ka dib markaad gasho, tag','Leave empty to come back to this page.'=>'Faaruq uga tag si aad boggan ugu soo noqoto.','Logo'=>'Astaanta','Add a logo'=>'Ku dar calaamad','The company name.'=>'Magaca shirkadda.','Logo grid'=>'Shaxda calaamadaha','Grey until hovered'=>'Cirroob ah ilaa la dul geeyo','Add a logo in the block settings.'=>'Ku dar calaamad goobaha balooga.','Logo marquee'=>'Astaanta socota','Grey logos'=>'Astaamaha cawlan','Lottie animation'=>'Dhaqdhaqaaqa Lottie','Animation file chosen.'=>'Faylka dhaqdhaqaaqa waa la doortay.','Upload or choose an animation file in the block settings.'=>'Kulaabo ama ka dooro faylka xaragada (animation) goobaha baloogga.','The file could not be uploaded.'=>'Faylka lama soo gelin karo.','Animation file'=>'Faylka dhaqdhaqaaqa','— Choose —'=>'— Dooro —','Upload a Lottie file (.json)'=>'Soo geli fayl Lottie ah (.json)','Playback'=>'Dib-u-daarid','What the animation shows, for people who cannot see it.'=>'Waxa ay xarakadu muujinayso, dadka aan arki karin.','Play'=>'Daar','When it scrolls into view'=>'Marka ay soo gasho aragtida','As soon as the page loads'=>'Isla marka ay bogga furanto','While the pointer is over it'=>'Inta tilmaamuhu dushiisa ku jiro','Loop'=>'Wareeg','Marquee'=>'Qoraal socda','Moves'=>'Dhaqdhaqaaqyada','Towards the start of a line'=>'Xagga bilowga laynka','Towards the end of a line'=>'Dhanka dhammaadka xariiqda','Between items'=>'Inta u dhaxaysa walxaha','Nothing'=>'Waxba','Name read out by screen readers'=>'Magaca ay akhriyaan akhriyayaasha shaashadu','Visitors get a pause button, and it stops while they point at it. It stays still for visitors who ask for less motion.'=>'Booqdayaashu waxay helayaan badhan joojin ah, wuuna istaagaa marka ay tilmaamaan. Wuu taagnaanayaa booqdayaasha codsada dhaqaaq yar.','Item %d'=>'Shayga %d','Remove item %d'=>'Ka saar sheeyga %d','Add item'=>'Ku dar shey','Mega menu'=>'Liiska weyn','Show under'=>'Ku muuji hoostiisa','The top-level menu item that opens this panel.'=>'Qaybta menu-ga heerka sare ee furaysa qaybtan.','Choose an item…'=>'Dooro shay…','As wide as its content'=>'U ballaaran sida nuxurkiisa','As wide as the menu bar'=>'U ballaaran sida liiska xulashada','Mega menu for “%s”'=>'Liiska weyn ee "%s"','Mega menu: choose its menu item in the sidebar.'=>'Mega menu: ka dooro qaybta liiskiisa ee dhinaca bar-ka.','Mini cart'=>'Gaari-gadeed yar','Activate WooCommerce to show the cart.'=>'Hawlgeli WooCommerce si aad u muujiso gaariga wax lagu gato.','Phones'=>'Taleefannada','Accordion on phones'=>'Akkordhanka talefannada','On narrow screens each tab becomes a section that opens and closes on its own.'=>'Shaashadaha cidhiidhiga ah, tab kastaa wuxuu noqonayaa qayb furanta oo iskeed isu xidhta.','3D model'=>'Qaabka 3D','Choose a model (GLB or glTF)'=>'Dooro nooc (GLB ama glTF)','Description (required)'=>'Faahfaahin (waajib ah)','What the model shows: it is what a screen reader announces.'=>'Waxa uu moodalku muujiyo: waa waxa uu akhriyaha shaashaddu ku dhawaaqo.','Poster image shown while it loads'=>'Sawirka boodhka ah ee la muujiyo inta uu soo shubmayo','Turn slowly on its own'=>'Si tartiib ah iskii u wareeg','Offer "view in your space" (AR) on phones'=>'Ku bixi "ku arag booskaaga" (AR) taleefannada','Choose a 3D model in the sidebar.'=>'Dhinaca ka dooro moodal 3D ah.','Choose a menu…'=>'Dooro liiska cuntada…','Only people who can edit the site’s menus can choose one here.'=>'Kaliya dadka wax ka beddeli kara liiska goobta ayaa mid halkan ka dooran kara.','Navigation menu'=>'Liiska hagidda','Choose which WordPress menu to show.'=>'Dooro liiska WordPress ee la muujinayo.','This site has no menus yet. Create one, then choose it here.'=>'Boggani weli ma laha menus. Abuur mid, ka dibna halkan ka dooro.','Edit menus'=>'Wax ka beddel liisaska','Tells screen reader users which menu this is, for example “Main” or “Footer”.'=>'Wuxuu u sheegaa isticmaaleyaasha akhriyaha shaashadda meenuyada ay tani tahay, tusaale ahaan "Guud" ama "Qeybta Hoose".','Direction'=>'Jihada','In a row'=>'Xiriir ah','In a column'=>'Tiir dhexdiisa','Mobile menu button'=>'Batoonka liiska mobaylka','Below this width the menu folds into a button that opens it over the page.'=>'Ballaadhkan ka hoos menu-gu wuxuu isu laabayaa badhan ka furaya bogga dushiisa.','On phones'=>'Telefoonada dusheeda','On phones and tablets'=>'Telefoonnada iyo kaniiniyada dushooda','Always'=>'Had iyo jeer','Never'=>'Marnaba','Open submenus'=>'Fur qayb-hoosaadyada','When the arrow is clicked'=>'Marka fallaarta la gujiyo','On hover, or when the arrow is clicked'=>'Marka la dul hoggaamiyo, ama marka fallaadha la gujiyo','Mega menus'=>'Liisaska mega','A mega menu shows any blocks under a top-