ee hoose.','Age notice'=>'Ogeysiiska da\'da','Offer card'=>'Kaarka dalabka','Give the offer a name in the sidebar.'=>'Bixi magaca dalabka ee ku yaal dhinaca bar-tilmaameedka.','People'=>'Dadka','Add a person'=>'Ku dar qof','Role'=>'Doorka','Add a photo'=>'Ku dar sawir','Reports to'=>'U warbixiya','Nobody (top of the chart)'=>'Qofna (ugu sarreeya shaxda)','Add the first person in the sidebar.'=>'Ku dar qofka koowaad dhinaca dhinac.','Parallax image'=>'Sawirka parallax','Describe the image; leave empty if it is only decoration.'=>'Sharax sawirka; bannaan ka tag haddii uu yahay kaliya qurxin.','Movement'=>'Dhaqdhaqaaq','Subtle'=>'Fudud','Strong'=>'Xooggan','Particles'=>'Qurubyo','How many'=>'Imisa','A few'=>'Dhowr','Some'=>'Qaar','Many'=>'Badan','Join nearby dots with lines'=>'Ku xidh dhibcaha dhow xariiqyo','The dots stop when the section is off screen, and stay still for visitors who ask their device for less motion.'=>'Dhibcuhu way istaagaan marka qaybtu ka baxdo shaashadda, waxayna u nastaan booqdayaasha ka codsada aaladdooda dhaqdhaqaaq yar.','Dots'=>'Dhibco','Dot colour (empty: the text colour)'=>'Midabka dhibicda (madhan: midabka qoraalka)','PDF'=>'PDF','Replace PDF'=>'Beddel PDF','Choose a PDF'=>'Dooro PDF','Choose a PDF in the sidebar.'=>'Ka dooro PDF dhinaca bar-tilmaameedka.','Carousel'=>'Wareegto','Buttons above the cards show one category at a time — a filterable portfolio.'=>'Batoonada ka sarreeya kaadhadhku waxay muujinayaan hal qayb markiiba — fayl-hawleed la kala shaandhayn karo.','More items'=>'Waxyaabo kale','Page numbers'=>'Lambarada bogga','"Load more" button'=>'Batoonka "Xamuul wax dheeraad ah"','Card titles are'=>'Cinwaannada kaarka waa','Post carousel'=>'Wareegto qoraallada','Your latest posts as a carousel of cards.'=>'Qoraalladaadii ugu dambeeyay oo ah wareeg kaarar ah.','Masonry posts'=>'Qoraallada qaabka masonry','Cards of different heights, packed into columns.'=>'Kaarar dherer kala duwan leh, oo lagu buuxiyay tiirar.','Filterable portfolio'=>'Faylka shaqada ee la kala shaandheyn karo','Cards with category buttons that filter them.'=>'Kaarar leh badhamada qaybaha kuwaas oo kala shaandheeya.','Items'=>'Walxaha','Add an item'=>'Ku dar shay','Price list'=>'Liiska qiimaha','Add an item in the block settings.'=>'Ku dar shay goobaha baloogga.','Plans'=>'Qorshooyinka','Add a plan'=>'Ku dar qorshe','Plan name'=>'Magaca qorshaha','A figure such as 19 or 19.99, or a word such as Free.'=>'Tiro sida 19 ama 19.99, ama eray sida Bilaash ah.','After the price'=>'Qiimaha kadib','For example "/ month". Left empty, the billing period is used.'=>'Tusaale ahaan "/ bil". Haddii bannaan looga tago, muddada qaansheegta ayaa la isticmaalayaa.','Yearly price'=>'Qiimaha sannadlaha','Shown when the visitor switches to yearly billing.'=>'Waxa la muujiyaa marka booqdaha uu u beddelo biilasha sannadlaha ah.','After the yearly price'=>'Qiimaha sannadlaha ah kaddib','Add a feature'=>'Ku dar sifo','Open the link in a new tab'=>'Ku fur xiriirinta taab cusub','Highlight this plan'=>'Iftiimi qorshahan','A short label above the plan, such as "Most popular".'=>'Sumad gaaban oo ka sarreysa qorshaha, sida "Ugu caansan".','Pricing table'=>'Shaxda qiimaha','Currency symbol'=>'Astaanta lacagta','Monthly / yearly switch'=>'Beddelka bishii / sanadkii','Shows a switch when at least one plan has a yearly price.'=>'Wuxuu muujinayaa furaha beddelka marka ugu yaraan hal qorshe uu leeyahay qiimo sannadle ah.','Monthly button text'=>'Qoraalka batoonka bishiiba','Yearly button text'=>'Qoraalka badhanka sannadlaha ah','Yearly saving'=>'Kaydinta sanadlaha ah','For example "Save 20%".'=>'Tusaale ahaan "Kaydso 20%".','Add a plan in the block settings.'=>'Ku dar qorshe goobaha baloogga.','Add to cart'=>'Ku dar gaariga','SKU and categories'=>'SKU iyo qaybaha','Tabs'=>'Kala-soocyo','Related products'=>'Balaahyada la xiriira','Upsells'=>'Iibka korodhka ah','Sale badge'=>'Astaanta qiimo-dhimista','Stock'=>'Kayd','The product being viewed (or the loop’s)'=>'Balaa