ta iyo xaaladdiisa','Column heading level'=>'Heerka cinwaanka tiirka','Add the first item in the sidebar.'=>'Ku dar shayga koowaad dhinaca.','Hidden labels are still read out by screen readers.'=>'Calaamadaha qarsoon wali waxa akhriya akhristayaasha shaashadda.','Icon instead of button text'=>'Astaanta halkii qoraalka badhanka','Search in'=>'Ka raadi','The whole website'=>'Dhammaan mareegta','Device share menu'=>'Liiska wadaagga aaladda','Share to'=>'La wadaag','Share bar'=>'Barka wadaagga','For example "Share". Left empty, no label is shown.'=>'Tusaale ahaan "La wadaag". Haddii maran laga tago, wax calaamad ah lama muujinayo.','Floating at the side (wide screens)'=>'Dhinaca sabaynaya (shaashadaha ballaaran)','The buttons appear once the page has an address (save it as a draft).'=>'Badhamadu waxay soo baxayaan marka boggu yeesho ciwaan (u keydi sidii qabyo qoraal).','Networks'=>'Shabakadaha','Device share button'=>'Batoonka wadaagista aaladda','Phones and some browsers offer their own share sheet; the button appears only where one exists.'=>'Telefoonnada iyo qaar ka mid ah daalacayaashu waxay bixiyaan xaashida wadaagga ee u gaarka ah; badhanku wuxuu soo baxayaa kaliya meesha mid uu ka jiro.','Look'=>'Eeg','Show network names'=>'Muuji magacyada shabakadda','Shape'=>'Qaab','Rounded'=>'Wareegsan','Circle'=>'Goobo','Square'=>'Labajibbaar','Edit images (%d)'=>'Wax ka beddel sawirrada (%d)','Choose images'=>'Dooro sawirro','Content type'=>'Nooca nuxurka','Only these categories'=>'Kaliya qaybahan','None chosen: every category.'=>'Midna lama dooran: qayb kasta.','Oldest first'=>'Ugu horrayn kuwa ugu da\'da weyn','Title, A to Z'=>'Cinwaanka, A ilaa Z','Recently updated'=>'Dhawaan la cusboonaysiiyay','Custom order'=>'Kala-horreynta caadada ah','Summary'=>'Koobid','Price (products)'=>'Qiimaha (alaabta)','Card'=>'Kaadh','Previous and next buttons'=>'Badhamada hore iyo xiga','Start again after the last'=>'Mar kale ka bilow ka dambeeya kii u dambeeyay','Play automatically'=>'Si toos ah u daar','Never for visitors who prefer less motion; pauses on hover and focus, and has a Stop button.'=>'Marna looma muujiyo booqdayaasha doorbida dhaqaaq yar; wuu hakadaa marka la dul istaago ama diiradda la saaro, wuxuuna leeyahay badhan Jooji.','Seconds per slide'=>'Ilbiriqsi kasta oo sawir qaade ah','Move up'=>'Kor u qaad','Move down'=>'Hoos u qaad','Remove column %s'=>'Ka saar tiirka %s','The first line holds the column names. Importing replaces what is here.'=>'Sadarka koowaad wuxuu ka kooban yahay magacyada tiirarka. Soo dejintu waxay beddelaysaa waxa halkan yaal.','Remove image'=>'Ka saar sawirka','%1$s %2$d'=>'%1$s %2$d','Pick the level that fits the outline of the page.'=>'Dooro heerka ku habboon qaab-dhismeedka bogga.','Replace photo'=>'Beddel sawirka','Move %s up'=>'Kor u qaad %s','Move %s down'=>'U dhaqaaji %s hoos','Duplicate %s'=>'Nuqul ka samee %s','Remove %s'=>'Ka saar %s','Rating (0 to 5)'=>'Qiimaynta (0 ilaa 5)','Highlights, one per line'=>'Qodobbada muhiimka ah, midkiiba xariiq','Optional, for example “Top pick”.'=>'Ikhtiyaari, tusaale ahaan “Xulashada ugu sarreysa”.','Terms (shown with the offer)'=>'Shuruudaha (waxaa lagu muujiyay dalabka)','The key terms your licence requires next to the offer, for example the wagering requirement.'=>'Shuruudaha muhiimka ah ee shatigaagu u baahan yahay ee ku xiga dalabka, tusaale ahaan shuruudda khamaarka.','Replace logo'=>'Beddel astaanta','Choose logo'=>'Dooro astaanta','Remove logo'=>'Ka saar astaanta','Give the short link a name, and the offer a full address starting with https://.'=>'Sii xiriiriyaha gaaban magac, dalabkana cinwaan buuxa oo ka bilaabmaya https://.','The short link could not be saved.'=>'Xiriirinta gaaban lama keydin karin.','Offer address'=>'Ciwaanka dalabka','Your affiliate link. Links to offers are always marked as sponsored for search engines.'=>'Xiriiriyahaaga xiriirinta. Xiriiriyeyaasha dalabyada waxaa mar walba matoorada raadinta loogu calaamadeeyaa sidii kuwo la kafaala-qaaday