aggu yihiin, tusaale ahaan "Sheekooyinka macaamiisha".','Image slider'=>'Balaariyaha sawirka','Images from the media library, one after another.'=>'Sawirrada ka yimid kaydka warbaahinta, midba midka kale ka dib.','Post slider'=>'Boodh-rogaha qoraallada','Product slider'=>'Balaarinta badeecada','WooCommerce products as a carousel.'=>'Badeecadaha WooCommerce sida karuusel ahaan.','Ken Burns slideshow'=>'Muuqaal-sawireedka Ken Burns','Full-width images with a slow zoom, fading from one to the next.'=>'Sawirro ballac buuxa ah oo si tartiib ah u soo dhowaanaya, midba midka kale ugu dhex libdhayo.','Recent sales notices — example, shown only in the editor'=>'Ogeysiisyada iibka ee dhowaa — tusaale, waxaa lagu muujiyay kaliya tifaftiraha','First name from Town bought Product'=>'Magaca koowaad oo ka yimid Magaalada ayaa iibsaday Badeecad','2 hours ago'=>'2 saacadood ka hor','Orders'=>'Dalabyada','Orders from'=>'Dalabyada ka yimid','WooCommerce and Easy Digital Downloads'=>'WooCommerce iyo Easy Digital Downloads','WooCommerce'=>'WooCommerce','Easy Digital Downloads'=>'Soo Degsasho Dijitaal ah oo Fudud','Most recent orders to show'=>'Dalabyadii ugu dambeeyay ee la muujinayo','Oldest order (days)'=>'Dalabka ugu da\'da weyn (maalmo)','Name the product'=>'Magacow badeecada','Say how long ago'=>'Sheeg inta ka horreysay','Timing and place'=>'Waqtiga iyo goobta','Each notice shows for (seconds)'=>'Ogeysiis kasta wuxuu muuqanayaa muddo (ilbiriqsiyo ah)','Pause between notices (seconds)'=>'Hakadka u dhexeeya ogeysiisyada (ilbiriqsiyo)','Bottom, reading start'=>'Qeybta hoose, bilowga akhriska','Bottom, reading end'=>'Hoos, dhammaadka akhriska','Where the notices come from'=>'Halka ay ogeysiisyadu ka yimaadaan','Only real, paid orders are shown, and only when the buyer ticked the box at checkout that lets this site show their first name and town. Once this page is saved, the checkout offers that box. Until an order with it arrives, visitors see nothing.'=>'Keliya dalabyada dhabta ah ee la bixiyay ayaa la muujiyaa, oo keliya marka iibsaduhu uu saxo sanduuqa marka lacag-bixinta la samaynayo kaas oo u oggolaanaya boggan inuu muujiyo magacooda koowaad iyo magaaladooda. Marka boggan la kaydiyo, qaybta lacag-bixinta ayaa bixinaysa sanduuqaas. Ilaa uu ka yimaado dalab sanduuqaas leh, soo-booqdayaashu ma arki doonaan waxba.','Find the coordinates from the address'=>'Ka raadi isuduwaha ciwaanka','Found. Check the pin on the map on the page.'=>'Waa la helay. Ka hubi biinka khariidadda ku taal bogga.','No match. Try the street, town and postcode, or type the coordinates.'=>'Lama helin wax u dhigma. Isku day waddada, magaalada iyo lambarka boostada, ama ku qor isku-duwayaasha.','OpenStreetMap did not answer. Try again in a minute, or type the coordinates.'=>'OpenStreetMap ma aysan jawaabin. Isku day mar kale hal daqiiqo kaddib, ama qor isku-duwayaasha.','Sends the address to OpenStreetMap (Nominatim) and fills in the latitude and longitude.'=>'Cinwaanka wuxuu u diraa OpenStreetMap (Nominatim) wuxuuna buuxiyaa loolka iyo dhigaha.','Locations'=>'Goobaha','Add a location'=>'Ku dar meel','Search and “Nearest to me”'=>'Raadi iyo "Ugu dhow aniga"','Offer a map'=>'Bixi maab','Visitors press “Show the map” first: nothing loads from OpenStreetMap until they do.'=>'Soo-booqdayaashu waxay marka hore riixaan "Show the map": waxba kama soo rogmadaan OpenStreetMap ilaa ay sidaas sameeyaan.','Map zoom (0 = fit every location)'=>'Soo-dhoweynta khariidadda (0 = ku habbee goob kasta)','Add the first location in the sidebar.'=>'Ku dar goobta koowaad dhinaca dambe.','Pane'=>'Qayb','Name on the switch'=>'Magaca ku yaal furaha','Person'=>'Qof','Short bio'=>'Taariikh-nololeed kooban','Photo'=>'Sawir','Photo: alternative text'=>'Sawir: qoraal beddel ah','Leave empty when the photo only repeats the name.'=>'Faaruq ka tag marka sawirku uu magaca kaliya ku celinayo.','Profile links'=>'Xiriirinta astaanta','Add a link'=>'Ku dar xiriiriye','Network'=>'Shabakad','LinkedIn'=>'LinkedIn','X'=>'X','Facebook'=>'Facebook','Instagram'=>'Instagram','GitHub'=>'GitHub','YouTube'=>'YouTube','Mastodon'=>'Mastodon','Bluesky'=>'Bluesky','Add a person in the block settings.'=>'Ku dar qof goobaha baloogga.','Event'=>'Dhacdo','Add an event in the block settings.'=>'Ku dar dhacdo goobaha qaybta.','Badges'=>'Calaamadaha','Add a badge'=>'Ku dar calaamad','Trust badges'=>'Astaamaha kalsoonida','Row'=>'Saffo','Add a badge in the block settings.'=>'Ku dar calaamad goobaha baloogga.','Videos'=>'Fiidiyowyo','Add a video'=>'Ku dar muuqaal','Video address (YouTube, Vimeo or a file)'=>'Cinwaanka muuqaalka (YouTube, Vimeo ama fayl)','Poster image (optional)'=>'Sawirka boodhka (ikhtiyaari)','Replace poster'=>'Beddel booska','Add videos in the sidebar.'=>'Ku dar fiidiyowyo dhinaca garabka ah.','Name of the list'=>'Magaca liiska','Web address or text'=>'Cinwaanka shabakadda ama qoraal','QR code'=>'Koodhka QR','Description for screen readers'=>'Sharaxaadda akhriyeyaasha shaashadda','Leave empty to use "QR code for" and the text.'=>'Faaruq ka tag si aad u isticmaasho "QR code loogu talagalay" iyo qoraalka.','Type a web address, a phone link (tel:) or any text.'=>'Ku qor ciwaanka shabakadda, xiriirinta taleefanka (tel:) ama qoraal kasta.','This is too long for a QR code. Shorten it.'=>'Kani aad buu ugu dheer yahay koodhka QR. Soo gaabi.','Add a caption'=>'Ku dar qoraal sharraxaad ah','Reading progress bar'=>'Barka horumarka akhriska','Edge of the window'=>'Cidhifka daaqadda','Top'=>'Xagga sare','Bottom'=>'Qeybta hoose','Shown along the bottom of the window as visitors scroll.'=>'Waxaa lagu muujiyaa xagga hoose ee daaqadda marka ay booqdayaashu bogga rogaan.','Shown along the top of the window as visitors scroll.'=>'Waxa lagu muujiyaa xagga sare ee daaqadda marka ay soo-booqdayaashu hoos u rogaan.','Related by'=>'Xiriirka ku saleysan','Categories or tags'=>'Qaybaha ama calaamadaha','When nothing is related, show the newest instead'=>'Marka aysan waxba xiriir la lahayn, beddelkeeda muuji kuwa ugu cusub','Leave empty for "Related posts".'=>'U dhaaf maran "Qoraallada la xiriira".','Show the featured image'=>'Muuji sawirka la xushay','Show a summary'=>'Muuji koobitaan','No posts share this post’s categories or tags yet. When some do, they show here.'=>'Weli ma jiraan qoraallo la wadaaga qaybaha ama sumadaha qoraalkan. Markay qaar yeeshaan, waxay ka soo muuqan doonaan halkan.','Modal'=>'Daaqad gooni ah','Off-canvas panel'=>'Qaybta shaashadda ka baxsan','Slides in from'=>'Ka soo siqaya','Start is the side where reading begins: the left in English, the right in Arabic.'=>'Bilawgu waa dhinaca wax-akhrintu ka bilaabanto: bidixda xagga Ingiriisiga, midigta xagga Carabiga.','Close when the page behind is clicked'=>'Xir marka bogga dambe la gujiyo','Title of the window'=>'Cinwaanka daaqadda','Check mark'=>'Calaamadda saxda','Cross'=>'Iskalaab','Dot'=>'Barta','Arrow'=>'Fallaadh','Star'=>'Xiddig','Icon colour'=>'Midabka astaanta','Same as the text'=>'La mid ah qoraalka','Theme primary'=>'Mowduuca koowaad','Theme secondary'=>'Mowduuca labaad','Theme contrast'=>'Muuqaalka mawduuca','Keep headings in order down the page: a heading one level below the section it sits in.'=>'Isku xigxiga cinwaannada u ilaali bogga hoostiisa: cinwaan hal heer ka hooseeya qaybta uu ku dhex jiro.','Choose icon'=>'Dooro astaanta','Use the default icon'=>'Isticmaal astaanta caadiga ah','Choose an icon'=>'Dooro astaan','Show a heading for each type'=>'Muuji cinwaan nooc kasta','Nothing published yet in the types you chose.'=>'Weli waxba laguma daabicin noocyada aad dooratay.','Links'=>'Xiriirinta','Link %d'=>'Xiriirka %d','A profile address, mailto:you@example.com or tel:+441234567890.'=>'Cinwaanka profile-ka, mailto:you@example.com ama tel:+441234567890.','Name read to screen readers'=>'Magaca loo akhriyo akhristayaasha shaashadda','Other icon'=>'Astaanta kale','Add link'=>'Ku dar xiriiriye','Icon only'=>'Astaanta keliya','Rounded square'=>'Labajibbaar geeso wareegsan','Open profiles in a new tab'=>'Ku fur borofaylada tab cusub','Star rating'=>'Qiimeynta xiddigaha','Number of stars'=>'Tirada xiddigaha','Show the number'=>'Muuji lambarka','Down the page'=>'Bogga xaggiisa hoose','Side by side (stacks on phones)'=>'Dhinac kasta dhinac (telefoonnada dushooda is dul saaran)','Number colour'=>'Midabka lambarka','Order of the steps'=>'Hormada tallaabooyinka','Step %d'=>'Tallaabada %d','Step…'=>'Talaabada…','What to do…'=>'Waxa la samaynayo…','Add step'=>'Ku dar tallaabo','Tab'=>'Tab','Add headings to the page and they will be listed here.'=>'Ku dar ciwaanno bogga waxaana lagu qori doonaa halkan.','Table of contents'=>'Tusmada nuxurka','From heading level'=>'Laga bilaabo heerka cinwaanka','To heading level'=>'Ku socota heerka cinwaanka','Numbered'=>'Lambaraysan','Can be collapsed'=>'Waa la laabi karaa','Start collapsed'=>'Ku bilow adoo laaban','Highlight the section being read'=>'Iftiimi qaybta la akhrinayo','Optional. Says what the tabs are about, for example "Plans".'=>'Ikhtiyaari. Wuxuu sheegayaa waxa ay ku saabsan yihiin taabbada, tusaale ahaan "Qorshayaasha".','Open on page load'=>'Fur marka bogga la soo shubo','Tabs down the side'=>'Muuqaallada dhinaca','Add a tab'=>'Ku dar tab','Testimonial'=>'Marag-fur','Choose photo'=>'Dooro sawir','Remove photo'=>'Ka saar sawirka','Photo description'=>'Faahfaahinta sawirka','Leave empty when the photo only shows the person named next to it.'=>'Faaruq ka tag marka sawirku uu muujinayo oo keliya qofka magaciisa lagu xusay agtiisa.','Star rating (0 = none)'=>'Qiimeynta xiddigaha (0 = ma jiro)','Name under the quote'=>'Magaca xigashada hoosteeda','Photo beside the quote'=>'Sawirka xigashada dhinaceeda ah','What the customer said…'=>'Waxa uu macmiilku yiri…','Role or company'=>'Doorka ama shirkadda','Tooltip'=>'Qalab-tilmaame','Tooltip text'=>'Qoraalka tilmaanta','Keep it short: one or two sentences. Screen readers read it with the word it explains.'=>'Ka dhig mid gaaban: hal ama labo weedhood. Akhristayaasha shaashadu waxay ku akhriyaan ereyga ay sharraxayso.','Show it'=>'Muuji','Above'=>'Korsan','Below'=>'Hoos','Word or phrase'=>'Eray ama weedh','Profile'=>'Muuqaalka guud','Whose profile'=>'Astaanta qofee','The post’s author'=>'Qoraaga qoraalka','Show the profile picture'=>'Muuji sawirka astaanta','Show the biography'=>'Muuji taariikh nololeedka','Show links to posts and website'=>'Muuji xiriiriyeyaasha qoraallada iyo degelka','Author profile'=>'Xogta qoraaga','Choose whose profile to show.'=>'Dooro astaanta qofka la muujinayo.','WhatsApp number, with country code'=>'Lambarka WhatsApp, oo ay la socoto koodhka dalka','For example +44 7700 900123.'=>'Tusaale ahaan +44 7700 900123.','Message to start with (optional)'=>'Farriinta lagu bilaabayo (ikhtiyaari)','Show the text next to the icon'=>'Ku muuji qoraalka astaanta agteeda','Bottom end (right in English)'=>'Dhammaadka hoose (midigta af Ingiriiska)','Bottom start (left in English)'=>'Bilaawga hoose (bidix ahaan Ingiriisiga)','Add your WhatsApp number in the sidebar. Until then the button is not shown on the page.'=>'Ku dar lambarkaaga WhatsApp dhinaca bogga. Ilaa markaas badhanka laguma tusi doono bogga.','On the page, this button floats in a bottom corner of the screen.'=>'Bogga dushiisa, badhankani wuxuu dul sabeeyaa geeska hoose ee shaashadda.','Saved to your cloud library.'=>'Waxaa lagu kaydiyay maktabaddaada daruurta.','Save to cloud library'=>'Ku keydi maktabadda daruurta','Save to'=>'Ku kaydi','Images are resized, stored once and brought back into the media library of any site that inserts this design.'=>'Sawirrada cabbirkooda waa la beddelaa, hal mar ayaa la kaydiyaa waxaana dib loogu soo celiyaa kaydka warbaahinta ee goob kasta oo gelisa naqshaddan.','%s style'=>'Qaabka %s','Save style to cloud library'=>'Ku kaydi qaabka maktabadda daruurta','Select a block first, then apply the style.'=>'Marka hore dooro baloog, ka dibna codso qaabka.','Library'=>'Maktabadda','Save this page to the library'=>'Ku kaydi boggan maktabadda','Insert'=>'Geli','Shortcode tag'=>'Sumadda shortcode-ka','Use letters, numbers, dashes and underscores only.'=>'Isticmaal xarfaha, lambarrada, xarriiqyada iyo xarriiqyada hoose keliya.','Attribute name'=>'Magaca sifo','Add attribute'=>'Ku dar sifo','Shortcode'=>'Kood gaaban','Other attributes'=>'Sifooyin kale','Choose a shortcode tag in the block settings.'=>'Ku dooro sumadda shortcode-ka habaynta baloogga.','Image size'=>'Baaxadda sawirka','Thumbnail'=>'Muuqaal yar','Full size'=>'Cabir buuxa','Link to'=>'Ku xiri','Attachment page'=>'Bogga lifaaqa','Media file'=>'Faylka warbaahinta','Audio'=>'Maqal','Video'=>'Fiidiyow','File address'=>'Cinwaanka faylka','Poster image'=>'Sawirka booska','Media IDs, separated by commas'=>'Aqoonsiyada warbaahinta, oo lagu kala saaray hakadyo','Show the track list'=>'Muuji liiska heesaha','Embed'=>'Geli','Address to embed'=>'Cinwaanka la gulinayo','Maximum width'=>'Ballaadhka ugu badan','Image and caption HTML'=>'HTML-ka sawirka iyo qoraalka sawirka','Tip: the Form block shows this form styled to match your site.'=>'Talo: Qaybta Foomku waxay muujinaysaa foomkan oo loo qaabeeyey si uu ula mid noqdo boggaaga.','Show the form title'=>'Muuji cinwaanka foomka','Show the form description'=>'Muuji sharaxaadda foomka','Submit without reloading the page'=>'Goo\'aami adigoon bogga dib u soo kicin','The "%s" control from the old editor is not available in the block editor. Enter the value as text.'=>'Koontaroolka "%s" ee tifaftirihii hore lagama heli karo tifaftiraha baloogga. Geli qiimaha qoraal ahaan.','Choose file'=>'Dooro fayl','— Default —'=>'— Ugu talagal —','Advanced styling'=>'Nashqadaynta heerka sare','Inline CSS'=>'CSS-ka Khadka Dhexdiisa ah','CSS declarations, for example: min-height: 380px; background-color: #333'=>'Bayaannada CSS, tusaale ahaan: min-height: 380px; background-color: #333','Effects (legacy classes)'=>'Saamaynta (fasallada duugga ah)','Space-separated effect names carried over from older versions, for example: hover-shadow'=>'Magacyada saamaynta ee bannaan u dhexeeyo ee laga soo wareejiyay noocyadii hore, tusaale ahaan: hover-shadow','Full width, content kept in the middle'=>'Ballac buuxa, nuxurka dhexda ayaa lagu hayaa','Link relationship'=>'Xiriirka xiriiriyaha','Left'=>'Bidix','Right'=>'Midig','Add text…'=>'Ku dar qoraal…','Placement'=>'Meelaynta','On its own line'=>'Khadkiisa gaarka ah','In the line, beside other content'=>'Xariiqda dhexdeeda, ku xigta waxyaabaha kale','Automatic (own line at the top level of the page)'=>'Toos ah (khadkiisa u gaarka ah ee heerka ugu sarreeya bogga)','Accessible label'=>'Summad la heli karo','Leave empty for a decorative icon.'=>'U dhaaf maran astaanta qurxinta.','Choose an icon in the block settings.'=>'Dooro astaan ku dhex jirta habaynta baloogga.','New setting name'=>'Magaca habaynta cusub','For example: title or text'=>'Tusaale ahaan: cinwaan ama qoraal','Add setting'=>'Ku dar habayn','Widget'=>'Widget','Choose a widget'=>'Dooro widjet','Widget area'=>'Aagga widget-ka','Choose a widget area'=>'Dooro aagga wijet-ka','This image has no width and height, so the page will jump when it loads. Choose it from the Media Library, or set its width and height.'=>'Sawirkan ma laha ballac iyo dherer, sidaas darteed boggu wuu boodi doonaa markuu soo shubmayo. Ka dooro Maktabadda Warbaahinta, ama deji ballaciisa iyo dhererkiisa.','This video is not from the Media Library, so its size is unknown and the page will jump when it loads. Upload it to the Media Library instead.'=>'Fiidyowgan kama iman Maktabadda Warbaahinta, markaa cabbirkiisu lama yaqaan bogguna wuu boodi doonaa marka uu soo shubmo. Taas beddelkeeda ku soo dheji Maktabadda Warbaahinta.','An image, video or frame in this HTML has no width and height, so the page will jump when it loads. Add width and height attributes to it.'=>'Sawir, muuqaal ama fareem ku jira HTML-kan malaha ballac iyo dherer, sidaas darteed boggu wuu boodi doonaa marka uu soo kaco. Ku dar sifooyinka ballaca iyo dhererka (width iyo height).','This embed resizes itself after it loads, which moves the content below it. Give it room or place it lower on the page.'=>'Geli-tani waxay beddeshaa cabbirkeeda ka dib marka ay soo baxdo, taasoo dhaqaajinaysa nuxurka ka hooseeya. Sii meel bannaan ama dhig meel ka hoosaysa bogga.','Layout shift'=>'Baddelka qaabka','This widget does not describe its settings, so they are edited as name and value pairs.'=>'Widget-kani ma qeexayo habaynnadiisa, sidaas darteed waxa loo tafatiraa sidii lammaanayaal magac iyo qiimo ah.','Problem'=>'Dhibaatada','Check'=>'Hubi','Show block'=>'Muuji baloogga','Use a readable theme colour'=>'Isticmaal midab mawduuc oo la akhrin karo','Make it H%d'=>'Ka dhig H%d','Alt text'=>'Qoraal beddel ah','Save alt text'=>'Keydi qoraalka beddelka ah','This image is decorative'=>'Sawirkani waa mid lagu qurxiyo','Checking…'=>'Hubinayaa…','No accessibility problems found on this page.'=>'Boggan lagama helin wax dhibaatooyin ah oo ku saabsan gelitaanka.','%1$s, %2$s.'=>'%1$s, %2$s.','%d problem'=>'%d dhibaato' . "\0" . '%d dhibaatooyin','%d thing to check'=>'%d shay oo la hubiyo' . "\0" . '%d shay oo la hubiyo','Check again'=>'Mar kale hubi','An automatic check finds many problems but not all of them. Also try the page with the keyboard alone and with a screen reader.'=>'Baaritaanka tooska ah waxa uu helaa dhibaatooyin badan laakiin ma wada aha dhammaantood. Sidoo kale bogga ku tijaabi adiga oo isticmaalaya kiiboodhka oo keliya iyo akhriyaha shaashadda.','Text contrast is %1$s:1; it needs at least %2$s:1 to be readable.'=>'Farqiga qoraalka waa %1$s:1; wuxuu u baahan yahay ugu yaraan %2$s:1 si loo akhriyo.','click here,here,read more,more,link,this link,learn more,go'=>'halkan guji,halkan,wax badan akhri,dheeraad,xiriiriye,xiriiriyahan,wax badan baro,soco','A link has no text, so a screen reader announces only “link”. Add text or a label.'=>'Xiriirintu ma laha qoraal, sidaas darteed aqriyaha shaashadu wuxuu ku dhawaaqayaa oo kaliya "xiriirin". Ku dar qoraal ama calaamad.','The link text “%s” does not say where it goes. Describe the destination instead.'=>'Qoraalka xiriiriyaha "%s" ma sheegayo meesha uu u socdo. Taas beddelkeeda qeex meesha la tagayo.','An element has a positive tabindex, which changes the keyboard order away from the reading order. Use 0 or remove it.'=>'Walax waxay leedahay tabindex togan, kaas oo beddelaya nidaamka kiiboodhka kana leexinaya nidaamka akhriska. Isticmaal 0 ama meesha ka saar.','Something clickable cannot be reached with the keyboard. Use a real button or link.'=>'Wax la riixi karo laguma gaari karo kiiboodhka. Isticmaal badhan ama xiriiriye dhab ah.','An embedded frame has no title, so a screen reader cannot say what it is.'=>'Fariimaha la dhex-geliyay ma laha cinwaan, sidaas darteed qalabka shaashadda akhriya ma sheegi karo waxa uu yahay.','A form field has no label, so its purpose is not announced.'=>'Goobta foomka ma laha sumad, sidaa darteed ujeeddadeeda lama shaacin.','This heading is empty. Screen reader users navigate by headings; remove it or add text.'=>'Cinwaankani waa madhan yahay. Isticmaalayaasha qalabka shaashadda akhriya waxay wax ku dhex maraan cinwaannada; ka saar ama ku dar qoraal.','The page title is already the H1; use H2 for the top level of the content.'=>'Cinwaanka boggu mar horeba waa H1; u isticmaal H2 heerka ugu sarreeya ee nuxurka.','This H%1$d skips a level; the one before it is H%2$d. Make it an H%3$d.'=>'H%1$d-kan wuxuu ka boodayaa heerar; kan ka horreeya waa H%2$d. Ka dhig H%3$d.','This image has no alt text. Describe it, or mark it as decorative if it adds nothing.'=>'Sawirkani ma laha qoraal kale (alt text). Sharax, ama calaamadee mid qurxin ah haddii aanu waxba ku kordhinayn.','Close panel'=>'Xidh qaybta','Desktop'=>'Kumbuyuutarka miiska','Default'=>'Ugu talagal','Every track'=>'Raad kasta','Track sizes, for example: 1fr 2fr 200px'=>'Cabirrada dhabada, tusaale ahaan: 1fr 2fr 200px','Custom track sizes'=>'Cabirrada gaarka ah ee laynka','Equal tracks'=>'Waddooyin siman','One quoted row per line, for example: "head head" "side main". Name the area on each child block.'=>'Hal saf oo xigasho ku jirta xariiq kasta, tusaale ahaan: "head head" "side main". Magacaabi aagga ku yaal baloog kasta oo farac ah.','Automatic'=>'Toos ah','Square (1:1)'=>'Labajibbaar (1:1)','Standard (4:3)'=>'Heerbeeg (4:3)','Classic (3:2)'=>'Caadi (3:2)','Wide (16:9)'=>'Balaaran (16:9)','Cinema (21:9)'=>'Shineemo (21:9)','Tall (9:16)'=>'Dheer (9:16)','Custom'=>'Caado ah','Width / height'=>'Ballaca / dhererka','Background image'=>'Sawirka asalka','Inherited image — replace'=>'Sawirka la dhaxlay — beddel','Cover'=>'Dabool','Contain'=>'Ka koobnow','Original size'=>'Baaxadda asalka ah','Repeat'=>'Ku celi','No repeat'=>'Ha soo celin','Tile'=>'Taayil','Tile across'=>'Ku xiriiri dhinaca','Tile down'=>'Hoos u kala habee','Fixed while scrolling'=>'Go\'an inta la duubayo','Solid'=>'Adag','Dashed'=>'Xariiq-goosgoos ah','Dotted'=>'Dhibco leh','Double'=>'Laba-laab','Each side separately'=>'Dhinac kasta si gooni ah','Side'=>'Dhinac','Add a shadow'=>'Ku dar hadh','Horizontal'=>'Jiif','Vertical'=>'Toosan','Blur'=>'Mugdiyeen','Spread'=>'Faafi','Inside'=>'Gudaha','Remove this shadow'=>'Ka saar hooskan','Opacity'=>'Mugdigi','Transform'=>'Beddel','Shadow'=>'Har','Ease'=>'Fudayd','Linear'=>'Toosan','Ease in'=>'Si tartiib ah u bilow','Ease out'=>'Si tartiib ah u bax','Ease in and out'=>'Si tartiib ah u geli una saar','Duration (milliseconds)'=>'Muddada (mili-ilbiriqsiyo)','What animates'=>'Waxa dhaqaajiya','Easing'=>'Qafiifin','Delay (milliseconds)'=>'Dib-u-dhac (millisekan)','Remove the preset'=>'Ka saar hordhaca habaysan','More options'=>'Xulashooyin dheeraad ah','Number and unit'=>'Tirada iyo halbeegga','Custom CSS value (calc, clamp…)'=>'Qiimaha CSS-ka gaarka ah (calc, clamp…)','Set each side separately'=>'Dhinac kasta si gaar ah u geli','Set all sides together'=>'Isku wada hagaaji dhammaan dhinacyada','All sides'=>'Dhinacyada oo dhan','Top start'=>'Bilowga sare','Top end'=>'Dhamaadka sare','Bottom start'=>'Bilowga hoose','Bottom end'=>'Dhamaadka hoose','Between rows'=>'U dhexeeya safafka','Between columns'=>'Tiirarka dhexdooda','Choose a preset'=>'Dooro hab hore loo qoondeeyay','Presets'=>'Horey-u-dejinno','Preset: %s'=>'Horey loo habeeyay: %s','Spacing'=>'Balaadhinta bannaan','Typography'=>'Farshaxanka qoraalka','Colours & background'=>'Midabbada & asalka','Border'=>'Xuduud','Effects'=>'Saamaynta','Motion'=>'Dhaqdhaqaaq','Advanced'=>'Heer sare','up to %d px'=>'ilaa %d px','from %d px'=>'ka timid %d px','all widths'=>'Dhammaan ballacyada','Screen size'=>'Baaxadda shaashadda','Hover'=>'Dul-istaag','Reset every value set for %s'=>'Dib u deji qiime kasta oo loo dejiyay %s','Inherited from %s'=>'Laga dhaxlay %s','Reset %s'=>'Dib u deji %s','Hide on'=>'Ku qari','%1$s (%2$d set)'=>'%1$s (%2$d la dejiyay)','Replace icon'=>'Beddel astaanta','No icons match.'=>'Ma jiraan wax calaamado ah oo u dhigma.','Regular'=>'Caadi','Brands'=>'Astaamaha Ganacsiga','Sharp'=>'Af badan','Bold'=>'Culus','Fill'=>'Buuxi','Duotone'=>'Laba-midab','This icon set could not be loaded. Check your connection and try again.'=>'Xidhmadaan astaanta ah lama soo shubi karin. Hubi xiriirkaaga oo mar kale isku day.','Search icons'=>'Raadi astaamaha','Search all sets'=>'Raadi dhammaan qaybaha','%d icons'=>'%d calaamadood','Loading icon sets…'=>'Xirmooyinka astaamaha ayaa la soo dejinayaa…','%s icons'=>'Astaamaha %s','All sets'=>'Dhammaan ururinta','This file is not a valid SVG image.'=>'Faylkani ma aha sawir SVG oo sax ah.','The icon could not be uploaded.'=>'Astaanta lama soo galin karo.','Upload SVG'=>'Soo geli SVG','Delete selected upload'=>'Tirtir waxa la doortay ee la soo galiyay','Scripts, links and external references are removed from uploaded SVG files before they are saved.'=>'Far-qoraallada, xiriiriyeyaasha iyo tixraacyada dibadda ayaa laga saaraa faylasha SVG ee la soo geliyay ka hor inta aan la keydin.','My uploads'=>'Faylashayda la soo