ee','Lighten'=>'Fududee','Colour dodge'=>'Iftiiminta midabka','Colour burn'=>'Gubid midab','Hard light'=>'Iftiin adag','Soft light'=>'Iftiin jilicsan','Difference'=>'Farqi','Exclusion'=>'Ka-saaris','Hue'=>'Midab','Saturation'=>'Buuxnaansho','Luminosity'=>'Iftiimin','Blend mode'=>'Habka isku-dhafka','Blur (px)'=>'Mugdiga (px)','Brightness (%)'=>'Iftiinka (%)','Contrast (%)'=>'Kala duwanaansho (%)','Greyscale (%)'=>'Madow iyo caddaan (%)','Hue rotation (degrees)'=>'Wareejinta midabka (digrii)','Saturation (%)'=>'Dheregsanaanta (%)','Sepia (%)'=>'Sepia (%)','Drop shadow'=>'Hooska dhaca','Across (px)'=>'Ballaac (px)','Down (px)'=>'Hoos (px)','Softness (px)'=>'Jilicsanaan (px)','Shadow colour'=>'Midabka hooska','Remove drop shadow'=>'Ka saar hooska','Applies on every screen size.'=>'Waxay khuseysaa cabbir kasta oo shaashad ah.','Applies to the screen size chosen in the design panel.'=>'Waxay khusaysaa xajmiga shaashadda ee lagu doortay qaybta naqshadaynta.','Background gradient'=>'Isku-dhaafka midabka gadaasha','Add gradient'=>'Ku dar heerkul midab','Glass'=>'Muraayad','Mask'=>'Qari','Filters'=>'Kala-shaandheeyayaasha','Wave'=>'Mowjad','Waves'=>'Mowjadaha','Curve'=>'Qalooc','Curve (asymmetric)'=>'Qalooc (aan simanayn)','Arc'=>'Qaanso','Tilt'=>'Janjeeri','Tilt (layered)'=>'Qallooc (lakabyaysan)','Triangle (asymmetric)'=>'Saddex-xagal (aan simanayn)','Split'=>'Qaybi','Zigzag'=>'Marooroc','Mountains'=>'Buuro','Clouds'=>'Daruuro','Drops'=>'Tuurista','Pyramids'=>'Ahraamyo','Book'=>'Qabso','Stairs'=>'Jaranjaro','Fan'=>'Marawaxad','Height (px)'=>'Dhererka (px)','Mirror'=>'Muraayad','Invert'=>'Gaddifi','In front of the content'=>'Qoraalka horkiisa','Video file (MP4 / WebM)'=>'Faylka fiidiyowga (MP4 / WebM)','Choose MP4 or WebM video'=>'Dooro muuqaalka MP4 ama WebM','MP4 address'=>'Cinwaanka MP4','WebM address'=>'Cinwaanka WebM','YouTube video ID (11 characters)'=>'Aqoonsiga fiidyowga YouTube (11 xaraf)','Vimeo video number'=>'Lambarka fiidyowga Vimeo','Visitors only contact the video service when they scroll to this section, and never when their device asks for reduced motion. Until then they see the poster image.'=>'Booqdayaashu waxay la xiriiraan adeegga fiidiyowga oo keliya marka ay u dhaadhacaan qaybtan, waligoodna marka qalabkoodu codsado dhaqdhaqaaq yar. Ilaa inta ka horreysa waxay arkaan sawirka boodhka.','Replace poster image'=>'Beddel sawirka boostarka','Choose poster image'=>'Dooro sawirka boodhka','Background slideshow'=>'Muuqaalka gadaal ka wareegaya','Change images'=>'Beddel sawirrada','Choose at least two images.'=>'Dooro ugu yaraan laba sawir.','Seconds per image'=>'Ilbiriqsiyo sawirkiiba','Slow zoom (Ken Burns)'=>'Soo dhaweyn gaabis ah (Ken Burns)','Remove slideshow'=>'Ka saar bandhigga sawirrada','Visitors who ask their device for reduced motion see the first image only.'=>'Booqdayaasha qalabkoodu codsado dhaqdhaqaaq yar waxay arkaan sawirka koowaad oo keliya.','Section effects'=>'Saamaynta qaybta','Top divider'=>'Kala-qaybiye sare','Bottom divider'=>'Kala-qaybiye hoose','Choose the logo'=>'Dooro astaanta','Not set'=>'Lama dejin','Check the brand colours: each needs a unique name and a valid colour.'=>'Hubi midabbada astaanta: mid kasta wuxuu u baahan yahay magac gaar ah iyo midab sax ah.','Brand name'=>'Magaca summad','A logo is chosen.'=>'Astaanta waa la doortay.','Choose the logo from the Site design page.'=>'Ka dooro calaamadda bogga Naqshadda bogga.','Brand colours'=>'Midabada sumadda','Brand %d'=>'Summad %d','Add brand colour'=>'Ku dar midabka summadda','Heading font'=>'Farriinta ciwaanka','Body font'=>'Farriinta qaybta ugu weyn','Tone of voice'=>'Codka hadalka','How your brand writes, e.g. “Friendly and plain, short sentences, no jargon.” The AI follows it whenever it writes for this site.'=>'Sida sumaddaadu wax u qorto, tusaale ahaan “Saaxiibtinnimo iyo fudayd, jumlado gaagaaban, ereyo adag la’aan.” AI-du waxay raacaysaa mar kasta oo ay wax u qorayso goobtan.','Brand kit saved.'=>'Xirmada sumadda waa la keydiyay.','The brand is applied: its colours, fonts and logo are now the site’s.'=>'Astaanta waa la adeegsaday: midabbadeeda, farta iyo calaamadeeda hadda waxay noqdeen kuwa goobta.','Apply to site'=>'Ku dabakh barta','All classes'=>'Dhammaan fasallada','Class name on the page'=>'Magaca fasalka ee bogga','Printed as %s.'=>'Waxaa loo daabacay sida %s.','Start with a letter; lowercase letters, digits and hyphens only.'=>'Ku billow xaraf; kaliya xarfaha yaryar, tirooyinka iyo xariiqyada dhexda.','The style controls are not loaded. Reload the page; if this stays, reinstall the plugin.'=>'Koontaroolada qaabka lama soo shubin. Dib u soo deji bogga; haddii ay tani sii socoto, dib u rakib fur-kordhiyaha.','Class saved. Every element using it has the new style.'=>'Fasalka waa la keydiyay. Cunsur kasta oo isticmaalaya waxa uu leeyahay qaabka cusub.','Save class'=>'Kaydi fasalka','Class created.'=>'Fasalka waa la sameeyay.','New class'=>'Fasalka cusub','e.g. Card'=>'t.e. Kaadh','Create'=>'Abuur','Search classes'=>'Raadi fasallada','No class matches.'=>'Ma jiro nooc u dhigma.','No classes yet. Create one, style it, then add it to any element from its settings.'=>'Weli ma jiraan fasallo. Samee mid, qaabee, ka dibna kaga dar curiye kasta goobaha laga hagaajiyo.','Edit %s'=>'Wax ka beddel %s','Class duplicated.'=>'Fasalka waa la labanlaabay.','Delete %s'=>'Tirtir %s','Class deleted.'=>'Fasalka waa la tirtiray.','Delete the class "%s"? Elements that use it keep their content and lose its styles.'=>'Ma tirtirtaa fasalka "%s"? Curiyeyaasha isticmaala waxay xajisanayaan nuxurkooda waxayna luminayaan qaababkiisa.','Only users who may add unfiltered HTML can change custom CSS.'=>'Kaliya isticmaaleyaasha ku dari kara HTML-ka aan la shaandhayn ayaa beddeli kara CSS-ka gaarka ah.','Some of this CSS will not be used: @import, expression(), javascript: URLs, "<" and unbalanced braces are removed for safety.'=>'Qaar ka mid ah CSS-kan lama isticmaali doono: @import, expression(), javascript: URLs, "<" iyo xirmooyinka aan isu dheellitirnayn ayaa loo saaray nabadgelyo darteed.','Upload a font'=>'Soo geli farta','Uploading fonts needs WordPress 6.5 or later.'=>'Soo gelinta farta waxay u baahan tahay WordPress 6.5 ama ka dambeeya.','Font name'=>'Magaca farta','e.g. Brand Sans'=>'t.h. Brand Sans','%s is uploaded and ready to use.'=>'%s waa la soo geliyay waana diyaar in la isticmaalo.','Choose a font file (%s)'=>'Dooro faylka farta (%s)','Font library'=>'Maktabadda farta','%d files'=>'%d faylal','Font switched off for the site.'=>'Far-qoraalka waa laga damiyay bogga.','Font switched on for the site.'=>'Farta bogga waa la shiday.','Switch off'=>'Dami','Switch on'=>'Shid','Adobe Fonts'=>'Adobe Fonts','Paste the kit id of your Adobe Fonts web project. Its fonts are then loaded from Adobe on your pages.'=>'Ku dheji kit id ee mashruucaaga shabakadda Adobe Fonts. Farteeda ayaa markaas Adobe lagaga soo shubi doonaa bogaggaaga.','Your web projects'=>'Mashruucyadaada shabakadda','Adobe Fonts connected.'=>'Adobe Fonts waa la xiriiriyay.','Adobe Fonts disconnected.'=>'Xiriirka Adobe Fonts waa la jaray.','Kit id'=>'Aqoonsiga xirmada','The dark value for "%s" is not a valid colour.'=>'Qiimaha madow ee "%s" ma aha midab sax ah.','When a visitor has not chosen'=>'Marka booqdaha uusan dooran','Follow the visitor’s device'=>'Raac aaladda booqdaha','Dark colours'=>'Midabbo madow','Give each colour its dark version. Colours left empty stay the same in both schemes. Dark mode is on as soon as one colour has a dark value.'=>'Midab kasta sii noociisa mugdiga ah. Midabbada bannaan looga tago waxay ahaanayaan sidooda labada qaabaynba. Habka mugdiga ahi wuxuu shaqaynayaa isla marka hal midab uu yeesho qiime mugdi ah.','Dark version of %s'=>'Nooca mugdiga ah ee %s','Dark mode saved.'=>'Habka mugdiga ah waa la keydiyay.','Page CSS'=>'CSS-ka Bogga','Global classes'=>'Fasallada guud','Classes'=>'Fasallada','Create classes in Site design, then add them here.'=>'Ku samee fasallo Qaabeynta goobta, ka dibna halkan ku dar.','Custom CSS'=>'CSS Gaar ah','Write rules for this element. "selector" means this element, e.g. selector:hover { opacity: .8 } — plain declarations apply to the element itself.'=>'U qor xeerar qaybtaan. "selector" waxay ka dhigan tahay qaybtaan, tusaale selector:hover { opacity: .8 } — bayaannada caadiga ah waxay si toos ah u khuseeyaan qaybta lafteeda.','Font files must be %s.'=>'Faylasha farta waa inay noqdaan %s.','That font file is empty or larger than 10 MB.'=>'Faylkaas farta waxba kuma jiraan ama wuxuu ka weyn yahay 10 MB.','Style once, reuse everywhere, change in one place.'=>'Hal mar qaabee, meel kasta dib ugu isticmaal, hal meelna ka beddel.','Variables'=>'Doorsoomayaasha','Named values any element can use.'=>'Qiimayaal magac leh oo cunsur kastaa isticmaali karo.','Spacing, radius and shadows'=>'Bannaan bixinta, gacan-wareegga iyo hadhyada','The scales every spacing, corner and shadow picker offers.'=>'Miisaannada uu xulaha bannaan kasta, gees kasta iyo hadh kastaa bixiyo.','A dark version of your colours, for visitors who want it.'=>'Nooc mugdi ah oo midabbadaada ah, oo loogu talagalay booqdayaasha raba.','Logo, colours, fonts and tone of voice, used by the AI and templates.'=>'Astaanta, midabbada, farta iyo habka hadalka, ee ay adeegsadaan AI-da iyo qaababka.','Upload your own fonts or connect Adobe Fonts.'=>'Soo geli fartaada gaarka ah ama ku xir Adobe Fonts.','CSS for this page only.'=>'CSS boggan kaliya ah.','CSS for this page'=>'CSS-ka boggan','Loaded only on this page, after the site’s styles. Saved with the page.'=>'Waxa kaliya lagu soo shubaa boggan, ka dib qaababka goobta. Waxaa lagu keydiyay bogga.','Short name'=>'Magac gaaban','The short name "%s" is used twice.'=>'Magaca gaaban ee "%s" waxa la isticmaalay laba jeer.','"%s": short names use lowercase letters, digits and hyphens.'=>'"%s": magacyada gaagaaban waxay isticmaalaan xarfo yaryar, tirooyin iyo xarriijimo.','The value of "%s" is not one this setting accepts.'=>'Qiimaha "%s" ma aha mid habayntani aqbasho.','Radius'=>'Gacan','Add a step'=>'Ku dar tallaabo','Scales saved.'=>'Miisaannada waa la keydiyay.','Scales are back to the defaults.'=>'Cabirrada waxay ku noqdeen kuwii caadiga ahaa.','Reset to the default scales'=>'Dib ugu celi miymiisyada caadiga ah','No variables yet. A variable holds one value — a width, a colour mix, a font size — that many elements share.'=>'Weli ma jiraan doorsoomayaal. Doorsoomuhu wuxuu hayaa hal qiimo — ballac, isku-darka midabka, cabbirka farta — oo ay qaybo badani wadaagaan.','Add variable'=>'Ku dar doorsoome','Variables saved.'=>'Doorsoomayaasha waa la keydiyay.','Entrance animation'=>'Dhaqdhaqaaqa soo gelidda','Fade in'=>'Si tartiib ah u soo bax','Fade in, rising'=>'Si tartiib ah u soo baxaya, kor u kacaya','Fade in, dropping'=>'Si tartiib ah u soo baxaya, hoos u dhacaya','Fade in from the start side'=>'Kaga soo muuqo dhinaca bilowga','Fade in from the end side'=>'Si tartiib ah uga soo muuqo dhinaca dambe','Zoom out'=>'Yaree fogeynta','Flip up'=>'Kor u rog','Animation length (ms)'=>'Dhererka dhaqdhaqaaqa (ms)','Animation delay (ms)'=>'Dib-u-dhaca dhaqdhaqaaqa (ms)','While scrolling'=>'Marka la rogrogo','Fade in as it scrolls into view'=>'Si tartiib ah u soo muuqo markii loo rogo muuqaalka','Rise as it scrolls into view'=>'Kor u kac marka ay shaashadda ku soo dhex rogto','Grow as it scrolls into view'=>'Waynee marka ay muuqalka usoo rogato','Straighten as it scrolls into view'=>'Toosi marka ay shaashadda soo gasho','On hover'=>'Marka la dul geeyo','Lift'=>'Qaad','Glow'=>'Iftiimin','Stay in view (px from the top)'=>'Ku jir muuqaalka (px xagga sare ah)','Parallax speed (-10 to 10)'=>'Xawaaraha baralags (-10 ilaa 10)','Follow the pointer (strength)'=>'Raac tilmaamaha (awoodda)','Place ID'=>'Aqoonsiga Goobta','Find it with Google’s Place ID finder: search for your business and copy the ID.'=>'Ku hel adigoo isticmaalaya qalabka raadinta Place ID ee Google: raadi meheraddaada oo koobiyeey ID-ga.','An API key from your Google Cloud project with the Places API (New) enabled. Restrict it to that API.'=>'Furaha API oo ka socota mashruucaaga Google Cloud oo shaqada loo geliyay Places API (New). Ku xaddid API-gaas oo keliya.','Business unit ID'=>'Aqoonsiga qaybta ganacsiga','The 24-character ID of your business on Trustpilot, from your Trustpilot Business account (Integrations › API).'=>'Aqoonsiga 24-ka xaraf ah ee ganacsigaaga ee Trustpilot, oo laga helayo koontadaada Trustpilot Business (Is-dhexgalka › API).','The API key of your Trustpilot Business account.'=>'Furaha API ee koontadaada Trustpilot Business.','Not set up.'=>'Lama habeynin.','The saved key can no longer be read (the site’s security keys changed). Enter it again.'=>'Furaha la keydiyay dib dambe looma akhrin karo (furayaasha amniga ee goobta ayaa isbeddelay). Mar kale geli.','Needs both an ID and an API key.'=>'Waxay u baahan tahay labadaba aqoonsi (ID) iyo fure API ah.','Set up. Google reviews are loaded live each time a page with a Reviews block is viewed: one Place Details request on your own key per view, never stored (Google’s terms do not allow keeping them).'=>'Deji. Faallooyinka Google si toos ah ayaa loo soo geliyaa mar kasta oo la fiiriyo bog wata baloogga Faallooyinka: hal codsi oo Place Details ah oo ku saabsan furahaaga gaarka ah halkii daawasho kasta, waligoodna lama kaydiyo (shuruudaha Google ma oggola in la haysto).','The first refresh failed: %s'=>'Dib-u-cusboonaysiintii koowaad way fashilantay: %s','Waiting for the first refresh (within a minute or two).'=>'Waxaa la sugayaa dib-u-cusboonaysiinta koowaad (daqiiqad ama labo gudahood).','Refreshed %1$s: %2$d reviews kept, rated %3$s from %4$d.'=>'Waa la cusbooneysiiyay %1$s: %2$d dib u eegis ayaa la keydiyay, waxaa laga qiimeeyay %3$s marka loo eego %4$d.','The last try, %1$s, failed and the reviews above were kept: %2$s'=>'Isku-daygii ugu dambeeyay, %1$s, wuu fashilmay dib-u-eegisyada sare ayaana la xafiday: %2$s','Saved. Trustpilot reviews are fetched in the background within a minute or two; Google reviews load live on the page.'=>'Waa la kaydiyay. Faallooyinka Trustpilot waxaa gadaal laga soo qaadaa muddo daqiiqad ama labo gudahood ah; faallooyinka Google si toos ah ayay bogga ugu soo baxaan.','Trustpilot reviews are fetched once a day in the background and kept on your site, so a busy page costs nothing extra on your Trustpilot account; if a refresh fails, the last reviews stay. Google does not allow its reviews to be stored, so they are loaded live when a visitor views the page: each view is one request on your own Google key, billed by Google.'=>'Faallooyinka Trustpilot waxa la soo qaadaa hal mar maalintii iyaga oo gadaal ka socda waxaana lagu hayaa bartaada, sidaas darteed bog mashquul ahi wax lacag dheeraad ah kuguma kiciyo koontadaada Trustpilot; haddii dib-u-cusboonaysiintu guul-darraysato, faallooyinkii ugu dambeeyay ayaa baaqi ku ahaanaya. Google ma oggola in faallooyinkeeda la kaydiyo, sidaas darteed waxa si toos ah loo soo geliyaa marka booqdahu eego bogga: daawasho kastaa waa hal codsi oo ku saabsan furahaaga Google, kaas oo ay Google lacag ka qaadato.','Where to find it'=>'Halka laga helo','Saved (…%s). Type a new one to replace it.'=>'Waa la keydiyay (…%s). Mid cusub ku qor si aad ugu beddesho.','Remove the %s details and its reviews'=>'Ka saar faahfaahinta %s iyo faallooyinkiisa','Refreshed.'=>'Waa la cusbooneysiiyay.','Refresh now'=>'Dib u cusboonaysii hadda','Next daily refresh: %s.'=>'Dib-u-cusbooneysiinta xigta ee maalinlaha ah: %s.','Your Google and Trustpilot details, for the Reviews block.'=>'Faahfaahintaada Google iyo Trustpilot, ee qaybta Reviews.','No colours yet.'=>'Weli midabbo ma jiraan.','Colour %d'=>'Midabka %d','Add colour'=>'Ku dar midab','Two colours have the same name. Rename one.'=>'Laba midab ayaa isku magac ah. Mid magaca ka beddel.','"%s" is not a valid colour.'=>'"%s" ma aha midab sax ah.','Theme colours'=>'Midabada dulucda','Your theme’s palette. A change here is saved as your site’s version of the colour, the same way the Site Editor saves it, and applies everywhere the colour is used.'=>'Xulashada midabada ee mawduucaaga. Isbeddelka halkan lagu sameeyo waxaa loo kaydiyaa sida nooca midabka ee boggaaga, si la mid ah sida uu u kaydiyo Tafatiraha Bogga, waxaana lagu dabaqaa meel kasta oo midabka loo isticmaalo.','Theme colours are back to the theme’s own values.'=>'Midabada dulucda waxay dib ugu noqdeen qiyamkii dulucda u gaarka ahaa.','Reset theme colours'=>'Dib u deji midabada dulucda','Your colours'=>'Midabbadaada','Colours saved.'=>'Midabbada waa la keydiyay.','Pick a colour for %s'=>'U door midab %s','Clear'=>'Nadiifi','The change could not be saved.'=>'Beddelka lama keydin karin.','Theme default'=>'Ugu talogalka mauduca','Theme fonts'=>'Xarfaha mawduuca','Your fonts'=>'Farriimahaaga qoraalka','Font stack'=>'Xayndaabka farta','Uploaded font: its files come from the font library.'=>'Farta la soo geliyay: faylasheeda waxay ka yimaadeen maktabadda farta.','System sans-serif'=>'Sans-serif nidaamka','Add font stack'=>'Ku dar xirmo farta ah','Fonts saved.'=>'Farriimaha waa la keydiyay.','Shared with your theme and the Site Editor.'=>'Lala wadaagay mawduucaaga iyo Tifatiraha Bogga.','Fonts'=>'Farfacyo','Heading and body fonts for the whole site.'=>'Farriimaha cinwaanka iyo qoraalka guud ee bogga oo dhan.','Back to Site design'=>'Ku noqo Qaabeynta goobta','Classes, tokens, dark mode, brand kit and custom fonts come with Pro'=>'Fasallada, calaamadaha, habka mugdiga, xirmada astaanta iyo farta gaarka ah waxay la socdaan Pro','Open the Site Editor’s styles'=>'Fur qaababka Tifaftiraha Goobta','A heading with a tighter line height, styled with the Style tab.'=>'Cinwaan leh dherer xariiqeed ka cufan, kaas oo lagu habeeyay tabka Qaabka (Style).','A paragraph of text, styled with the Style tab.'=>'Baaragaraf qoraal ah, oo lagu qaabeeyay tab-ka Qaabka.','An image with rounded corners, styled with the Style tab.'=>'Sawir leh geeso wareegsan, oo lagu qaabeeyey tabka Qaabka.','A video from the Media Library, styled with the Style tab.'=>'Muuqaal laga keenay Maktabadda Warbaahinta, oo lagu qaabeeyay tabka Qaabka.','Spacer'=>'Kala-fogeeye','Empty space between blocks; set a different height per screen size in the Style tab.'=>'Meesha banaan ee u dhaxaysa baloogyada; ku deji dherer kala duwan cabbirka shaashad kasta gudaha tabka Qaabka.','Divider'=>'Kala-qaybiye','A horizontal line between sections, styled with the Style tab.'=>'Xariiq jiif ah oo u dhexaysa qaybaha, oo lagu habeeyay tab-ka Qaabka.','Content from another site (a video, a post, a map) by pasting its address.'=>'Xog ka socota degel kale (fiidiyow, qoraal, maab) adigoo dhejinaya ciwaankiisa.','Several images in a grid, styled with the Style tab.'=>'Dhowr sawir oo ku jira shabag, laguna habeeyay tabka Qaabka.','Plain'=>'Caadi','No languages to switch between. The switcher appears when a translation plugin lists two or more languages.'=>'Ma jiraan luuqado la kala beddelo. Beddelaha wuxuu soo baxayaa marka qalabka tarjumaadda uu qoro labo luuqadood ama wax ka badan.','Switcher'=>'Badelaha','Show the current language'=>'Muuji luuqadda hadda','Install Tranzly and list two or more languages, and the switcher appears here.'=>'Ku shub Tranzly oo qor labo luqadood ama wax ka badan, waxaana halkan ka soo muuqan doona badelaha luqadda.','Pills'=>'Kaniiniyo','Dropdown'=>'Liiska hoos-u-dhaca','Language codes'=>'Koodhadhka luqadda','Show each language as'=>'U muuji luqad kasta sida','Language name'=>'Magaca luuqadda','Language code'=>'Koodhka luuqadda','Name and code'=>'Magaca iyo koodhka','Flags'=>'Calaamooyinka','Off by default: a flag is a country, not a language.'=>'Sida caadiga ah waa dansan yahay: calanku waa dal, ma aha luqad.','Include the current language'=>'Ku dar luqadda hadda jirta','Hide languages this page is not translated into'=>'Qari luuqadaha aan boggan loo turjumin','Stack vertically'=>'Isku kor dhis si toos ah','Current language text'=>'Qoraalka luuqadda hadda','Current language background'=>'Asalka luuqadda hadda','Size and spacing'=>'Baaxadda iyo kala-fogaanshaha','Space between languages'=>'Bannaan u dhexeeya luuqadaha','Text size'=>'Baaxadda qoraalka','Connected (key %s).'=>'Ku xiran (fure %s).','API URL'=>'URL-ka API','Replace the API key'=>'Beddel furaha API','Where to find your %s API key'=>'Halka laga helo furahaaga API ee %s','Check and save'=>'Hubi oo kaydi','Connect a mailing-list service once; then any form can add the people who fill it in to one of your lists (the form block\'s settings → After sending). Keys are checked with the service, stored encrypted on this site and never shown again.'=>'Ku xidh adeegga liiska boostada hal mar; kaddib foom kasta wuxuu ku dari karaa dadka buuxiya mid ka mid ah liisaskaaga (habaynta baloogga foomka → Dirista kaddib). Furayaasha waxaa laga hubiyaa adeegga, waxaana lagu kaydiyaa iyagoo sir ah goobtan oo dib dambe looma tusi doono.','Send form submissions and button clicks to your analytics with no code. Leave an ID empty to skip that service. Buttons get a "Conversion event" field in their Advanced panel. With the cookie banner on, nothing loads until the visitor agrees.'=>'U dir gudbinta foomamka iyo gujinta badhamada xog-ururintaada adigoon kood adeegsanayn. Meel madhan kaga tag aqoonsiga (ID) si aad uga gudubto adeeggaas. Badhamadu waxay qaybtooda Advanced ku helayaan goob loogu talagalay "Conversion event". Marka uu calanka kookiyada (cookie banner) shidan yahay, waxba ma soo rari doonaan ilaa booqdahu ogolaado.','Google Analytics 4 measurement ID'=>'Aqoonsiga cabbiraadda Google Analytics 4','Google Tag Manager container ID'=>'Aqoonsiga (ID) weelka Google Tag Manager','Meta Pixel ID (the number shown in Meta Events Manager)'=>'Meta Pixel ID (lambarka lagu muujiyey Meta Events Manager)','Load these tags on my site'=>'Ku shub sumadahan boggayga','Switch off if your theme or another plugin already adds them; events are still sent.'=>'Dami haddii mawduucaaga ama furin kale uu horey ugu daray; dhacdooyinka weli waa la dirayaa.','Event name for form submissions'=>'Magaca dhacdada ee soo gudbinta foomka','The banner is a popup you design with blocks. Its buttons link to #consent-accept, #consent-reject and #consent-save (with tick boxes named analytics and marketing for "save"); a link to #consent-open anywhere shows it again. Until a visitor accepts, tracking tags do not load, Google Consent Mode stays "denied", and the scripts you list stay switched off.'=>'Bannertu waa popup aad ku naqshadayso baloocyo. Badhamadeedu waxay ku xirmaan #consent-accept, #consent-reject iyo #consent-save (oo leh sanduuqyo calaamadeyn ah oo loogu magac daray analytics iyo marketing oo loogu talagalay "save"); xiriiriye kasta oo ku socda #consent-open ayaa mar kale muujinaya. Ilaa booqdahu aqbalo, summada dabagalka lama soo shubo, Google Consent Mode wuxuu ahaanayaa "denied", qoraallada aad liis garaysayna waxay ahaanayaan kuwo dansan.','Create a ready-made banner'=>'Abuur boodh diyaarsan','Show a cookie banner'=>'Muuji boorarka kookiga','Banner'=>'Bannar','Choose a popup…'=>'Dooro daaqad boodaysa…','%s (draft)'=>'%s (qabyo)','Edit the banner'=>'Wax ka beddel boodhka','Remember the choice for (days)'=>'Xusuusnow doorashada (maalmood)','Outside the European Union, the EEA and the UK: load tracking until the visitor says no'=>'Bannaanka Midowga Yurub, EEA iyo Boqortooyada Midowday: soo rar dabagalka ilaa inta booqdaha uu ka diidayo','Off: every visitor must agree first (the strictest rule, and the default). On: only when your host or CDN reports the visitor\'s country (for example Cloudflare\'s CF-IPCountry header) and it is outside the EU, EEA, UK and Switzerland. The banner is still shown, and an unknown country is treated as inside the EU.'=>'Dami: booqde kasta waa inuu marka hore oggolaadaa (sharciga ugu adag, waana kan caadiga ah). Shid: kaliya marka martigeliyahaaga ama CDN-kaagu soo sheego dalka booqdaha (tusaale ahaan madaxa CF-IPCountry ee Cloudflare) uuna ka baxsan yahay EU, EEA, UK iyo Switzerland. Boobaha weli waa la muujinayaa, waxaana dalka aan la garanayn loola dhaqmayaa sidii mid ku dhex yaal EU.','Other scripts to hold until consent (handle:analytics or handle:marketing, comma separated)'=>'Far-qoraallada kale ee la haynayo ilaa oggolaansho laga helo (handle:analytics ama handle:marketing, faaqiddo lagu kala saaray)','Popups, slide-ins and bars'=>'Daaqadaha soo booda, kuwa soo silca iyo baararka','A/B test results'=>'Natiijooyinka tijaabada A/B','Guides: forms, popups, motion, tracking, A/B tests and the cookie banner'=>'Hagayaal: foomamka, daaqadaha soo booda, dhaqaaqa, raadraaca, imtixaannada A/B iyo bannalka buskudka','Mailing-list connections'=>'Xiriirrada liiska boostada','Popup settings'=>'Hagaajinta daaqadda boodda','Popup (in the middle, page dimmed)'=>'Daaqad soo boodda (dhexda, boggu wuu madoobaaday)','Slide-in (in a corner)'=>'Soo silqasho (gees)','Bar (top or bottom)'=>'Baar (sare ama hoose)','Bottom, end side'=>'Qeybta hoose, dhinaca dambe','Bottom, start side'=>'Qeybta hoose, dhinaca bilowga','When the page loads'=>'Marka boggu soo kaco','After a delay'=>'Dib u dhac ka dib','After scrolling part of the page'=>'Ka dib marka la rogo qayb ka mid ah bogga','When the visitor is about to leave'=>'Marka booqdaha uu qarka u saaran yahay inuu ka tago','When something is clicked'=>'Marka wax la gujiyo','Percent of the page'=>'Boqolkiiba bogga','CSS selector of the element'=>'Xulaha CSS ee curiyaha','How often'=>'Intee jeer','Every page view'=>'Muuqaal kasta oo bog ah','Once per visit'=>'Hal mar booqasho kasta','Once every few days'=>'Dhowrkii maalmoodba hal mar','Until the visitor converts'=>'Ilaa booqdaha ka beddelo','Every page'=>'Bog kasta','The front page'=>'Bogga hore','Chosen pages (IDs)'=>'Bogagga la doortay (Aqoonsiyada)','Chosen content types'=>'Noocyada nuxurka ee la doortay','Page IDs, comma separated'=>'Aqoonsiyada Bogga, hakad lagu kala saaray','Content types, comma separated (post, page, product)'=>'Noocyada nuxurka, oo kooma lagu kala saaray (post, page, product)','Devices'=>'Aaladaha','Desktop only'=>'Kumbuyuutar keliya','Mobile only'=>'Mobilka keliya','Close when the dimmed page is clicked'=>'Xir marka la gujiyo bogga la madoobeeyay','Link a button to #popup-close to close the popup, or to #popup-convert to count a conversion.'=>'Ku xidh badhan #popup-close si aad u xidho daaqadda boodda, ama #popup-convert si aad u tiriso beddelka.','Conversion event'=>'Dhacdada beddelka','Sent to your analytics when this is clicked (for example sign_up). Set up the services under Page Builder Sandwich → Marketing.'=>'Waxaa loo diraa falanqayntaada marka tan la gujiyo (tusaale ahaan sign_up). Adeegyada kaga habee Page Builder Sandwich → Suuqgeynta.','AI agents are allowed. Reload this page to see the tools.'=>'Wakiillada AI waa la oggol yahay. Dib u soo geli boggan si aad u aragto aaladaha.','AI agents are turned off. Their connection address no longer answers.'=>'Wakiillada AI waa la damiyay. Cinwaankooda xiriirka mar dambe kama jawaabayo.','%s is also editing this page. Saving may overwrite their changes.'=>'%s ayaa sidoo kale wax ka beddelaya boggan. Keydintu waxay tirtiri kartaa isbeddelladooda.','Block library'=>'Maktabadda baloogyada','Layers'=>'Lakabyo','Page canvas'=>'Shiraaca bogga','Revisions'=>'Dib-u-eegisyada','Block settings'=>'Hagaajinta baloogga','Add block: %s'=>'Ku dar baloog: %s','Open in Studio: %s'=>'Ku fur Studio: %s','Undo'=>'Ka noqo','Redo'=>'Ku celi','Show or hide layers'=>'Muuji ama qari lakabyada','Show or hide the block library'=>'Muuji ama qari maktabadda baloogga','Show revisions'=>'Muuji dib-u-eegista','Open the normal editor'=>'Fur tifaftiraha caadiga ah','Keyboard shortcuts'=>'Toobiyeyaasha kiiboodhka','Preview: desktop'=>'Horu-arag: kombuyuutar','Preview: tablet'=>'Horu-arag: kaniini','Preview: mobile'=>'Horu-eegis: moobil','Copy style of the selected block'=>'Koobiye qaabka baloogga la doortay','Paste style onto the selected block'=>'Ku dheji qaabka baloogga la doortay','Copy the selected section'=>'Koobi qaybta la doortay','Paste a copied section'=>'Dheji qayb la soo guuriyay','Turn off safe mode'=>'Dami qaabka ammaan','Turn on safe mode (other plugins off, for you, in Studio only)'=>'Daar habka ammaan ah (furayaasha kale way dansan yihiin, adiga dartaa, kaliya Studio)','Scheduled'=>'Jadwalksan','Pending review'=>'Sugaya dib-u-eegis','Private'=>'Gaar ah','Draft'=>'Qabyo','All changes saved'=>'Dhammaan isbeddelada waa la keydiyay','Saving…'=>'Kaydinayaa…','Autosaving…'=>'Si toos ah u keydinaya…','Unsaved changes'=>'Isbeddellada aan la keydin','autosaved'=>'si toos ah loo keydiyey','Desktop preview'=>'Horu-eegidda kombiyuutarka','Tablet preview'=>'Horu-aragga kaniiniga','Mobile preview'=>'Muuqaalka moobiilka','%1$s preview (%2$d px)'=>'Horu-aragga %1$s (%2$d px)','Studio toolbar'=>'Baarka qalabka istuudiyaha','Back to the normal editor'=>'Ku noqo tifaftiraha caadiga ah','Page title'=>'Cinwaanka bogga','Preview width'=>'Ballaadhka horu-eegista','Command palette'=>'Xulashada amarrada','View page (opens in a new tab)'=>'Eeg bogga (wuxuu ku furmayaa tab cusub)','Save draft'=>'Keydi qabyaladda','Publish'=>'Daapaca','Restore unsaved changes?'=>'Dib ma u soo celisaa wax ka beddelka aan la keydin?','This page has changes that were never saved. They were kept in this browser:'=>'Boggan waxa ku jira isbeddello aan waligood la keydin. Waxaa lagu hayay biraawsarkan:','This page has a newer autosave than the saved version:'=>'Boggani wuxuu leeyahay si-toos-u-kaydin ka cusub nooca la kaydiyay:','Restore unsaved changes'=>'Soo celi isbeddellada aan la kaydin','Discard'=>'Tuur','Revisions could not be loaded.'=>'Dib-u-eegisyada lama soo geli karin.','Revision restored. Save to keep it, or undo to go back.'=>'Dib-u-eegistii waa la soo celiyay. Keydi si aad u haysato, ama ka noqo si aad dib ugu noqoto.','Close revisions'=>'Xir dib-u-eegisyada','No revisions yet. Each save makes one.'=>'Weli dib-u-eegis ma jirto. Keydin kasta mid ayaa la sameeyaa.','Revision from %s'=>'Dib-u-eegista ka timid %s','Restore this revision'=>'Soo celi dib-u-eegiddan','Safe mode could not be changed.'=>'Habka bedbaadada lama beddeli karin.','Safe mode is on.'=>'Habka bedbaadada waa furan yahay.','%d other plugin is switched off, for you and in Sandwich Studio only. The live site and other users are not affected.'=>'%d plugin kale ayaa la damiyay, adiga kaliya iyo gudaha Sandwich Studio oo kaliya. Goovha tooska ah iyo isticmaalayaasha kale ma saameynayso.' . "\0" . '%d fur-bixiyeyaal kale ayaa loo damiyay adiga iyo Sandwich Studio gudaheeda oo keliya. Goobta tooska ah iyo isticmaaleyaasha kale ma saamayso.','Safe mode: switch other plugins off in Studio, for you only'=>'Habka bedqabka: ku demi furayaasha kale Studio gudaheeda, adiga kaliya','Save as pattern'=>'U kaydi qaab ahaan','Synced'=>'Waa la waafajiyay','Editing the pattern later changes it everywhere it is used.'=>'Wax ka beddelka qaabka hadhow wuxuu ka beddelayaa meel kasta oo laga isticmaalo.','Each copy can be edited on its own.'=>'Nuqul kasta si gaar ah ayaa loo tafatiri karaa.','Save your changes.'=>'Kaydi isbeddelladaada.','Undo your last change.'=>'Ka noqo isbeddelkaagii ugu dambeeyay.','Redo your last undo.'=>'Dib u samee waxaad ugu dambaysay ee aad ka noqotay.','Show or hide the layers panel.'=>'Muuji ama qari muraayadda lakabyada.','Display these keyboard shortcuts.'=>'Muuji toobiyeyaashan kiiboodhka.','Select a block first.'=>'Marka hore dooro baloog.','Style copied. Paste it onto any block, on this site or another.'=>'Qaabka waa la koobiyeeyay. Ku dhaji baloog kasta, boggan ama mid kale.','The browser refused to copy.'=>'Biroowsarku wuu diiday inuu koobiyeeyo.','Section copied. Paste it into any page, on this site or another.'=>'Qaybta waa la koobiyey. Ku dheji bog kasta, boggan ama mid kale.','The clipboard does not hold a style copied from Sandwich Studio.'=>'Klipboodhka kuma jiro qaab laga soo guuriyay Sandwich Studio.','Style pasted onto %d block.'=>'Habka waxa lagu dhajiyay %d baloog.' . "\0" . 'Qaabka waxaa lagu dhajiyay %d baloog.','That style does not fit the selected block.'=>'Qaabkaasi kuma habboona baloogga la doortay.','The clipboard does not hold a copied section.'=>'Klipboodhku kuma jiro qayb la koobiyeeyay.','Section pasted.'=>'Qaybta waa la dhajiyay.','Paste style'=>'Dheji qaabka','Paste section'=>'Dheji qaybta','Press Ctrl+V (or Cmd+V on a Mac) here to paste'=>'Guji Ctrl+V (ama Cmd+V marka aad Mac isticmaalayso) halkan si aad u dhejiso','Copy style'=>'Koobiye qaabka','Copy section'=>'Koobi qaybta','Edit in Sandwich Studio'=>'Ku wax ka beddel Sandwich Studio','Saving failed. Check your connection and try again; your changes are kept in this browser.'=>'Kaydintu way fashilantay. Hubi khadkaaga oo mar kale isku day; isbeddelladaada waxaa lagu hayaa biraawsarkan.','Published.'=>'La daabacay.','Post types (none = any)'=>'Noocyada qoraalka (eber = mid kasta)','Posts or pages (type to search)'=>'Qoraallada ama boggaga (qor si aad u raadiso)','Terms (type to search)'=>'Erayada (qor si aad u raadiso)','Blog page'=>'Bogga baloogga','Author archives'=>'Kaydka qoraaga','Date archives'=>'Kaydka taariikhda','%s archives'=>'Kaydadka %s','%s archive'=>'Kaydka %s','Archives (none = any)'=>'Kaydka (waxba = mid kasta)','Visitors who are'=>'Soo-boqdayaasha ah','Logged in'=>'Gudaha ayaa lagu jiraa','Logged out'=>'Waa laga baxay','Roles'=>'Doorro','Until'=>'Ilaa','Sun'=>'Axa','Mon'=>'Isn','Tue'=>'Tal','Wed'=>'Arb','Thu'=>'Kham','Fri'=>'Jim','Sat'=>'Sab','Parameter'=>'Halbeeg','Value (empty = any)'=>'Qiimaha (maran = wax kasta)','Came from an address containing (empty = typed in directly)'=>'Waxay ka timid cinwaan ay ku jiraan (eber = toos loo qoray)','The cart'=>'Gaadhiga wax-iibsigga','Has items'=>'Waxay leedahay waxyaabo','Is empty'=>'Waa eber','Contains a product'=>'Waxaa ku jira badeeco','Contains a product from a category'=>'Waxaa ku jira badeecad ka s