qdaan','Pre-launch: a notice, and search engines are told not to index the site'=>'Bilaabista ka hor: ogeysiis, waxaana matoorada raadinta loo sheegay inaysan tusmeynin bogga','Page to show instead'=>'Bogga la muujinayo beddelkeeda','Design any page with the builder and choose it here. Without one, visitors see a short notice with the site’s name.'=>'Ku naqshadee bog kasta dhisaha oo halkan ka dooro. La\'aanteed, booqdayaashu waxay arkayaan ogeysiis gaaban oo ay ku qoran tahay magaca bogga.','Who still sees the real site (administrators always do):'=>'Yaa weli arka goobta dhabta ah (maamulayaashu had iyo jeer way arkaan):','Open the site in a private window to see what visitors see.'=>'Ku fur goobta daaqad gaar ah si aad u aragto waxa ay booqdayaashu arkaan.','Network settings saved.'=>'Habsocodka shabakadda waa la keydiyay.','These settings apply to the %d site in this network.'=>'Hagaajintani waxay khuseysaa goobta %d ee shabakaddan.' . "\0" . 'Hagaajintani waxay khusaysaa %d-ka bog ee ku jira shabakaddan.','Shared templates'=>'Qaababka la wadaago','Patterns saved on the main site that are ticked here appear on every site, under “Network templates”. Each site inserts its own copy.'=>'Qaababka lagu keydiyay barta ugu weyn ee halkan lagu saxay waxay ka soo muuqanayaan bar kasta, hoosta "Qaababka shabakadda". Bar kasta waxay gelisaa nuqul u gaar ah.','The main site has no saved patterns yet.'=>'Bogga weyn weli ma laha qaabab la keydiyay.','White label for every site'=>'Sumad gaar ah (White label) goob kasta','Used by every site that has not saved its own white-label settings.'=>'Waxaa adeegsada goob kasta oo aan keydinin goobahooda u gaarka ah ee white-label.','Turn white label on'=>'Shid summadda cad','Builder name'=>'Magaca dhisihii','Visual editor name'=>'Magaca tifaftiraha muuqaalka ah','Author website'=>'Websaytka qoraaga','Menu icon'=>'Astaanta liiska','Role defaults for every site'=>'Doorka caadiga ah ee bog kasta','Save network settings'=>'Keydi habaynta shabakadda','Searching… %d item checked so far.'=>'Baadhaya… %d shay ayaa ilaa hadda la hubiyay.' . "\0" . 'Waa la raadinayaa… %d shay ayaa la hubiyay ilaa hadda.','No matches in %d items. Nothing to replace.'=>'Wax u dhigma lagama helin %d shay. Wax la beddelo ma jiraan.','%1$d matches on %2$d pages (%3$d items searched). Nothing has changed yet.'=>'%1$d is-u-ekaansho oo ku jira %2$d bogag (%3$d shay ayaa la baaray). Waxba weli isma beddelin.','Replacing… %1$d of %2$d pages done.'=>'Waa la beddelayaa… %1$d ka mid ah %2$d bog ayaa la dhammeeyay.','Done: %d page changed. You can undo this.'=>'Waa la dhammeeyay: %d bog ayaa la beddelay. Waad ka noqon kartaa tan.' . "\0" . 'Waa la dhammeeyay: %d bogag ayaa la beddelay. Waad ka noqon kartaa tan.','Undoing…'=>'Waa la noqonayaa…','Undone: %1$d pages restored. %2$d pages were edited after the replacement and were left as they are.'=>'Laga noqday: %1$d bogag ayaa dib loo soo celiyay. %2$d bogag wax laga beddelay beddelka ka dib, waxaana loo daayay sida ay yihiin.','Undone: %d page restored.'=>'Laga noqday: %d bog dib ayaa loo soo celiyay.' . "\0" . 'Laga noqday: %d bogag ayaa dib loo soo celiyay.','Replace'=>'Beddel','Find'=>'Raadi','A hex colour such as #1a73e8. Short forms (#fff) match too.'=>'Midab hex ah sida #1a73e8. Qaababka gaagaaban (#fff) sidoo kale waa la helayaa.','Replace with'=>'Ku beddel','Match upper and lower case'=>'Waafaji xarfaha waaweyn iyo kuwa yaryar','Find matches'=>'Hel kuwa u dhigma','Matches'=>'Isku-eekaanshaha','Replace on %d page'=>'Ku beddel %d bog' . "\0" . 'Ku beddel %d bogag ah','Undo this replacement'=>'Ka noqo beddelkan','Review comments'=>'Dib u eeg faallooyinka','Add a comment'=>'Ku dar faallo','Comment %1$d by %2$s: %3$s'=>'Faallada %1$d ee %2$s: %3$s','%d comments on this page.'=>'%d faallo oo ku yaal boggan.','Your comment'=>'Faalladaada','Send comment'=>'Dir faallada','Thank you, your comment was sent.'=>'Waad mahadsan tahay, faalladaada waa la diray.','Click the part of the page your comment is about.'=>'Guji qaybta bogga ee faalladaadu ku saabsan tahay.','Client review'=>'Dib u eegista macmiilka','That part of the page could not be found: it may have been changed or removed since the comment was made.'=>'Qaybtaas bogga lama heli karin: waxaa laga yaabaa in la beddelay ama la saaray tan iyo markii faallada la dhiibtay.','Review link'=>'Dib u eeg xiriirka','Let a client comment on this page'=>'U oggolow macmiilka inuu faallo ku reebo boggan','Anyone with the link can see this page, even before it is published, and leave comments. No account is needed.'=>'Qof kasta oo haysta xiriiriyaha wuxuu arki karaa boggan, xitaa ka hor inta aan la daabicin, wuuna ka tagi karaa faallooyin. Xisaab looma baahna.','Make a new link (the old one stops working)'=>'Samee xiriiriye cusub (kii hore wuu joojinayaa shaqada)','Comments (%d open)'=>'Faallooyinka (%d furan)' . "\0" . 'Faallooyin (%d furan)','Show resolved comments'=>'Muuji faallooyinka la xalliyay','No comments to show.'=>'Ma jiraan faallooyin la muujiyo.','Reply'=>'Ka jawaab','Send reply'=>'Dir jawaabta','Show in the editor'=>'Ku muuji tifaftiraha dhexdiisa','Resolve'=>'Xalli','Reopen'=>'Dib u fur','Open Sandwich Studio'=>'Fur Sandwich Studio','Change styles'=>'Beddel qaababka','Custom CSS and HTML'=>'CSS iyo HTML Gaar ah','Manage templates'=>'Maamul qaababka','Use AI'=>'Isticmaal AI','Client mode: text and images only'=>'Qaabka macmiilka: qoraal iyo sawirro keliya','Role settings saved.'=>'Habsocodka doorka waa la keydiyay.','Roles and client mode'=>'Doorarka iyo habka macmiilka','Choose what each role can do in the builder. Administrators can always do everything. Client mode locks the layout and design, so the role can only change text and images.'=>'Dooro waxa door kastaa ka qaban karo dhisaha dhexdiisa. Maamulayaashu mar walba wax walba way samayn karaan. Habka macmiilku wuxuu xiraa qaabka iyo naqshadda, markaa doorku wuxuu beddeli karaa qoraalka iyo sawirrada oo keliya.','Save role settings'=>'Kaydi habaynta doorka','Saved. Reload the page to see the new names.'=>'Waa la keydiyay. Dib u soo geli bogga si aad u aragto magacyada cusub.','Rename the builder and hide our branding on this site'=>'Magaca ka beddel dhisaha oo ku qari astaantayada boggan','Shown everywhere the product name appears: menus, the editor, notices.'=>'Lagu muujiyay meel kasta oo magaca badeecadu ka soo muuqdo: liisaska, tifaftiraha, ogeysiisyada.','Leave empty to use the builder name.'=>'Faaruq uga tag si aad u isticmaasho magaca dhisaha.','Description on the Plugins screen'=>'Sharaxaadda ku taal shaashadda Furayaasha (Plugins)','A Dashicons name (for example dashicons-admin-customizer) or an https:// image address.'=>'Magac Dashicons ah (tusaale ahaan dashicons-admin-customizer) ama cinwaanka sawirka https://.','Hide the plugin from the Plugins screen'=>'Ka qari fur-haliyeha shaashadda Fur-haliyeyaasha','Agency users who still see the real product and these settings'=>'Isticmaalayaasha wakaaladda ee weli arka badeecada dhabta ah iyo habaynnadan','%d new'=>'%d cusub' . "\0" . '%d cusub','%d replaced'=>'%d la beddelay' . "\0" . '%d la beddelay','%d kept as they were'=>'%d sidooda ayaa loo daayay' . "\0" . '%d sidooda ayaa loo daayay','%d setting'=>'%d habayn' . "\0" . '%d habayn','Importing will give: %s.'=>'Soo dejintu waxay keenaysaa: %s.','Imported: %s.'=>'La soo dhoofiyay: %s.','Exported %d item.'=>'Waxaa la dhoofiyay %d shay.' . "\0" . 'Waxaa la dhoofiyay %d shay.','That file could not be read as an export file.'=>'Faylkaas looma akhrin karin sidii fayl dhoofin ah.','Export'=>'Dhoofi','Download your templates, patterns and site design as one file, to import on another site.'=>'U soo deji qaababkaaga, qaababka naqshadda iyo naqshadda goobtaada hal fayl ahaan, si aad ugu dhoofsato goob kale.','There are no templates or patterns to export yet.'=>'Weli ma jiraan qaabab ama naqshado la dhoofiyo.','Include the settings'=>'Ku dar dejinta','Download the export file'=>'Soo deji faylka dhoofinta','Choose an export file'=>'Dooro faylka dhoofinta','The file holds %1$d item from %2$s.'=>'Faylku waxa uu ka kooban yahay %1$d shay oo ka yimid %2$s.' . "\0" . 'Faylku waxa uu ka kooban yahay %1$d shay oo laga keenay %2$s.','When an item with the same name already exists here'=>'Marka shay magacan oo kale wata uu horey halkan ugu jiray','Keep the one on this site'=>'Haysasho kan ku jira goobtan','Replace it with the imported one'=>'Ku beddel kan la soo dejiyay','Import a copy beside it'=>'Nuqul ku soo dhoofso dhinaciisa','Apply the settings in the file'=>'Dhaqan geli habaynta ku jirta faylka','Copy the images into this site’s media library'=>'Ku koobiyeey sawirrada maktabadda warbaahinta ee boggan','Show what will happen'=>'Muuji waxa dhici doona','block titleAccordion item'=>'Shayga akordhanka','block descriptionOne section of an accordion: a title that opens its content.'=>'Qayb ka mid ah akordiyoonka: ciwaan furaya nuxurkiisa.','block titleAccordion'=>'Isku-laabme','block descriptionQuestions or sections that open and close. Optionally one at a time, and optionally marked up as an FAQ for search engines.'=>'Su\'aalo ama qaybo furma oo xidhma. Ikhtiyaar ahaan mid markiiba, iyo ikhtiyaar ahaan loo calaamadeeyay sidii Su\'aalaha Badanaa La Isweydiiyo (FAQ) ee matoorada raadinta.','block keywordaccordion'=>'akordiyon','block keywordfaq'=>'Su\'aalaha Badanaa La Isweydiiyo','block keywordtoggle'=>'Beddel','block keywordcollapse'=>'Laab','block keyworddetails'=>'faahfaahin','block titleAlert'=>'Digniin','block descriptionA notice for your visitors: information, success, a warning or an error, with an optional title and a close button.'=>'Ogeysiis loogu talagalay booqdayaashaada: macluumaad, guul, digniin ama khalad, oo leh cinwaan ikhtiyaari ah iyo badhanka xiritaanka.','block keywordnotice'=>'Ogeysiis','block keywordmessage'=>'fariin','block keywordcallout'=>'Xusuusin Gaar ah','block keywordwarning'=>'Digniin','block titleBadge'=>'Summad','block description